window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4001,"title":"Chapter 4001 Well, That’s A Scumbag (5)","paragraphs":["4001 Well, That’s A Scumbag (5)","Huang Yueli had already prepared herself to guess her true identity, but she didn’t expect that Xuan Qingling would guess in such a crooked direction and she was stunned for a moment.","Xuan Qingling’s eyes immediately changed when she saw her, “You... you are actually a demon! How did you sneak into the territory of the human race? Why can’t you feel the breath of the demon race on your body? Why? Young Master Li is so courageous that he dares to be with a demoness!”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect that she could make up so much in her own brain in such a short period of time, and she couldn’t laugh or cry for a while.","“Wait, wait! Young Miss Xuan, don’t be so excited, listen to me...”","“You don’t need to tell me! Although you are my savior, I can’t join forces with the demons! I won’t reveal your identity, but we still better not communicate anymore!”","Seeing that she was about to turn around and leave in a panic, Huang Yueli quickly stopped her.","“Young Miss Xuan, you really guessed wrong! I’m really not a demon! Can you listen to me?”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but let out a loud roar before calming Xuan Qingling down.","However, Xuan Qingling looked at her with suspicion.","“Are you really not a demon? But, your talent is so heaven-defying! You and Young Master Li are both god-level geniuses! This is too rare and unbelievable! Besides, if you are not a demon, why don’t you dare?” Show your true colors to others and dare not reveal them to Young Master Li? This doesn’t even make sense!”","Huang Yueli knew that it would not be so easy to clear up Xuan Qingling’s misunderstanding. The best way was to disclose her true identity to her.","After thinking about it for a while, she decided to tell the truth, “Young Miss Xuan, let me tell you the truth. I am indeed not from a demon clan, but an ancient god clan! However, the Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely not agree to my marriage with Moying. Because my clan has a blood feud with the Cloudy Qilin Clan...”","“How is that possible? If you were the ancient gods, wouldn’t the Cloudy Qilin Clan be so happy? Would you still not agree?” Xuan Qingling looked suspicious, and then seemed to think of something, “Wait, you are a fire-attribute... god level genius, ancient god clan... Are you from the Sacred Phoenix Clan??”","Seeing that she finally understood, Huang Yueli secretly breathed a sigh of relief, and nodded, “Well, I am indeed from the Sacred Phoenix Clan.”","“But, why don’t you have the aura of the God Clan?” Xuan Qingling asked strangely.","The biggest difference between the Ancient God and the ordinary human race is that their blood has a certain amount of blood essence from the Ancient God.","This kind of essence and blood is not comparable to the essence and blood on Little Wang Cai’s body.","A phoenix like Little Wang Cai is said to be an ancient divine beast, but to be precise, it can only be said to be a descendant of the ancient Sacred Phoenix.","The real ancient Sacred Phoenix, since the beginning of the world, among countless planes, there has only been one.","The same goes for other ancient mythical beasts.","And the current gods and beasts were different ways of continuing the bloodline of the only one.","And the innate bloodlines of the Ancient God higher than that of the ordinary human race also came from this.","This kind of bloodline makes their profound strength and exhaled aura somewhat different from ordinary cultivators, and it is easy for experienced strongmen to distinguish the difference between the two.","Huang Yueli didn’t have the aura of the ancient gods at all. Because of this, Xuan Qingling always thought that she was a pure-blooded human."]},{"number":4002,"title":"Chapter 4002 Well, That’s A Scumbag (6)","paragraphs":["4002 Well, That’s A Scumbag (6)","Huang Yueli smiled, and explained: “Because I have some special techniques that can hide my divine aura.”","As she spoke, she let go of Sky Phoenix Ring’s first layer of restraint, and released her true profound strength.","Xuan Qingling immediately felt a little uncomfortable.","Although the Black Tortoise Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan don’t have any enmity, but the attributes of the two were incompatible, and they usually take the initiative to keep a little distance.","However, these Xuan Qinglings also fully understood.","“You really belong to the Sacred Phoenix Clan! My God, your concealment technique is too amazing, right? I lived with you for several days, and I didn’t notice it at all!”","Huang Yueli smiled and said: “It’s not surprising that you don’t notice it, even the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s many Dao Profound Realm powerhouses don’t know my real identity. Otherwise, Moying and I would probably be wandering around the world by now. If we leave, how can we go to participate in some God Realm’s Grand Meet?”","Xuan Qingling looked at Huang Yueli in disbelief, unable to recover for a long time.","Even with the evidence in front of her eyes, it took her a long time to digest the news.","After all, this news was simply too shocking!","The only two god-level geniuses in the God Realm were actually husband and wife, and they also come from two clans that were hostile to each other...","If she hadn’t seen Huang Yueli and Li Moying with her own eyes, she would never have believed that such a thing would happen!","“By the way, I remembered! A while ago, Young Master Li was attacked by Elder Sanbai of the Sacred Phoenix Clan and fell into a coma for more than a month. At that time, there were many rumors in the God Realm. Some people said that Young Master Li had attacked and killed the god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan which led to Elder Sanbai’s revenge... This god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan that they were talking about is you, is it?”","Hearing Xuan Qingling mention this matter, Huang Yueli’s face suddenly darkened.","However, she did not show any strangeness in front of Xuan Qingling, she just said: “That’s right, there is a bit of misunderstanding between the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan...”","“What’s the misunderstanding?” Xuan Qingling shook her head.","Huang Yueli said it implicitly, but Xuan Qingling grew up in the God Realm, and she knows the history and nature of the two families better than Huang Yueli, an authentic member of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","“There will be troubles between these two families if nothing happens. If the major gods had not made a covenant to deal with the demons together, I am afraid that these two families are still attacking each other! Are you really killed by Young Master Li? That’s not the point, it’s enough to have a reason to attack each other anyway!”","Xuan Qinling sighed: “Oh, you guys are too unlucky! It’s already very difficult for a god-level genius to find a match. It’s hard to find them, but they are in a hostile relationship...”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli felt even more helpless.","Even foreigners like Xuan Qingling know that the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan were incompatible, so they don’t like her and Li Moying together...","Even though she didn’t pay attention to those so-called clansmen, she couldn’t help feeling a little depressed.","The two talked for a while.","Huang Yueli briefly explained, but did not tell anything about the matter between her and Huang Sanbai.","“Young Miss Xuan, this is the case with Moying, please keep it a secret for us.” She finally urged.","Xuan Qingling nodded hastily, “Alright, I know, I will definitely keep it a secret, please rest assured!”","As she said that, she showed a bit of envy again, “I really envy you and Young Master Li, who can find someone who loves each other.”"]},{"number":4003,"title":"Chapter 4003 Floating Sea (1)","paragraphs":["4003 Floating Sea (1)","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows, looked at her, and said meaningfully: “Don’t worry, Young Miss Xuan, you are so outstanding, there will definitely be someone who truly appreciates you.”","Xuan Qingling shook her head, looking a little depressed.","“I’m afraid it’s impossible. For the children of our ancient gods, marriage depends on talent and blood, and has nothing to do with feelings. They have to obey the orders of the clan. Only you and Young Master Li, who are so talented, dare to marry and are not bound by the clan.”","Huang Yueli was slightly taken aback, and suddenly thought of those women that Li Shihong desperately stuffed for Li Moying.","What’s so great about the ancient gods?","Fortunately, she abducted her husband and left!","After this day, Xuan Qingling knew the real identities of Huang Yueli and Li Moying, and became more cautious.","Normally, whenever she sees Li Moying coming to look for Huang Yueli, she will take the initiative to avoid it.","Even if Liu Buyan wanted to make trouble with Li Moying, she would hold him back.","Seeing this, Li Moying was extremely satisfied with Xuan Qingling.","“Little Li’er, I think your suggestion last time was good. Liu Buyan should find such a sensible wife! Or, let’s give them both some medicine and lock them up in the cabin together.”","Li Moying held her little fox in her arms, and came up with evil ideas.","Huang Yueli glared at him, “Don’t be like this, Young Miss Xuan is very traditional and shy! Let them develop naturally.”","After speeding up for a few days, the airship finally approached the Floating Sea.","It was the first time for Huang Yueli, Li Moying and Liu Buyan to the Floating Sea. The three of them sat on the airship and saw the huge water ball floating in the air from a distance, and they all showed a bit of shock.","Xuan Qingling had been here several times, and introduced at the side: “It is said that the Floating Sea is not in the sky, but a large expanse of ocean on the ground, which is located in the swamp area where the demons live. At that time, the world of the God Realm profound energy was even more abundant than it is now, and the number of masters at the Profound Realm of Gods and Demons was ten times as many as it is now, and they have been fighting for years. In one big battle, more than a dozen masters at the Life Profound Realm fought at the same time. I heard that there are also Profound Realm experts above the mentioned true gods! The aroused profound energy fluctuations rushed the entire ocean into the sky!”","“In that battle, at least ten people at the Life Profound Realm lost their lives, and the demons suffered even more heavy losses. It can be said to be one of the most tragic battles in the history of the God Realm.”","“Later, this vast ocean floated in the sky and became a floating sea...”","“There is a small island hanging in the sky, and there are many sacred places on it. Every God Realm’s Grand Meet is held there. This is also a kind of commemoration of the God Realm for those who died in that battle... ...”","Huang Yueli had also read about this period of history in classics, but seeing the grand scene of the sea floating in the air with her own eyes was still deeply shocking and she was filled with emotion.","To push such a large expanse of ocean into the sky, and the vortex of profound energy that was stirred up, lasting for hundreds of thousands of years and the energy in it was not exhausted.","This was almost beyond what humans can do!","This was the realm of the true gods...","Then, hundreds of thousands of years ago, when the Floating Sea was born, were there any true gods in the God Realm?","If so, what should their strength be like?","Should be stronger than the current Life Profound Realm powerhouse, right?","Where were these people now?"]},{"number":4004,"title":"Chapter 4004 Floating Sea (2)","paragraphs":["4004 Floating Sea (2)","Li Moying’s airship gradually approached the Floating Sea, and the small island below became clear.","After the airship landed, Xuan Qingling bade farewell to them and reunited with her clansmen.","Li Moying took Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan directly to the registration site for the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","The three of them followed the instructions on the street and walked near the registration point, and were immediately shocked.","“Whoa! There are so many people signing up! There must be 10,000 people in this crazy crowd that looks like one big dark mass, right?” This was the first time Liu Buyan saw so many people gather after arriving in the God Realm and he did not feel too well.","Huang Yueli was even more speechless than him, “This is just one of the registration points. I looked at the map just now, and there are at least a hundred such registration points! In other words, there are at least one million cultivators who are signing up to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. This is only the number of people who signed up today, before we came, the registration had already started over ten days ago!”","Liu Buyan felt that he was going to faint, “There are so many cultivators... I think it’s impossible for me to get a ranking...”","Huang Yueli didn’t take it seriously.","No matter how many cultivators participate, most of them were just cannon fodder. It is estimated that 99% of them will be screened out in the first round.","These ordinary cultivators came to Floating Sea not so much to gain a place in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, but rather to observe the competition between the geniuses of the ancient God Clans.","After all, these peerless geniuses rarely appear in front of ordinary people, and ordinary people have no other chance to understand their strength.","This time the God Realm’s Grand Meet can be said to be a grand event in the entire God Realm!","Huang Yueli turned her head to look at Li Moying, “Moying, why don’t you go to the Cloudy Qilin Clan first, there are so many people here, I don’t know how long the queue will be...”","Li Moying shook his head, “I’ll be with you. Do you think I’ll rest assured that you’re here alone in line?”","Huang Yueli muttered: “I’m not a child, are you still afraid that I might get lost?”","Having said that, she obediently let Li Moying hold her little hand, and lined up together like a child.","Liu Buyan glanced at them, scolded them in his heart and consciously moved to another line.","The registration line looked long, but the speed of the line moving was quite fast.","After about three hours, they were at the front of the line.","“Take a form and fill it out yourself! Fill it out and hand it to the front. Remember, name, power, age, cultivation base, these are required, and others are optional. What I want to remind you is that you must never falsely report your age! Wait a moment and there will be a Dao Profound Realm expert at the front of the team to verify your bone age. If someone intentionally reports your age as young and wants to get involved in the competition, we will immediately expel them! This is Floating Sea! Do you understand?”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying each took a form, filled it out in a hurry, and handed it to an elderly man in front.","The old man looked down, and said casually, “Name: Li Moying, Influence: Cloudy Qilin Clan, Age: 24 years old, cultivation...Late stage of the Heart Profound Realm?”","The old man was originally looking at the form casually, but when he saw the end, his eyes suddenly widened, and he almost couldn’t help crying out.","He looked up at Li Moying’s handsome but expressionless face, “You, you, you... are you sure you did not make a mistake?”"]},{"number":4005,"title":"Chapter 4005 Floating Sea (3)","paragraphs":["4005 Floating Sea (3)","Li Moying said calmly: “No.”","“But...how is this possible? At the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm at the age of twenty-four, I have never heard of such a thing. Even the heavenly geniuses of the Ancient God Clans, there is no one who can achieve this at such a young age. It’s the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm that we’re talking about! You’re bragging and you don’t even think with your brains?” The old man frowned, not believing it at all.","Li Moying glanced at him impatiently, “This is my real situation.”","“Tsk, why are young people like this now? Your lies have been exposed and you still don’t know how to repent! Didn’t you listen to what I just said? All contestants must fill in the real situation! If you lie, I can expel you from the Floating Sea ! Seeing that you are still young, it is not easy, hurry up and take it back and refill it!”","The old man refused to accept Li Moying’s registration form, so he threw it back and waved his hand, telling him to leave quickly.","“Hurry up, don’t block here, don’t you see that there are so many people queuing up behind you?”","Li Moying obviously didn’t expect that he would be denied registration after he just signed up, and his expression turned extremely ugly.","Huang Yueli watched from the side, and almost couldn’t help laughing.","High talents also have the troubles of high talents, yet some people still don’t believe it!","After the old man threw the registration form back to Li Moying, he looked at Huang Yueli behind him.","Because Huang Yueli was very beautiful and was always smiling, she looked very pleasing to the eye, so the old man had a very good impression of her.","The anger he felt when he met a “liar” just now has also weakened a bit.","“This lady, where is your registration form?”","Just as Huang Yueli was about to hand over the form in her hand, she suddenly found that her husband was staring at her, and even curled the corners of his mouth. A monstrous smile appeared on that handsome face.","Huang Yue’s heart skipped a beat, and when she handed over the form, she suddenly realized that something was wrong.","But, it was already too late.","The old man who received the form saw clearly what Huang Yueli had filled in on the form, and couldn’t help but rage!","“I really ran into a ghost today! It turned out to be another nonsensical registration form and it turned out to be such a young girl! What are young people thinking now? Does everyone treat old people like us as fools? Eighteen years old in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm! Why didn’t you just say that you have the strength of the Dao Profound Realm?”","Huang Yueli curled her lips, and murmured subconsciously: “Well, I do have the strength of the Dao Profound Realm, does that count?”","Ordinary Dao Profound Realm fighters, she can fight ten, alright?","Although the old man was covered with white hair and seemed to be too old to walk, his hearing was surprisingly good, and he could even hear Huang Yueli’s murmurs.","This way, he almost exploded in anger.","“You, you, you... You really have the face to say it! Are you two together? Are you still so confident, do you usually bluff and deceive too many times outside, and think that we people in Floating Sea are also so stupid? Unless you are all god-level geniuses!”","“However, this is absolutely impossible!”","Because the old man was very angry, his voice became louder and louder.","The cultivators around the registration office were already crowded together, so they naturally heard the content of the dispute between the two sides.","Many cultivators immediately laughed out loud.","“I’ve gained a lot of experience today, and someone actually falsely reported their cultivation!”"]},{"number":4006,"title":"Chapter 4006 Floating Sea (4)","paragraphs":["4006 Floating Sea (4)","“Isn’t it? I almost laughed to death! Twenty-four years old at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, eighteen years old at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm?! Who would believe this kind of nonsense? Could it be that they’ve been dreaming too much and really think that they’re god-level genius?”","“Hahaha, what god-level geniuses, I don’t think they are even earth-level geniuses, right? Otherwise, why come back here and join us in queuing up to sign up?”","Contestants of such a powerful force as the Ancient God Clans actually don’t need to go to the registration point to fill out the form at all, but the family will register uniformly.","However, this time, Huang Yueli has her own plans and goals, and she doesn’t want to represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the battle.","As for Li Moying, he only came here to accompany his wife.","But in the eyes of ordinary people, this was completely unreasonable.","If they were really two god-level geniuses, would they come here to line up together if they had such strength?","Therefore, everyone believed without hesitation that these two people were here to deceive people.","There were even kind-hearted people who persuaded them.","“Let me say, the two of you seem to be good-looking talents. I guess they still have some strength. Why don’t you just fill in the truth? Why do you have to tell such a lie?”","“To tell you the truth, filling your cultivation base too high will not only be of no benefit to you, but also a lot of disadvantages! Many geniuses of great powers are staring at geniuses of the same level to challenge. He is the first to challenge you, do you think you can bear it? That is a top-level genius cultivated by the Ancient God Clans!”","“That’s right. People are a bit vain, and I understand that they want to report a higher level of cultivation, but you are reporting too much, right? Hurry up and change it! Or else if you really make the steward of Floating Sea angry, you will really be expelled!”","Everyone talked and tried to persuade them.","Li Moying remained expressionless, but Huang Yueli could tell that her husband was becoming more and more impatient.","If this goes on like this, if her husband gets mad later, things will get serious.","In desperation, she began to think about it, so she might as well lower her cultivation base a bit!","However, according to the rules of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, in the first round of the preliminary round, fighters will be grouped according to their cultivation and strength, so contestants are not allowed to underestimate. If exposed in this way, they will also be punished and even disqualified from the competition.","Huang Yueli was almost depressed to death.","“What’s the matter? Why is it so difficult to tell the truth these days?”","Seeing so many people persuading the old man, yet Huang Yueli and Li Moying were still so stubborn, he almost died of anger.","He slapped the table vigorously, “You two...Since you are so unrepentant, then on behalf of Floating Sea, I will send you...”","“Elder Chen, why is there such a ruckus over here? Just now, the cultivators behind were all asking if there’s anything wrong as your line hasn’t moved forward for a long time?”","A middle-aged man in a blue robe walked over and asked suspiciously.","Elder Chen was very angry, “Oh, I really met the best today! Just now, two cultivators came to my place to sign up, and the information they filled in was simply... simply unsightly! You can take a look at it for yourself!”","Elder Chen threw the registration forms of Li Moying and Huang Yueli on the table.","The middle-aged man looked at him suspiciously, and reached out to pick up the form."]},{"number":4007,"title":"Chapter 4007 Floating Sea (5)","paragraphs":["4007 Floating Sea (5)","At first, he was quite unimpressed.","It’s just two registration forms. Even if there is a problem, how big a problem can there be?","Was it worth being so surprised?","However, after a few random glances, the middle-aged man suddenly shook his hands and widened his eyes, “This...”","Elder Chen said heartbrokenly at the side: “Did you see it too? Some people actually wrote such an outrageous description on their cultivation bases! Deceiving people is already a matter of morality, and if you deceive people so exaggeratedly, then you have a bad brain. What’s even worse is that I’ve already given them a chance to fill in again, but they still refuse to change it! They’re hopeless!”","The middle-aged man looked at the form in his hand as if he hadn’t heard what he said, and then looked up at Li Moying carefully.","After complaining a lot, Elder Chen concluded: “Such scum, we can’t let them appear in the arena of God Realm’s Grand Meet, otherwise, it would be too unfair! According to the rules, these two people must be expelled. Moreover, in the future...”","“You are... Young Master Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?” The middle-aged man walked up to Li Moying and spoke suddenly.","At first, Elder Chen was excited, but he didn’t expect that his colleague would walk away suddenly, and talk to the “scum” in his eyes with an almost respectful attitude.","Elder Chen was stunned for a moment, and asked strangely: “Steward Jiang, what are you... talking about? Young Master Li?”","The middle-aged man waved his hand at him, but did not answer right away, but stared intently at Li Moying, waiting for his answer.","Li Moying nodded slightly, “I am Li Moying. Do you know me?”","Surprise flashed in the eyes of the middle-aged man, “It’s really Young Master Li! This is really... No wonder you filled out the form like this! I went to Cloudy Qilin Clan last year and heard about you. It is an honor for all the cultivators in Floating Sea for you to participate in this God Realm’s Grand Meet!”","Li Moying said indifferently: “Your Excellency, you are welcome.”","Seeing his indifferent expression, the middle-aged man thought he was still unhappy, so he quickly explained, “Young Master Li, it was a misunderstanding just now, Elder Chen is old, and he hasn’t left Floating Sea for more than ten years. He doesn’t know many things in the world, so he didn’t recognize you. If you offend him, please don’t argue with him.”","The more Elder Chen heard it, the more he felt something was wrong.","What’s going on? Shouldn’t Steward Jiang be on his side?","Why didn’t he denounce the two liars in front of him, but also started chatting with him?","Now he is still saying that he is wrong!","Did he make a mistake?","“Steward Jiang, what’s going on? Do you know this young man? Isn’t he a liar?”","The middle-aged man quickly gave him a look, signaling him to shut up.","“Elder Chen, stop talking! This Young Master Li is the current young master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! He is a real god-level talent! Not too long ago, he was still on the battlefield of the Demon Clan and killed a strong mid-phase Sky Devil ! He is definitely the number one among the younger generation of cultivators!”","“What... what??” Elder Chen’s eyes widened. He was so shocked by this heavy news that he couldn’t recover for a long time.","“How is it possible? There hasn’t been a god-level genius in the God Realm for 10,000 years. How could one suddenly appear? Are you sure he is... is...”","“I’m sure, of course I’m sure, this is well known in the Cloudy Qilin Continent!”"]},{"number":4008,"title":"Chapter 4008 Floating Sea (6)","paragraphs":["4008 Floating Sea (6)","“How is it possible? How could such a thing happen??”","Even though Steward Jiang had already made a guarantee, Elder Chen still couldn’t believe it.","And the cultivators who were watching around had completely exploded at this time.","“Li Moying of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! So he is Li Moying!! No wonder he dares to write that he is at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm!”","“Now that you’ve mentioned it, he really looks like Li Moying. According to rumors, Young Master Li is not only extremely talented, but also extremely handsome. Seeing him today, he really deserves his reputation!”","“Oh my god, I actually saw a living god-level genius with my own eyes! I am really lucky today!”","“Just now I thought he was lying! Now it seems that I am ignorant...”","Realizing Li Moying’s identity, all the cultivators present crowded towards this direction one after another, wanting to see for themselves what the legendary number one genius and number one handsome man in the God Realm looks like.","The people at the back of the line kept pushing forward, while the people in front who had handed in their forms were still pushing back, unwilling to leave.","The scene became extremely chaotic for a while.","“Enough! You are not allowed to squeeze any further! Everyone stand where you are, and if you don’t follow the order, your registration will be cancelled!”","Steward Jiang and Elder Chen yelled at them sharply, trying to maintain order, but the effect was very bad.","Being able to be so close to a god-level genius is, for many people, a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","Everyone was extremely curious about Li Moying.","It’s not something the two stewards can stop with a few words.","Seeing that the scene was getting more and more chaotic, Steward Jiang coughed hastily, “Alright, Young Master Li, I’d better personally escort you back to the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s residence! If you stay here any longer, we won’t be able to continue working. ”","Li Moying nodded and was about to leave.","But Elder Chen suddenly yelled again, “Wait a minute, wait! I still have a question.”","Steward Jiang paused, “What else is there, Elder Chen?”","Elder Chen looked at Li Moying, then at Huang Yueli beside him, his eyes were full of doubts.","“You said that the Cloudy Qilin Clan has a god-level genius, well, then he’s been settled! But, does it mean that the human race also has a god-level genius?”","Steward Jiang was taken aback, “What... do you mean? Why can’t I understand?”","Elder Chen pointed to another registration form, “As I said just now, I received two registration forms, not just one! This Young Master Li said that he is at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and this little lady is even more powerful, she said that she is only eighteen years old, but she has a cultivation level in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm! Then she must also be a god-level genius?”","“What? Is there such a thing?”","After hearing this, Steward Jiang hurriedly went to see the second form which Elder Chen mentioned.","After he recognized Li Moying just now, he was so excited that he didn’t even have time to look down.","Seeing this, he was stunned.","As expected, Elder Chen was right. The information filled out by the girl next to Li Moying was also very exaggerated.","If what’s written above is true, then she must also be a god-level talent, and I’m afraid her talent is even higher than Li Moying’s!","But how is this possible?","Steward Jiang couldn’t help frowning, “Strange, this is really strange! When I was traveling last year, I only heard of Young Master Li, a god-level genius, but I never heard of it. There is a second one! Besides, she looks like she is still a human race. This is impossible? Could it be...”"]},{"number":4009,"title":"Chapter 4009 Someone May Really Die! (1)","paragraphs":["4009 Someone May Really Die! (1)","Steward Jiang turned back and looked at the two of them suspiciously.","“Could it be...these two are liars?”","Elder Chen slapped his thigh vigorously, “You can also see the problem? As I said earlier, these two people seem unreliable! You say this young man is the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but what about this girl? It must be the Young Madam of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, right?”","Huang Yueli heard the words, and muttered amusedly: “My husband is the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so of course I am the Young Madam of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Do you still need to ask?”","When Elder Chen heard what she said, he was so angry that the top of his head was about to smoke.","“Shut up! You’re still talking nonsense here? She’s such a little girl, she’s pretty good-looking, how could she have such a bad character?”","“It’s you who should shut up!”","Li Moying, who had been silent all this time, suddenly spoke out.","You can scold him, but you can’t scold his little fox!","When Elder Chen and Steward Jiang heard the words, they were all taken aback, and looked at him.","After just one glance, he was frightened by his cold and gloomy gaze, and cold sweat broke out on his back.","I don’t know why, this young man is obviously only in his early twenties, but his aura is stronger than that of a Dao Profound Realm master who has been famous for many years!","He might not really be a god-level genius, right?","No, no, no, this is impossible!","Elder Chen was stunned by him for a while, but when he came back to his senses, he felt even more ashamed. After all, he was also at the Dao Profound Realm, but now he was shocked by a brat. How embarrassing it is to spread the word!","In order to save face, he couldn’t care less about anything else, and said loudly: “How dare you talk to the steward of Floating Sea like this! It’s crazy! The old man has already given you a chance, now you have to get out of Floating Sea by yourself, or I will call the guards to arrest people!”","“What? The guards are about to be dispatched!”","“This is a big mess!”","“What’s going on now? Is this Young Master Li from the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","“I don’t know? From what the two stewards said, it seems that he is a liar?”","“I’ll be damned, then this person is really brave enough! Even the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan dares to impersonate, does he not want to live?”","The cultivators present were discussing a lot, obviously confused by this yet another turning point.","They looked suspiciously at Li Moying and then at Huang Yueli. They really didn’t understand what happened.","Elder Chen threw a signal flare towards the sky, and then sneered: “The guards are coming soon, I will give you one last chance to get out of Floating Sea immediately. Otherwise... once you enter the prison of Floating Sea, things will be serious. It won’t be that simple anymore.”","Li Moying’s face became more and more gloomy.","Because this God Realm’s Grand Meet was very important to Huang Yueli, so he endured it all the time, not wanting to make a big deal out of it.","However, these people couldn’t understand human speech. Not only did they repeatedly question their identities, but the worst thing was, they actually scolded his Little Li’er!","He usually doesn’t dare to say harsh words to his wife, alright?","Seeing Li Moying’s profound energy fluctuate more and more violently, Huang Yueli knew that he was on the verge of eruption.","If those Floating Sea guards really dared to come, they would probably be severely injured by the furious Young Master Li and thrown into the sea below.","She quickly reached out and took Li Moying’s hand, “Husband, don’t be angry, I’ll tell them again...”","Although Li Moying thought it was useless, he never opposed her, so he didn’t say anything."]},{"number":4010,"title":"Chapter 4010 Someone May Really Die! (2)","paragraphs":["4010 Someone May Really Die! (2)","Huang Yueli walked up to Elder Chen, and said, “You two stewards, you keep saying that you don’t trust us. I don’t understand. As the stewards of Floating Sea, can you be so arbitrary? You haven’t formally tested us. How can you be so sure that we’ve filled in fake information?”","“Of course there is no need to say? Anyone with a brain knows it’s a fake!” Elder Chen said as a matter of course.","Huang Yueli sneered, “I see that you think you have brains, but you actually don’t have any!”","“You... What do you mean? You dare to insult the steward, have you eaten the guts of a bear?”","Elder Chen was so angry that his face was flushed red. He almost couldn’t wait for the guards to come over. He was about to rush up and beat him up, but it was Steward Jiang who held him back from behind.","“Wait, Elder Chen, wait a minute, I think something is wrong...”","“What’s wrong? It’s just that these two nonsense brats are going to brag again! Do you think I’ll believe them?” Elder Chen said blushingly.","Huang Yueli still looked very calm.","“I’m just talking nonsense, so it’s not surprising if you don’t believe me, but when I came here, I heard that if Floating Sea has any doubts about the cultivator’s registration information, he has the right to ask the cultivator to cooperate with you in the test of cultivation base and bone age, right? So?”","Elder Chen snorted coldly: “That’s right, what are you talking about? Are you going to take the test too?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes and looked at him like she was looking at an idiot.","“Isn’t that natural? You haven’t tested our cultivation and strength, and you say we are lying. Who is talking nonsense? You haven’t even tested us before you decide to drive us out of Floating Sea, is this what you call fair?”","Huang Yueli’s voice was very loud, and she purposely wanted to let all the cultivators around her hear her words.","Many people also muttered.","“That’s right, why did you drive them out without verifying their strength?”","“Because they filled it out too falsely! If you fill in the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm or the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, they will test their strength first.”","“Although that’s the case, you can’t be so hasty, right? What if what people say is true?”","“How could it be true? Did you not wake up?”","“Then you can’t just kick me out with just one word from the Steward? Then if the Steward doesn’t believe the information I filled in, can he also drive me out directly?”","Huang Yueli’s words were very skillful.","Although most cultivators still feel that they are bragging, there are also a small number of people who realize the seriousness of the problem.","This steward from Floating Sea chases people away arbitrarily, and he doesn’t even follow any rules. He just chases people away on his own whim!","The two sides insisted on their own opinions, and the discussion became louder and louder.","When Elder Chen heard these words, his face turned green and pale.","He grew up in Floating Sea, and he was regarded as highly respected in the local area. However, he was questioned for being unfair because of two liars who were obviously talking nonsense!","Elder Chen was very angry, “Hmph! It’s just a test, so let’s test! Do you think that if you make such a mess, the fake will become real? When the test results come out, you still have to get out!”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, “That might be the case. Since Steward Chen agreed, let’s start right away? There are so many fellow cultivators here, they can all be witnesses.”"]},{"number":4011,"title":"Chapter 4011 Someone May Really Die! (3)","paragraphs":["4011 Someone May Really Die! (3)","“Alright, since you are not afraid of embarrassment, I will help you! Come with me!” Elder Chen said, leading them to a square in the east.","Steward Jiang originally wanted to dissuade Elder Chen, but unexpectedly, Elder Chen couldn’t stand the provocation at all, so he just left.","Seeing the calm smile on Huang Yueli’s face, Steward Jiang suddenly felt that something was wrong.","Could it be that these two are really Young Master Li and...another god-level genius?","This is obviously impossible, but...","What if it’s true?","That Floating Sea would become a big joke today!","But it was too late to say anything now, so he could only follow quickly.","Not only him, but all the cultivators on the scene rushed towards the square. They all wanted to occupy a good position, so that they could see for themselves how shameful these two extreme rare liars were. .","Elder Chen brought Huang Yueli and Li Moying to a stop in the middle of the square.","There were several different traps and arrays, and there are several stewards and guards around them.","Seeing Elder Chen coming, a steward in white greeted him.","“Elder Chen, didn’t you say that you want to get in touch with young people more, did you specifically apply to collect the registration forms in person? Why did you come to us suddenly?","Elder Chen snorted, “I did collect the registration form, but I didn’t expect that I was so unlucky. I met two nonsensical brats who refuse to listen to anything! That’s why I’ve brought them to you to get tested here! When the test results come out, let’s see how they can still continue to talk nonsense!”","The steward in white smiled, “What’s the matter? Elder Chen, don’t be too angry. There are people like this every year, and we have seen them a lot. Wait until we embarrass them!”","As he said that, he also took a look at Huang Yueli and Li Moying behind Elder Chen. For some reason, he always felt that Li Moying looked familiar.","While they were talking, suddenly, there was a loud “bang” from the array behind them!","A figure was ejected from the array, and its body flew out of the air!","Moreover, this person’s body presents a strange angle. It seems that the bones of his hands and feet have been shattered by the powerful force, and the corners of his mouth were overflowing with blood.","He flew tens of meters before he hit the ground heavily, scaring the cultivators around to turn blue with fright.","Elder Chen glanced at the cultivator who had collapsed on the ground, snorted heavily, swept towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying, and said, “Did you see that kid? That’s your lesson from the past! This test array is very dangerous, if your cultivation level is lower than the set level, you will be ejected! Not only may you be seriously injured, but if you are not careful, you may die! Look at that kid, this time not only will he have to recuperate for a year with such an injury, and I am afraid that the cultivation base will recede even!”","The steward in white smiled and said, “Elder Chen, don’t scare them. People like that guy just now are rare after all. They are real cultivation bases and those on the registration form. It’s only two small realms behind that would make such a miserable situation ! Ordinary people will report a small realm more, even if they are ejected, the injuries are not serious, and they can only be raised for a month or two.”","He said he didn’t mean to scare people, but the meaning behind his words was to scare Huang Yueli and the others.","Elder Chen snorted coldly, “According to what you say, they will be miserable! I think they reported at least higher than three small realms!”"]},{"number":4012,"title":"Chapter 4012 Someone May Really Die! (4)","paragraphs":["4012 Someone May Really Die! (4)","“Three small realms??”","This time, the white robed steward was also taken aback, “Is there a mistake? This... This will really kill someone!”","Although their test array here was deliberately set up like this, in order to give real punishment to those who lie about their cultivation, so that they don’t dare to commit another crime, but punishment was punishment and killing was killing.","Generally speaking, they definitely don’t want to kill anyone.","Thinking of this, he quickly took out the registration form that Elder Chen had stuffed for him just now, and carefully read it.","Seeing this, his face also turned green, and he couldn’t help scolding Huang Yueli and Li Moying loudly, “You really don’t know the heights of the sky and the earth, you dare to fill in randomly! Have you seen what happened to that kid just now? If you go straight into the array, it will be worse than him, I am absolutely not exaggerating! If you still want to save your life, you should leave Floating Sea by yourself! Seeing that you are young, there is no need to seek death yourself!”","It was actually for the same reason that Elder Chen drove them away directly.","I think they will die if they really take the test, so it’s better to just let them go, after all, they are two young lives!","Huang Yueli is too lazy to explain anything now.","She has now discovered that it was also a mistake for one person to be too much stronger than others.","At least when she tells the truth, it is difficult for others to believe her. In the end, she can only prove it with her strength.","She looked at the array in the middle of the square, analyzed the array patterns on it for a while, and then said, “We said we would take part in the test, but once we say it, it’s hard to follow. How can we go back on our word? By the way, this Steward, are the crystal jade and spirit beast crystal cores outside your array almost running out of energy? You should replace them with new ones, otherwise the array will not have enough energy, and as long as the cultivators inside are stronger, it will easily lead to the array collapsing?”","The more the steward in white listened, the darker his face became.","At this time, he had already deeply realized why Elder Chen was so angry with this errant couple.","These two people were too ignorant!","They were about to die yet they were still pretending here!","Since that’s the case, he doesn’t need to care about their lives anymore!","The steward in white sneered and said: “Our array is very strong, even if it is a cultivator at the beginning of the Dao Profound Realm, don’t try to damage it. You should worry about yourselves! If you are sure to participate in the test, then we will start now. ”","Huang Yueli nodded, “Confirmed, of course confirmed.”","Li Moying didn’t speak, but stood beside Huang Yueli calmly and steadily.","“Alright, very good!” The three stewards looked at each other and felt that it was time to teach them a lesson they would never forget.","The steward in white walked ahead and led them to the middle of the square.","There are actually quite a few cultivators waiting to take part in the test. There are at least sixty or seventy people queuing up here.","The Steward in white didn’t care about them, and directly brought Huang Yueli and Li Moying to the front of the team.","“Let them come first.”","“Ah? But, this...isn’t it good? Everyone else is queuing up!” The steward in charge of guarding the array hesitated.","Elder Chen stood up immediately, “To save face, let them come first!”","The steward stepped back as he said.","As soon as the words came out, Elder Chen felt depressed for a while.","He has never relied on his status as an elder for any favours. The first time he asked someone to jump in the queue, it was actually for these two errant liars!"]},{"number":4013,"title":"Chapter 4013 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (1)","paragraphs":["4013 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (1)","However, as long as they can be cured and this unhealthy trend of reckless cultivation can be curbed, then everything will be worth it!","Elder Chen turned his head and said to Huang Yueli: “Alright, don’t you guys want to test? Come here and test the bone age first!”","Testing bone age was very simple, as long as one stands in the array, the time can be measured accurately in one breath.","Huang Yueli walked into the first array without hesitation.","After the outer circles lit up a few times, the steward in white announced the result: “Well, the bone age is not misreported, it is indeed eighteen years old.”","With that said, he looked at Li Moying again, “Next.”","Li Moying walked over expressionlessly.","“Well, that’s right, it’s indeed twenty-four years old.”","The steward in white said, looking suspiciously at the faces of the two of them.","Generally speaking, when cultivators lie about their strength, the smarter way is to report their age a little lower, and keep their cultivation base as it is.","In this way, if someone wants to compete on a whim, they won’t be beaten on the spot so that they can’t take care of themselves. Bone age, without a special array, is difficult for ordinary cultivators to judge accurately.","But the bone age of these two people was real.","Then there were only two possibilities. One is that the information they filled out was true, and the other is that they were too stupid to overestimate themselves by so much.","The first possibility hardly exists.","And the second possibility, this was obviously seeking death!","The steward in white looked at the form in his hand again, and muttered something: “Li Moying, with a bone age of twenty-four, is at the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm. Li Yuehuang, at the age of eighteen, is at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm. Please confirm if you want to conduct a test based on such data?”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying nodded at the same time, but only Huang Yueli said, “I’m sure.”","“If you’re sure, you can’t go back on your word.”","“Sure!”","“Let me remind you one last time. The test will be divided into two parts. The first part is mandatory, which is to enter the test array you just saw. If you can pass this array, you can follow this test. If you don’t pass, there is a second chance, and our stewards can do it personally to test your strength, and if you can receive more than ten tricks from a certain steward, you can still pass.”","“However, the Steward who is in charge of testing you is at the Dao Profound Realm. To receive ten moves from him is much more difficult than passing the test array. You should try to choose the first test method.”","Huang Yueli nodded, expressing her understanding.","The Steward in white spread his hands, “Since you’ve all made up your mind, you can go over now.”","Huang Yueli took her husband’s hand and walked forward a few steps, when she suddenly thought of something, she stopped again.","She turned to look at the steward in white, “Uh, yes, stewards, I have another question... Well, I think it’s best to ask first.”","“What is the problem?”","Seeing her suddenly stop, Elder Chen’s first reaction was that they were going to go back on their word!","Thinking about it, it’s easy to brag casually when there’s no danger.","But when it comes to the point where you will die if you insist on a lie, few people will be stupid enough to really die, right?","It is estimated that this little girl was planning to change her tricks and will beg for mercy soon.","The several stewards all believed this and they looked at Huang Yueli with an expectant expression on their faces, hoping to see her make a fool of herself."]},{"number":4014,"title":"Chapter 4014 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (2)","paragraphs":["4014 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (2)","However, when Huang Yueli left her mouth to ask questions, it was completely different from what they thought.","“Several stewards, I would like to ask, in case...if the cultivator who enters the test array is too high-level and damages your arrays, then...who will be liable for it? Do I need to pay for it?”","When the steward in white was explaining the test rules, she was distracted and observed all the arrays beside her.","The array for testing bone age was very simple, and she can copy one in two or three hours.","However, the array to test cultivation was very complicated, and there were countless types of arrays inlaid. Without a detailed drawing, it would be difficult even for her to complete it.","At that time, in case of any accident, what if these stewards in Floating Sea blackmailed her?","Although she was already rich enough, the money-obsessed Young Miss Huang can’t afford it!","So, she’d better ask in advance.","Elder Chen was so angry that he almost vomited blood, “You, you... you are still pretending at this time! Alright, then I will tell you, if you really have the ability to damage the test array, not only will I not let you pay, I will give you money back! How about it? Is this condition good enough? This old man will leave my words here! If you have the ability, try to break the test array!”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes with surprise on her face, “Huh? So polite? You’re too polite! I don’t need the money, I just want the array pattern of this array.”","She was currently researching a growth-type spiritual weapon that can change with the cultivator’s own cultivation level, but she encountered a little technical difficulty, and that was to immediately judge the cultivator’s own cultivation level. This sounds simple, but for it to be really integrated onto a small Spirit Armament, that was definitely not an easy task.","However, the test array in front of her gave her a lot of inspiration.","If you take the array pattern back and study it carefully, maybe the problem will be solved easily.","Elder Chen chortled angrily, “All right, all right, your little request is easy to satisfy, so what are you waiting for? Hurry up, go in and break the array!","He didn’t even bother to refute these two retarded people now, so he just waited to see how they died later.","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “Come on, I’ll come right away!”","She took a step forward and was about to enter the array, but was held back by Li Moying.","“Let me do it.” He whispered.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, and soon realized that her husband was worried that she would not be absolutely sure to penetrate the test array, so he took the initiative to ask for a shot.","In fact, that was exactly the case. Li Moying heard Huang Yueli’s tone, and knew that she really wanted that array pattern.","If you can’t get it, you will definitely be very disappointed.","With Huang Yueli’s strength, it is certain to pass the test, but to break through the array, at present, it can only be said to be 50% sure.","This probability is actually not low. After all, if a cultivator in the late stage of Dao Profound Realm doesn’t know the secret of this classic array that has been handed down from ancient times, he can’t easily destroy it.","It’s just that Li Moying didn’t want to disappoint his little fox.","Huang Yueli thought for a while, then revealed a sweet smile, “Alright then, pay attention, the magic core in the east direction has already run out of energy, it is the weakest link in the entire array.”","Although it’s fine for her to do it herself, since her husband wants to spoil her, of course she accepts it!","Marrying such a good husband had its use."]},{"number":4015,"title":"Chapter 4015 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (3)","paragraphs":["4015 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (3)","After hearing what his little fox said, Li Moying nodded slightly, expressing his understanding.","Then, he stepped onto the test array.","All of a sudden, everyone in the square surrounded them.","Just now, the dispute between Huang Yueli and the several stewards spread quickly. At this moment, all the cultivators present already know that there were actually two strange ones who have boasted themselves as god-level geniuses, and they want to participate in the cultivation base here. test!","Such a miracle was simply unheard of! Rarely happens once in tens of thousands of years.","Who wouldn’t want to witness it with their own eyes?","The outside of the array was completely surrounded. All the stewards and guards worked together and threatened to disqualify them from participating in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, so they barely controlled the situation.","From a long distance away, everyone could only see Huang Yueli’s beautiful and refined face standing outside the array and waiting.","“Whoa, did I make a mistake? It turns out that the one who boasted and went to test the array to die is that girl? She looks so beautiful! It’s a pity that her mind is not clear!”","“Oh, yes, what a pity! I don’t know what I was thinking. Such an outstanding beauty, why doesn’t she cherish her own life?”","“I heard that her husband has already entered, let’s wait and see the result!”","“I hope they won’t be too miserable after a while, at least... don’t die here.”","Seeing Huang Yueli’s beauty, many people felt sorry for her. They really wanted to rush up and shake her awake, so that she would stop doing such stupid things that wanted to kill her!","Unfortunately, it’s too late to say anything now.","This array was different from the array of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It was completely open. Looking in from the outside, not only can you see the flickering array patterns, but you can also clearly see every move of the cultivator inside.","Li Moying walked slowly to the center of the array and stood with his hands behind his back.","The array was activated, and a barrier appeared in front of him.","The voice of the steward in white came in from outside the array, “You just need to punch with all your strength to pour your profound energy into the barrier. If your cultivation has indeed reached the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm, then the barrier will disappear, otherwise, you will be ejected. I believe you have seen the end of the last person, well, I wish you luck.”","After finishing speaking, he also stood beside Elder Chen.","Li Moying’s gaze flickered for a moment, and he stood there, motionless.","After about ten breaths, the onlookers became a little impatient.","“What’s going on here? What does this kid mean by standing there all the time? Could it be that he was scared, regretted, and didn’t dare to come out again?”","“It’s possible, it’s too possible! If I were him, I’d already be so scared that my legs would go limp by now!”","“You wouldn’t do such a stupid thing! Since he dared to do it, there’s no reason to back down now, right?”","“Hehe, that’s not necessarily the case. With this punch now, he might die!”","Everyone was discussing, but Li Moying still didn’t move.","Originally, Elder Chen was laughing inwardly just like the cultivators watching, but after watching, his expression gradually changed.","Because, although Li Moying simply stood still without moving, they could feel a slight change in the atmosphere around them.","“He’s...he’s gaining momentum!” The steward in white frowned and blurted out."]},{"number":4016,"title":"Chapter 4016 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (4)","paragraphs":["4016 Want To See How They Dig Their Own Graves (4)","Both Elder Chen and Steward Jiang were faintly aware of this, and their expressions changed after hearing what the white robed steward said.","Gathering momentum before making a move was the basis for a cultivator to fight.","It’s just that it takes time to gain momentum, and in actual combat, there were very few such opportunities.","But now, Li Moying was testing the array. There were no other threats around, and he only needed to focus on himself. Therefore, it was very easy to gather momentum.","It is not uncommon for nine out of ten cultivators who came to participate in the test to gain momentum.","However, Li Moying stood in the array and was gaining momentum. They were so far away, yet they all felt the fluctuation of the profound energy of the world!","How is this possible?","Even if they stood inside to gain momentum, it would be impossible to cause such a result, right?","Before they could figure it out, Li Moying in the array suddenly moved.","If he didn’t move, he would be thunderous, and a dazzling electric light would instantly surround him.","Immediately, there was a loud bang and a violent explosion, and the ground shook.","The explosive energy suddenly radiated outward from the center of the array, and the huge impact blew all the sand and gravel on the ground into the air.","The surrounding stewards and guards were impacted, and many of them fell out on the spot, and some even vomited blood!","Most of the onlookers were not injured because they were far away.","However, those with poor cultivation still felt chest tightness and discomfort, couldn’t bear it, and retreated a long way back before recovering.","Elder Chen stood closest to the array, so he received the strongest impact.","Although his cultivation base is very high, and his reaction is several times faster than that of ordinary cultivators, he was still blown up by the explosive profound energy. Not only was his arm injured, but even his long beard, which he was most proud of, was blown away. clean up.","“Cough cough, cough cough... What... what’s going on?”","The white robed steward’s situation is a little better than his, at least not disfigured, but he still suffered a little injury, and was coughed by the surrounding gravel.","Steward Jiang had the best luck and was the furthest away.","He walked over, looking in the direction of the test array with a face full of shock, his voice trembling.","“This... this... how is this possible? Oh my god! What the hell did he do to the test array? How did this happen??”","“What... what?”","Hearing what Steward Jiang said, Elder Chen and the white robed steward couldn’t care less about their injuries, and hurriedly looked in the direction he pointed.","I saw that the place where the test array should have existed has been completely razed to the ground, and the ground was scorched black. The materials and magic cores used to arrange the array have all been blown into black mass of char on the ground.","“Damn, how did this happen? What did that brat do?... No, what about the others? They won’t be blown up too, right?”","In the middle of the array, apart from the ruins, there was not even a single person.","When Elder Chen saw it, he was startled.","Steward Jiang had calmed down quite a bit at this time, he sighed secretly, and pointed behind the three of them, “No, that Young Master Li is fine, he’s over there!”","Elder Chen and the steward in white hurriedly turned around, and saw Li Moying standing not far behind them, holding his wife’s little hand, and whispering something to her.","Compared with the disheveled cultivators present, he was dressed in elegant and unrestrained robes, spotless, as if he was a nobleman who had just walked out of the house and was about to go to a banquet."]},{"number":4017,"title":"Chapter 4017 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (1)","paragraphs":["4017 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (1)","Li Moying completely ignored all the shocking, fearful, and admiring gazes around him, and only his little fox was in his eyes.","“Little Li’er, are you not injured?”","Huang Yueli shook her head, “No, I stood so far away, how could I get hurt?”","What’s more, after they obtained the secret tome of double cultivation from the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, each of them has a part of the other’s profound strength in their meridians, and their auras can be fused with each other without the slightest repulsion.","Therefore, it is basically impossible for Li Moying’s profound strength to cause any harm to her.","Li Moying seemed a little disappointed when he heard the little fox swear that she was fine.","Having a lady with such high talent and strength, although he was very lucky, but... If you want to experience the feeling of a lady rushing into his arms for protection, I think there is no hope in this life...","Huang Yueli raised her head, seeing the expression on her husband’s face, she immediately guessed what he was thinking, and couldn’t help but smile secretly.","She quickly hugged Li Moying’s arm and leaned against him, her eyes full of admiration.","“Husband, you are really good and amazing! I especially admire you!”","The corners of Li Moying’s mouth twitched, and he raised his hand to pinch her fair and tender face, “Little Li’er, it’s too fake!”","“How is it fake? It’s from the heart!” Huang Yueli blinked her eyes hard, trying her best to be cute.","“Ahem, cough, cough!”","The several stewards who were ignored the whole time, watched them show their affection for a long time, couldn’t bear it anymore, and coughed heavily several times.","Li Moying didn’t even lift his eyelids, his feverish gaze was fixated on his own wife’s big shining eyes.","Even if he knows that she was pretending on purpose, what should he do if he still thinks she was absolutely adorable yet alluring at the same time?","He moved closer and closer to Huang Yueli’s direction, and he was about to kiss her.","Huang Yueli quickly covered his mouth, and turned to look at the stewards, “Well, hehehe... Stewards, no one is injured, right?”","As soon as she opened her mouth, Elder Chen and the others were so angry that they fell on their backs!","Dare this little girl expect them to get hurt?","What does that disappointed expression mean?","Steward Jiang was the first to come back to his senses, cleared his throat, and said, “Both of you, I’m sorry to bother you. We just wanted to ask for your advice. Just now... just now...”","When he thought of the earth-shattering explosion that happened earlier, his heart was still extremely shocked, and he didn’t know how to describe it for a while.","“It’s the explosion just now! You actually blew up the entire array into the sky! How is this possible? How did you do it? As a cultivator in the Dao Profound Realm, this old man can’t do it!” Elder Chen was impatient, so he hurried up to ask.","Although they all watched Li Moying build up his momentum with their own eyes, and watched him make a move, this scene was so incredible that after much deliberation, they still couldn’t accept it.","Before Li Moying could speak, Huang Yueli had already stood up and raised her eyebrows.","“Hey, what do you mean? Are you trying to extort money! Did I remind you just now? There is a corner of this array that is about to run out of magic core energy. If you meet a stronger cultivator, with one move, it can be destroyed! You also said that no matter what happens, you will not let us lose money!”","Make a random move?","After hearing this, several stewards wanted to vomit blood again, and they managed to hold back.","She said that all that had happened was all because of a random trick?!"]},{"number":4018,"title":"Chapter 4018 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (2)","paragraphs":["4018 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (2)","Even Li Moying had gathered his momentum first, and then shot with all his strength, only then did he break the array!","Actually, although what Huang Yueli said was a bit exaggerated, it was not a lie.","If she was the one who entered the array just now, then she would definitely choose to attack the weakness of the array immediately. In fact, she can easily destroy the array without consuming too much profound energy.","However, Li Moying thought differently from her.","Even with the reminder from his own little fox, he didn’t intend to take advantage of the weakness by attacking it.","Relying on powerful strength to forcibly defeat the array, and even cause large-scale damage, although this is a simple, crude and relatively laborious method, the shocking power was definitely several times stronger.","It’s enough to shock these stewards and cultivators who look down on people so lowly that they can’t speak.","Besides, just consuming this bit of profound energy is nothing to Li Moying.","However, the stewards didn’t know their true strength, and still felt that Huang Yueli’s words were too exaggerated!","Besides, even if Li Moying was really a god-level genius with extraordinary strength, he was still Li Moying!","In their eyes, Huang Yueli was still a waste, but she just hugged the thick thigh of the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and started bragging about it outside triumphantly!","Don’t even think about it, her man’s strength doesn’t mean she’s strong, so what’s there to be proud of?","The faces of several people were a bit indescribable.","The steward in white tried his best to calm himself down, “Young Miss Li, you don’t have to worry about the array. Since we have made an agreement just now, it is naturally impossible to go back on your word, and you won’t lose money.”","This place is in such a mess, it really hurts their heart! To rearrange the same array, it would take a lot of materials, and it would cost a lot of money to hire a senior array master.","But, how could they have the guts to make Huang Yueli lose money to them?","Not to mention that Huang Yueli had spoken first, even if they didn’t agree first, they wouldn’t dare to ask Li Moying for money?","At this point, no one doubts anymore that this extremely handsome young cultivator of the Cloudy Qilin Clan in front of him was the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, the only god-level genius in the legendary God Realm!","Huang Yueli nodded, “That’s good.” She paused, and then said: “By the way, there is one more thing, we made a bet earlier, if my husband and I damage the test array, you will give me the array pattern of this array! You haven’t forgotten it, have you?”","Hearing this, the muscles on the faces of the three stewards began to twitch.","In fact, they had already forgotten!","However, after she said that, they remembered it.","At that time, no one believed that they could really damage this test array!","After all, since this array was built here, it has been tens of thousands of years of history. Every time there are so many people who would come to test the God Realm’s Grand Meet, the most was someone who can cause a little damage to the array would appear occasionally!","But now...","Even the Steward in white who has always acted calmly and rationally also feels his heart is bleeding!","The cost of rearranging the array was already astonishingly high.","As the steward who manages the testing array, he was directly responsible, and he still doesn’t know how to explain it to the Island Master!","And now, Huang Yueli actually wants him to hand over the array pattern!","For such a rare and special array like the one they had just destroyed, the value of the array pattern is ten times more precious than a large array!"]},{"number":4019,"title":"Chapter 4019 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (3)","paragraphs":["4019 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (3)","What’s more, it doesn’t matter if it’s priceless. What’s more, he is just a Steward, and he can’t get the original array pattern at all, let alone give it away casually.","The steward in white laughed dryly: “Ahem, this... this is indeed true, but I don’t have the array pattern here, and I have to ask the Island Master for instructions about it first.”","Huang Yueli’s face changed when she heard this, “What? You guys don’t mean what you say, and you want to renege on your debt? Let me tell you, you can’t get away with it. There are so many cultivators here who are my witnesses. You heard what we said just now, and you can testify for me, right?”","Huang Yueli raised her voice and asked the surrounding cultivators a question.","Of those cultivators watching, although quite a few were injured in the explosion just now, most of them were still intact.","They didn’t want to leave any of them, they were still around not far away, staring at them without blinking!","No one expected that Li Moying really had god-level strength!","This also indirectly proves his identity.","All cultivators who saw the notice issued by the coalition headquarters quickly thought of Li Moying’s identity, and all of them became excited.","This peerless genius of the ancient god clan was also the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! Which of these cultivators is not aloof, ordinary cultivators like them will never see them in their lifetime!","But not only had they seen him from a close distance, but they also saw Li Moying make a move with their own eyes.","Even those who were injured by the aftermath of his profound power felt quite honored.","At this time, when they heard Huang Yueli suddenly raise her voice to ask them, the cultivators’ first reaction was to speak out in support of her.","“Isn’t it? I heard very clearly just now, just like what this girl said, what Steward Chen himself said just now, as long as Young Master Li and this girl can damage the array, give them the array pattern! ”","“That’s right, I heard it too!","“As cultivators, we value honesty the most. Do those who hang in the sky have to renege on their debts?”","“Impossible, right? If you really renege on your debt, Floating Sea’s reputation will be ruined!”","Hearing that the cultivators were discussing a lot, and they all stood by Li Moying and Huang Yueli, the stewards couldn’t help but feel even more headache.","If only Huang Yueli and Li Moying were the only ones present, they could still find a way to discuss with the two of them, and use other treasures to offset this array pattern, maybe they could also deal with it.","But now, so many cultivators have seen it, and they all suspect that they are going to renege on their debts, then the matter will become a big deal.","This is related to Floating Sea’s reputation.","At this time, Huang Yueli spoke again, and said unhurriedly: “You guys, you all heard it, everyone has this impression, it’s not because I remembered wrongly or just talking nonsense! You guys should think about it clearly. To handle such a trivial matter so recklessly, who can believe that the God Realm’s Grand Meet is fair and just?”","These words directly hit the inner pain points of the three stewards!","As the organizer of the God Realm’s Grand Meet over the years, Floating Sea values his own reputation the most.","Only by acting impartially can they guarantee their status in the hearts of all the cultivators in the God Realm. I believe that the God Realm’s Grand Meet they hold must be the fairest.","Without this premise, the God Realm’s Grand Meet would not be able to be organized at all.","With so many superpowers, which one doesn’t have its own selfishness?","For this reason, Floating Sea has always maintained neutrality and never intervened in disputes between any forces."]},{"number":4020,"title":"Chapter 4020 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (4)","paragraphs":["4020 This Lady Is Too Ruthless (4)","Now, the new God Realm’s Grand Meet is about to be held, if the gossip spreads, it will be really troublesome!","The several stewards all had expressions of wanting to cry but no tears, and the way they looked at Huang Yueli became different from before.","This girl was really... so ruthless!","You don’t need to make a move at all, just a few words can kill people!","It’s no wonder that she didn’t get hacked to death after she came out and boasted so much, and she even hooked up with the first genius in the God Realm!","“Young Miss Li, you...you really misunderstood! What did I say that I couldn’t tell you just now? It’s just...it’s just that I really don’t have the array pattern here. I have to go to the Island Master to get it. That’s the truth! But don’t worry, our Island Master will definitely promise to give it to you, and I can guarantee it!” The steward in white hurriedly explained.","Previously, he really felt that the Island Master might not be willing to give up the array pattern.","But now that things have become so serious, I believe the Island Master has no other choice.","It’s just that, as the instigators of this incident, the three stewards who lost the array pattern are probably going to be really unlucky.","The three of them couldn’t help but look at each other, all helpless.","Who made them blind? They didn’t even realize that the person who stood before them was really the famous Young Master Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Just because of his existence, no one dares to bet on the most popular bet on the champion of the God Realm’s Grand Meet in previous years.","Li Moying’s odds were 1 to 1. There is no way to make money at all. He just gives the dealer a commission.","And betting on someone else’s victory... It’s useless to think about it with your toes.","Now, in front of them is such a peerless genius who may dominate the God Realm in the next few hundred years, and they still call him a liar?","It is estimated that even their Island Master does not want to offend Li Moying.","The only thing they can’t figure out now is that a genius like Li Moying can completely let the Cloudy Qilin Clan sign up, and there is no need to go to the registration office to queue up.","He spent so much time, didn’t he come here to play with them, right?","“Alright... Now that you’ve said that, I won’t embarrass you anymore, so let’s owe it first!” Huang Yueli waved her hand and said generously.","The steward in white smiled wryly, this is not to embarrass him...","Anyway, at least Huang Yueli stopped instigating those ordinary cultivators, and the three of them breathed a sigh of relief.","Steward Jiang said: “Young Master Li, we were offended just now because we were too blind. Now that the misunderstanding has been clarified, please move with Madam Li and sit with us in a quieter place. It’s too messy, and it’s rude to let you stay here.”","He asked the two of them to tidy up, wanting to take them away quickly.","There are more and more cultivators watching on the side of the road. Many cultivators who were not here before heard the news and rushed over one after another, wanting to see the legendary demeanor of Young Master Li with their own eyes.","During this period of time, there are so many fighters floating in the sky, if they all gather here, what would happen?","However, when Li Moying heard Steward Jiang’s words, he just glanced at him lightly, “There is no need to sit down, I’m registering with my wife...”","“Oh, yes, yes! Registration!” Only then did Steward Jiang remember the reason why Li Moying came here.","The steward in white hurriedly took out the registration form, “Sign up is such a trivial matter, Young Master Li, don’t worry, you have already passed the test, and we will definitely collect the registration form.”","Li Moying nodded, “What about my wife?”","“This...Young Madam’s registration form is also...”","The steward in white was halfway through speaking when he suddenly stopped."]},{"number":4021,"title":"Chapter 4021 Finally Scared? (1)","paragraphs":["4021 Finally Scared? (1)","Steward Jiang walked over in time, and took Huang Yueli’s registration form from the steward in white.","“Young Master Li, Young Miss Li... No, it’s Madam Li. It’s best to fill out this form for Madam Li. It’s not that we don’t give you face, Young Master Li. It’s for Madam Li’s consideration. When the official competition starts, the cultivators will be grouped according to their cultivation base and bone age, if they really sign up according to the content on the form, the opponents Madam Li will meet will be the top geniuses, if she’s injured because of this, it will be bad.”","He spoke very tactfully, deliberately speaking from Huang Yueli’s point of view.","After speaking, he handed the form to Huang Yueli, waiting for her to take it back.","From Steward Jiang’s point of view, he’s already talked about this point, Huang Yueli definitely has no reason to continue pretending, but if anyone winks a little, it’s time to go down the steps, take the form back and fill it out again.","But who knows, Huang Yueli didn’t intend to reach out her hand at all.","She shook her head and said, “Thank you, Steward Jiang, for your kindness. However, the information on this form is my real situation. I can’t just write a lie, right?”","Hearing this, the faces of the three stewards suddenly became extremely stunned.","No one expected that she would still refuse to admit the truth at this time!","Could it be that Li Moying just now proved his talent with his strength, and she also became a god-level genius?","This girl isn’t out of her mind, is she?","Doesn’t she know how rare god-level geniuses are? Did she think it was common like chinese cabbage?","The corner of Steward Jiang’s mouth twitched several times, and he couldn’t speak for a while.","He cast a look for help to his two other colleagues, and really didn’t know what he should do in this situation.","As the stewards of Floating Sea, in order to maintain the fairness and justice of the competition, they cannot submit an obviously false registration form. Otherwise, if they are reported by other contestants and go to the Island Master, they will be responsible.","However, now that Huang Yueli was brazenly talking nonsense because she was Li Moying’s woman, they might as well just smash the form in her face, right?","If you really do this, offending the Cloudy Qilin Clan is a trivial matter, but offending the future peerless powerhouse Li Moying, then you will be in big trouble!","The three stewards were extremely depressed and stared at Huang Yueli fiercely.","They simply felt that although this little lady looks sweet and well-behaved, but she was actually the most daring one out here.","And as for Young Master Li, they were even more speechless. It’s true that he’s extremely talented, and it is also true that he’s handsome, but his ears are too soft, right? His woman did such a weird thing, but he didn’t react at all?","The scene was stalemate for a while, and Huang Yueli suddenly chuckled, “What’s wrong? Don’t you believe that I have a god-level talent?”","The faces of the three of them became even uglier.","Isn’t this asking knowingly? Anyone with a brain would not believe such a thing, would they?","“However, just now you didn’t believe that my husband has a god-level talent, and you were all slapped in the face. The scene was so embarrassing. Now you don’t believe me...why haven’t you learned your lesson?” Huang Yueli asked innocently .","Elder Chen really wanted to shake her head and ask her if her head was filled with water!","This was Li Moying!","Did she really think that she and Li Moying were the same?"]},{"number":4022,"title":"Chapter 4022 Finally Scared? (2)","paragraphs":["4022 Finally Scared? (2)","Seeing that Huang Yueli could not be persuaded, the stewards almost went crazy.","At this moment, Huang Yueli spoke again, “Stewards, what’s the situation now? When will my cultivation test continue?”","The three of them were startled when they heard this.","“Wh... what cultivation test?” Elder Chen couldn’t even turn his head around.","Huang Yueli glanced at him with an idiot look, “Just now, I signed up for the cultivation test with my husband? Now that my husband has finished the test, what about me? You didn’t let me take the test and simply returned my registration form?”","The corner of the white robed steward’s mouth twitched several times before he said reluctantly, “Madam Li, Steward Jiang has already said it just now, and I returned the form in consideration for you...”","“No, you really don’t need to think about me! Since I signed up to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, I have to participate in the competition openly. How can I intentionally lower my cultivation level? As the stewards of Floating Sea, you are instigating me to do illegal things like this, won’t your conscience hurt?” Huang Yueli accused them righteously.","The steward in white almost vomited out blood!","They asked her to fill in the report truthfully, so how did it become they abet her to break the rules?","Seeing that they couldn’t agree on anything, the steward in white also figured it out, and said simply: “Well, since Madam Li is so persistent, I’ll let you take the test.”","Only then did Huang Yueli smile, “That’s right! We must follow the rules in everything we do!”","The three stewards all showed constipated expressions.","She could still laugh!","The steward in white barely suppressed the depression in his heart, and spoke again, “However, the arrays used for the test have been damaged now, so the first test method is of course useless, so the only way to do it is to use the second method, which is to be tested by a Dao Profound Realm cultivator who will challenge you, as long as you can persist in ten moves, it will be considered a pass.”","Huang Yueli nodded again and again, “Yes, yes, since the rules are like this, let’s follow the rules.”","“Since the cultivation base you filled out on the form is at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm, the person who will fight you must be at the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm.”","At this point, the white robed steward turned his head to look at Elder Chen, “Elder Chen, Steward Jiang and I are both at the early stage of the Dao Profound Realm, and only you are at the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm. I will trouble you to take action this time.”","Elder Chen glanced at Huang Yueli, and snorted coldly: “No trouble, no trouble at all! Hmph! My old bones are not as good as young people’s, but it’s okay to make a few gestures. I can be like Madam Li. It is also an honor for this old man to play against young people with outstanding talents.”","What he said was obviously mocking Huang Yueli.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t seem to notice it at all, and said with a smile: “Old Steward Chen, you are too polite. I haven’t fought against a cultivator in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm for a long time, and I don’t know how much my strength has improved? ”","Speaking of which, the last time she fought against a cultivator in the middle stage of Dao Profound Realm was Huang Sanbai.","When they fought for the first time, she was still at the Dream Profound Realm, so she just ran for her life and had no chance of fighting back.","The second time near the secret realm of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Huang Sanbai brought two elders, and many killers came to besiege her and Li Moying.","At that time, both of them summoned the contracted beasts, but they almost died.","This time, she had just advanced in Cumulus Peak, and apart from beating a few high-level spirit beasts, she hadn’t fought against cultivators in a serious way since then."]},{"number":4023,"title":"Chapter 4023 Finally Scared? (3)","paragraphs":["4023 Finally Scared? (3)","If she fights with Elder Chen at this time, it will indeed be very helpful to her.","At least it can make her feel more clearly how much her strength has improved after she advanced.","Elder Chen didn’t know that this delicate little girl in front of him was a true peerless genius. Hearing what she said, his face turned red with anger.","He snorted heavily, “Madam Li, I will remind you one last time that the cultivation test will be dangerous no matter what. Although the old man will be merciful, he will never go easy! As the saying goes, swords have no eyes, in case the Young Madam gets injured, Young Master Li can’t come to trouble Floating Sea just because of this!”‘","His last words were addressed to Li Moying.","Li Moying nodded immediately.","Huang Yueli also said: “Yes. However, if you are injured, Elder Chen, I will not be responsible.”","Elder Chen was so angry that he almost vomited blood again, “You, you... beat me to death if you have the ability, and I won’t let you pay for it!”","“It’s not that good, is it?” Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes. “We have no grievances or enmities. Even if there is a little dispute, it is for business. It’s just a fair and reasonable discussion. How could I kill people casually?”","“You... you’re ruthless! To lie through your teeth in such an instance, don’t cry because of shame later and blame this old man!”","The white robed steward and Steward Jiang were also speechless for a while.","Now that things had happened, they didn’t want to say anything more, and they even hoped that Elder Chen would beat Huang Yueli up.","Although this girl looks very cute, but she talks too much!","How did they know that Huang Yueli was more troubled than they were, and no one would believe her when she told the truth. This was forcing her to make mistakes!","“Alright, since everyone has no objections, then don’t waste time, why don’t Elder Chen start the test now?” The steward in white cast his inquiring eyes on Elder Chen.","Just as Elder Chen was about to nod, Huang Yueli suddenly said, “Wait!”","“Wait? Why? Don’t you know you’re afraid and are going to regret it?” Elder Chen was suddenly excited.","If Huang Yueli repented at this time, he certainly couldn’t insist on beating her up.","However, he could take the opportunity to humiliate her and get back all the face he lost just now!","Huang Yueli curled her lips slightly, and shook her head, “No, I don’t plan to cancel the competition, but I hope to change to another place. There are too many people here, so it’s inconvenient.”","Just now she was ready to make a move here, but when she saw more and more cultivators surrounding her, she suddenly thought of a question.","She came to Floating Sea this time for a purpose. She didn’t intend to reveal her true identity so early.","When she filled out the registration form earlier, she didn’t think about it for a while. She didn’t expect that Elder Chen would be so serious and cause such a big commotion.","Now, if she really made a move here, if she couldn’t control it, she might expose her identity as a member of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","The God Realm Contest is imminent, and Floating Sea is full of experts now. No matter how well she usually hides it, she may still reveal her secrets when she makes a move.","Thinking of this, she hastily changed her words.","Elder Chen was taken aback for a moment, apparently he did not expect her to make such a request.","But after thinking about it, he laughed again, “Hehe, isn’t that the same meaning? You know that you will definitely not be able to pass the test, and you are afraid that it will be too embarrassing, so you want to hide and take the test?”"]},{"number":4024,"title":"Chapter 4024 Finally Scared? (4)","paragraphs":["4024 Finally Scared? (4)","“This old man has eaten more salt than you have eaten, how can you hide it from my eyes?”","Elder Chen felt that he had seen through Huang Yueli, so he smiled very complacently.","Stewards in white and Steward Jiang also heaved a sigh of relief.","They thought the same as Elder Chen, they all felt that if Huang Yueli proposed to change places, they already lacked confidence and wanted to give up.","She finally couldn’t pretend anymore!","However, compared to Elder Chen’s schadenfreude, they felt more relieved.","In fact, it would be best for Huang Yueli to just skip the competition, so that neither of them can offend anyone, but now it seems that Huang Yueli still insists on participating in this test...","Then I can only ask Elder Chen to be merciful, and don’t beat her too badly.","“Change place, change place! It’s really too chaotic here, and there are too many people. It would be bad if innocent cultivators are involved in the same way as before!”","“That’s right, we have several high-end competition venues in Floating Sea, which are rarely used on normal days. Now it’s just right for us to use as a testing venue!”","Steward Jiang and stewards in white were afraid that Elder Chen would be impulsive and get separated from Huang Yue, so they rushed out and patted their chests in agreement.","Then, the two of them, one on the left and the other on the right, pulled Elder Chen up and left.","“Young Master Li, Madam Li, come with us quickly!”","Li Moying nodded, pulled his little fox, and followed.","Seeing that they were going to leave, the surrounding cultivators were all disappointed, and some even asked them to stay.","It’s a pity that no one bothered about them.","Seeing that there was nothing to watch, many cultivators felt that they had been tricked and began to speculate maliciously.","“Tsk tsk, when I first saw that little girl said so, I thought she was really amazingly talented, even if she wasn’t a god-level genius, she would also be a top-notch genius, I didn’t expect that when she really has to compete, she became cowardly? She actually hid!”","“Do you really believe that she is a god-level genius? I saw clearly just now that she is a human! There are not many heaven-level geniuses in the human race, and she is still a god-level genius... Are you going to make me laugh to death? ”","“Hey, I don’t know what Young Master Li is thinking, but actually found such a woman! And the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan didn’t know what’s on their mind let her in!”","“Haha, I think you’re overthinking it. The Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s married. He must be receiving invitations from all major forces. How could it be so silent? It’s obvious that Young Master Li himself was fascinated by the vixen. For the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to agree, hah!”","“Oh, it’s a pity, it’s a pity that I can’t see this vixen be beaten up with my own eyes!”","“You’re thinking too much. Maybe they’re just pretending here, and when they leave here, they’ll admit their mistakes to the stewards and beg for mercy. For the sake of Young Master Li, they can’t do anything to her.”","“Hmph, such a woman actually seduces Young Master Li! I want to see how she can get in the God Realm’s Grand Meet? If she can get into the top 100, I’ll perform and eat shit!”","Li Moying’s peach blossom life was really not something to talk about casually.","Ninety-nine percent of the female cultivators present saw Li Moying for the first time, and they were already overwhelmed by his strength and appearance, and secretly hated Huang Yueli.","Seeing her now seems to be unlucky, everyone started gloating about her misfortune.","There seemed to be a sour smell pervading the entire square, causing the male cultivators nearby to look sideways."]},{"number":4025,"title":"Chapter 4025 Obviously Want To Play Tricks (1)","paragraphs":["4025 Obviously Want To Play Tricks (1)","The group of five who were about to go to the martial arena for high cultivation base had sharp five senses, so they naturally heard these discussions.","The three stewards listened and nodded secretly, feeling so relieved in their hearts!","Finally, someone said what they dared not say!","They didn’t know what Young Master Li was thinking? How could he insist on finding such a person as his wife? Indulging in lust was equivalent to hanging a knife upon one’s own head! What good is it for a woman to only look good?","Li Moying frowned slightly, and paused in his footsteps, but before he could express anything, he felt the girl beside him suddenly approaching and grabbed him.","Li Moying lowered her head, and saw Huang Yueli smiling sweetly at him, revealing two small canine teeth, extremely cute.","Seeing her smile, he couldn’t vent his anger no matter how angry he was.","Not long after, they arrived at the martial arena.","What Steward Jiang said was correct. The facilities of this martial arts arena was very good, but there were not many people inside.","Elder Chen walked in directly with Huang Yueli and Li Moying, impatient to teach Huang Yueli a lesson.","However, the steward in white was so thoughtful, he hurried to clear the arena and invited the few cultivators out.","“Alright, now that there are no outsiders, can the test begin?” Elder Chen stood in the centre of the venue and said to Huang Yueli.","Seeing that there were no outsiders, Huang Yueli also wanted to make a quick decision, so she took a few steps forward decisively and stood opposite Elder Chen.","“Alright, then don’t waste time, let’s start right away!”","Hearing this, Elder Chen didn’t act immediately as she expected.","Not only him, but the other two Stewards also looked at Li Moying behind Huang Yueli at the same time, as if they were waiting for him to say something.","Li Moying had been staring at his little fox, admiring her full of fighting spirit. It wasn’t until the three of them stared at her for a long time that he realized something was wrong, and couldn’t help frowning.","“Why don’t you do anything? Why are you staring at me?”","“Uh, Young Master Li... this... is the test really going to start?” Steward Jiang asked cautiously.","All three of them thought that Li Moying would definitely stop this competition before it started.","After all, judging by the way he treats Huang Yueli with all kinds of care and love, he shouldn’t be willing to let his woman be beaten up, right?","Now there were no outsiders here, and there was no need to fight for face.","As a result... Li Moying didn’t respond?","And when Huang Yueli heard this, the corners of her mouth twitched even more.","This is the downside of having an overly powerful husband. Everyone takes her husband’s opinion as the main priority and completely ignores her!","Huang Yueli was very depressed, and said simply: “I am the one who wants to compete, what are you asking him for? Since Elder Chen doesn’t make a move, then I will not be polite!”","Before she could finish her sentence, a wave of profound energy had gathered in her hands as she attacked Elder Chen directly.","Elder Chen was still distracted. He never thought that Huang Yueli would make a sudden move.","By the time he reacted, Huang Yueli’s attack had already arrived in front of him!","Moreover, the attack was fierce, and the powerful fire attribute energy drew a dazzling light path in mid-air, directly attacking his chest!","Elder Chen was horrified to the extreme, but it was too late to dodge at this moment.","He could only grit his teeth and quickly assume a defensive posture, but nothing was blocked. Huang Yueli punched him directly in the chest.","Elder Chen’s figure swayed, and he backed away dozens of steps in succession."]},{"number":4026,"title":"Chapter 4026 Obviously Wants To Play Tricks (2)","paragraphs":["4026 Obviously Wants To Play Tricks (2)","It could be seen that he really wanted to stabilize his body, but he failed until the end.","Elder Chen fell to the ground on his buttocks. On the clothes on his chest, there was an obvious handprint that was burned by Huang Yueli’s flame.","In the arena of the martial arts competition, it suddenly became extremely quiet.","The steward in white and Steward Jiang stared wide-eyed, looking at the scene in disbelief, unable to even make a sound.","What the hell happened just now? What did they see again?!","This must be an illusion, right? That’s right, it’s an illusion!","The two of them raised their hands at the same time and rubbed their eyes.","However, when they opened their eyes again, nothing changed in front of them, and what they saw was still the scene just now.","The majestic middle-stage Dao Profound Realm expert, the highly respected Elder Chen in Floating Sea, was defeated by a delicate little girl with one move, and fell to the ground with his buttocks on the ground, in a very ugly posture.","As for Elder Chen himself, he couldn’t accept such a result even more.","He struggled to get up from the ground, his face was so dark that it was about to drip ink.","He hasn’t been so embarrassed in so many years! To be beaten like this! Moreover, the opponent was still a measly girl who could only brag and hug a man’s thighs!","“You...You damn girl, you still sneak attack? Do you still have a bit of cultivator integrity? Do you think that you passed the test if you knock me down with a sneak attack while I’m not paying attention?”","Elder Chen had an old face, red and white, desperately emphasizing that Huang Yueli was able to defeat him with this move only because of a “sneak attack”!","When Huang Yueli heard this, she had an innocent expression on her face, “Sneak attack? When did I ever make a sneak attack? Wasn’t it you who said it just now? You were the very person who said ‘start’? So, I made a move? What’s wrong?”","“You...!”","Elder Chen wanted to refute, but he couldn’t refute, holding his breath in his chest.","Just now, he had indeed told Huang Yueli to start, but everyone thought that Li Moying would stop, so they all turned their heads to look at Li Moying.","Who would have thought that Li Moying was still silent, but this little girl couldn’t wait to make a move!","Thinking of this, Elder Chen couldn’t help but glared at Huang Yueli.","This little girl actually played tricks, causing him to stumble badly. He must get her back this time.","He quickly waved his hand, “I just said start, didn’t you say no? How can this be considered an official start? Your test results just now don’t count, let’s start over!”","The few people present were speechless for a while.","Elder Chen was obviously going to play tricks!","Huang Yueli frowned and said, “You said start and now that you’ve lost, you want to go back on your words? Are all the stewards of Floating Sea so good at cheating?”","Elder Chen’s old face suddenly turned livid!","He has always wanted to save face. If he changed his usual routine, he would be fine if he was accused of cheating!","But now, even if he is ridiculed by Huang Yueli like this, he still has to bite the bullet and compete another round with her. Otherwise, the news that he lost to a female liar with one move will spread, and he will be even more ashamed!","“Anyway, if I say it doesn’t count, it doesn’t count! If you are strong enough, you can still pass the test again. If you don’t dare to do it again, it means you are simply opportunistic!”","Elder Chen’s unreasonable words made Steward Jiang and the steward in white blush."]},{"number":4027,"title":"Chapter 4027 Obviously Wants To Play Tricks (3)","paragraphs":["4027 Obviously Wants To Play Tricks (3)","If there was a hole in the ground, I’m afraid they couldn’t help but drill into it.","They didn’t expect that Elder Chen, who usually looks like a reliable person, would turn into this after losing the competition with others!","After Huang Yueli heard what he said, a mocking smile curled up on the corner of her mouth.","She looked at Elder Chen for a while, shrugged, and said casually: “Alright, since you are not convinced, then let’s compete again. But next time, you can’t play tricks!”","“This old man will play tricks? Stop talking nonsense here!” Elder Chen said angrily: “Stop talking nonsense, now the competition has officially started. The old man asked you to make the move first!”","“No way! Elder Chen, forget it!”","“That’s right, Elder Chen, even if Madam Li is lucky, how bad would it be to repent like this?”","Seeing that the two were about to fight again, Steward Baiyi and Steward Jiang couldn’t keep silent any longer, so they hurriedly stopped them one after another.","They really felt that Elder Chenqiang’s unreasonable and temporary repentance would damage Floating Sea’s prestige, but it was not for this reason that he spoke out to stop him.","Because of being defeated, Elder Chen became angry from embarrassment for a while. He only wanted to compete again, defeating Huang Yueli cleanly to regain his position. He never thought about why he lost just now!","However, the steward in white and Steward Jiang are the ones who are on the sidelines.","After the initial shock dissipated, they recalled the moment when Huang Yueli made a move just now, and they couldn’t help being shocked in their hearts!","This little girl looks delicate and fragile, but in that lightning-like moment just now, she was extremely decisive!","Whether it was the strength and purity of profound strength, or the speed and angle of her attack, they were all perfect. Even the two stewards dare not say that they can be stronger than her!","At this moment, the strength she revealed was simply shocking!","If such a shot is not accidental, it can only explain one problem, that is... This Madam Li may really have the god-level talent that she had claimed","Even if Huang Yueli made the move just now just by accident, it also shows that she is at least a top-notch talent, otherwise no matter how lucky she is, she will not be able to defeat a strong person in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm with one move.","Although the two stewards were very reluctant to believe this, they couldn’t think of any other explanations other than this.","It was only after they figured this out that they realized that Elder Chen really wanted to compete with Huang Yueli again, so they rushed out to stop it.","If Huang Yueli is really a god-level genius, then her real strength may not be far from Li Moying’s.","Elder Chen compared with her again, but he couldn’t get much of a difference in results.","In case a horse stumbles and loses...","That’s more embarrassing than just now!","At least it could be said that it was a momentary negligence just now. they didn’t expect Huang Yueli to make a sudden move. If he loses now, there will be no excuses to make!","The two stewards were very anxious, and they couldn’t say it directly, so they could only vaguely explain it.","But such a persuasion was not convincing at all to Elder Chen’s ears!","He said such preposterous words just to re-compete, how could he give up now because of the few words from the two stewards?","Huang Yueli paused for a moment, wanting to give Elder Chen a chance to repent.","She also didn’t want to offend Floating Sea’s senior Steward as soon as she came.","But who knows, when Elder Chen saw that she was not moving, he simply urged: “What are you still doing in a daze? If you don’t want to compete, then you fail!”"]},{"number":4028,"title":"Chapter 4028 Obviously Wants To Play Tricks (4)","paragraphs":["4028 Obviously Wants To Play Tricks (4)","This old man was really as stubborn as a mule!","Huang Yueli was rendered speechless momentarily before she started to concentrate and condense her profound energy. Very soon, a sea of flames enveloped her body.","The surging energy fluctuations erupted suddenly, carrying astonishing power, which caused the surrounding temperature to rise significantly in an instant.","Although the Steward in white and Steward Jiang had already prepared, they were still shocked by Huang Yueli’s strength! He even took a few steps back subconsciously.","Elder Chen had a bit of contempt on his face just now, but at this moment, it has completely turned into shock.","“You...you...how is it possible?”","However, before he could finish stammering in shock, Huang Yueli made a move!","The flames turned into countless sharp arrows, attacking Elder Chen in an overwhelming manner.","The entire arena seemed to be shrouded in her flames!","After all, Elder Chen was a master in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm, and also a cultivator with wind attribute. Although he was stunned for a moment at first, after reacting, he dodged very fast..","However, before he could heave a sigh of relief, Huang Yueli’s next move followed closely behind.","In the flames that filled the sky, only Elder Chen’s tiny figure was seen, dodging back and forth between the sharp arrows turned into flames, like a flat boat in the vast ocean, it seemed that it might capsize anytime and anywhere.","At this moment, the white robed steward and Steward Jiang were stunned.","Even though they had already guessed that Huang Yueli’s strength might be very strong, they never expected that she would be suppressing Elder Chen the whole time!","It’s true that Elder Chen was already old, and at most he can only display 70% of his strength compared to his peak in his youth. Moreover, in this small confined space, the fire attribute has an advantage over the wind attribute.","But, no matter what, there was a big gap between the two of them!","Huang Yueli’s age, I don’t know if there is a fraction of Elder Chen’s age.","How could she beat Elder Chen into such a mess? ?","At this time, Elder Chen was completely in a mess, and his mind was still in a state of confusion. He was dodging completely based on his years of fighting instinct.","He couldn’t figure it out, he had already taken this competition seriously, yet he was suppressed by this little girl?","Wasn’t the move that the little girl knocked him down just now by accident? Was she really that strong? Even if what she filled out on the registration form was true, and she was really a cultivator in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm, wasn’t it absolutely impossible for her to be this strong?","What’s wrong with this world? Was he still living in the same world he knew?","Elder Chen had been attacked by Huang Yueli for a period and he was at a disadvantage all tihs while. Now that he had been distracted, his condition was very bad. Naturally, he was suppressed more and more by Huang Yueli.","Even unable to completely dodge all the attacks, Huang Yueli’s flames touched his clothes and hair, and his body started to smoke.","“Damn it! If this goes on, I’m really going to lose!”","A cultivator in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm would be ashamed to be beaten up like this by a little girl. If he was still defeated head-on in the official competition, then he could really buy a piece of tofu and kill himself with it!","Elder Chen has no other choice. He has already decided to use his most powerful move!","Although if he used ahis most powerful killer move against a teenage girl, his reputation will be ruined, but it’s still a little bit better than losing!","However, when Elder Chen was desperately building himself up mentally, suddenly, the flames in the sky were extinguished in an instant."]},{"number":4029,"title":"Chapter 4029 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (1)","paragraphs":["4029 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (1)","This accident happened too fast and too suddenly!","Elder Chen couldn’t come back to his senses at all. At this time, he was still secretly elated, thinking that Huang Yueli’s profound energy had finally been exhausted after attacking for so long, and finally revealed flaws!","He was preparing to seize this opportunity and turn defeat into victory in one fell swoop!","So, as soon as Huang Yueli retreated, he immediately gathered a large amount of profound energy and attacked her fiercely.","“Elder Chen, stop!”","“You can’t do it!”","Steward in white and Steward Jiang screamed at the same time.","When Elder Chen heard their cries, he thought they were afraid that he would hurt Huang Yueli, so he would not be able to explain, so he snorted coldly and said, “It’s alright, the old man has his own... ”","However, before he finished speaking, he suddenly widened his eyes, and realized that Huang Yueli, who was just in front of him, had disappeared for some reason.","Elder Chen was taken aback and wanted to stop, but he had already made this move, and his profound strength burst out along the meridians, so it was too late to take it back.","He could only watch helplessly as he slammed into a huge stone pillar in the arena!","“Boom...”","There was a loud noise, and dust was flying all around.","Both stewards were choking and coughing.","However, they didn’t care about dodging, and rushed to the front in a hurry to see what happened to Elder Chen.","The pillars in the martial arts arena had been engraved with defensive arrays for reinforcement, so even though they have withstood a blow with 80% of the strength of a strong man in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm, they have not been completely broken.","Elder Chen’s right fist was completely embedded in the pillar, and the cracks on the stone pillar were like spider webs, which looked shocking.","“Elder Chen, you...how are you? Sigh, I reminded you to stop just now, why are you still...”","“This is too bad, Elder Chen. The bone in your right wrist seems to be broken! Although it’s a traumatic injury, it’s not easy to treat if it’s broken at this location. I’ll send you to the doctor on the island right away. We can’t waste any time.”","The two stewards looked anxious.","Since Elder Chen used too much force when he made his move just now, under the recoil, this force broke his wrist in seven or eight pieces on the spot! It can be said that it was broken into small pieces.","For cultivators, it is no problem to heal such trauma, but Elder Chen was so old, his recovery ability was not as good as that of young people, and it may affect his strength in the future.","Elder Chen covered his wrist with his other hand. The severe pain made his face turn pale, but he didn’t bother to look at his wrist at all. Instead, he turned his head and stared at Huang Yueli in disbelief.","“You, you, you... little girl, what happened just now? Why did you stop suddenly? You... are just kidding me!”","When Elder Chen made his move, he never thought that Huang Yueli would run away suddenly. He was caught off guard and made such an ugly mess.","It’s like two teams are in a tug-of-war, and both sides are using all their strength. At this time, one of them suddenly lets go of the rope, and the other party just falls on their backs!","At this moment, Elder Chen felt that he had gone through such a process, and his heart was extremely stuffy!","He felt that although he was beaten by Huang Yueli just now, in fact, he had a better chance of winning.","Given Huang Yueli’s cultivation base and age, the purity and thickness of her profound strength is definitely not as good as his. In the end, Huang Yueli will definitely lose."]},{"number":4030,"title":"Chapter 4030 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (2)","paragraphs":["4030 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (2)","But who knew, just when his victory was in sight, that little girl just...withdrew?","And even made it like this, made him a fool, and caused him such a big embarrassment!","Elder Chen stared at Huang Yueli with fierce eyes. If Li Moying was not standing here, he might not be able to resist rushing up to compete with Huang Yueli for the third time!","Huang Yueli looked calm, as if she didn’t feel his anger at all.","“Elder Chen, why can’t I understand what you said? The stewards have confirmed with me just now that for this cultivation test, I only need to match ten moves with you. Hasn’t it been ten moves already?”","As Huang Yueli said, she looked around innocently, and asked, “What? Could it be that I misremembered? It wasn’t ten moves?”","Elder Chen spat out a mouthful of blood on the spot with a “pfffft”.","His mouthful of blood had been held back since he saw Huang Yueli’s registration form, until now, and finally he couldn’t hold it back anymore.","Ten moves!","That’s right, they agreed on ten moves!","Because this was not a formal competition at all, but a test of Huang Yueli’s cultivation! And he is also an examiner responsible for appraising each other’s cultivation.","But what about the result? Not only was he beaten and run around by a girl whose cultivation was a whole realm lower than his, but in the end he even completely forgot that this was a test!","Elder Chen still felt that he had been tricked. Huang Yueli’s sudden withdrawal without warning was definitely premeditated.","However, he couldn’t say any words of rebuttal.","Because what Huang Yueli said was too reasonable.","They agreed on ten moves. If he didn’t give up, he would have already violated the agreement. If there was a problem between the two, it should definitely be him!","It wasn’t the little girl’s fault at all!","Huang Yueli stared at Elder Chen’s blue and white face for a while, and seeing that he didn’t speak, she looked at the steward in white again, “So...What’s the situation? Did I pass the cultivation test?”","When everyone heard the words, they almost vomited blood.","At this moment, she still asked if she passed!","Anyone with eyes can see it, alright? Could it be that she herself didn’t know?","The steward in white sighed inwardly, but he had already been asked the question, so he had to answer, so he could only nod his head, “That’s right, it was exactly ten strokes just now, congratulations, Madam Li, you have passed the cultivation test !”","Huang Yueli immediately showed a smile, “So, my registration form is fine? I can submit it?”","The Steward in white was even more helpless, but, thinking of the astonishing strength that Huang Yueli had shown just now, he could only nod his head and say, “No problem, the form is here with me, Madam Li, don’t worry.”","At this moment, the steward in white felt not only admiration, but also fear!","Such a young cultivator with such strength...","If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed such a thing even if he was killed.","Thinking of this, he secretly took a look at Li Moying, thinking to himself, wondering who was more powerful, Young Master Li or his wife?","Speaking of which, what kind of luck did the Cloudy Qilin Clan have? Two god-level geniuses appeared at the same time!","This was the smoke rising from the ancestral graves... No, the smoke is directly rising into the sky, right?","In the next few decades, I am afraid that the power structure of the entire God Realm will change because of this...","Li Moying stretched out his hand towards Huang Yueli and said gently as he looked at her affectionately, “Come here.”"]},{"number":4031,"title":"Chapter 4031 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (3)","paragraphs":["4031 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (3)","The girl who was killing all directions just now turned into a cute little fox, trotted back to her husband, and hugged his arm.","“Husband, did I do very well just now? Am I not very powerful?” Huang Yueli grinned.","Li Moying held her wrist, brought her into his arms, raised his hand and wiped the sweat from her forehead, “Well, it’s very good! My darling wife is really making great progress.”","“It’s my dear husband who taught me well.” Huang Yueli took advantage of the opportunity to rub her small head against Li Moying’s big hand.","Li Moying looked at her even more gently.","The steward in white and Steward Jiang were dumbfounded.","Just now Li Moying didn’t make a sound to stop Huang Yueli’s competition with Elder Chen, and even during the whole battle between the two, he remained expressionless and silent, they thought Li Moying was nothing more than that to this lady. Now, Seeing her brag about herself and her husband affirming her in such a doting manner, made him feel ashamed!","Now it seems that it wasn’t the case that he didn’t care about his wife. He clearly thinks his wife was very powerful. Such a kind of competition was not dangerous at all, it’s just an opportunity for her to hone her fighting skills.","Poor Elder Chen, who knows nothing about this, has become Madam Li’s testing stone.","Moreover, a man as cold and strong as Li Moying can actually show such a gentle expression in front of his wife, and even wipe her sweat!","The two stewards felt that their eyes were about to go blind!","Li Moying checked that his little fox didn’t lose even a hair, and curled his lips in satisfaction.","“It’s getting late, we should go back and rest.”","Huang Yueli nodded again and again, “Yeah, I’m almost starving to death! I really didn’t expect that it would take so long just to register.”","Li Moying snorted coldly, “There are too many people without knowledge, that’s all, just ignore them.”","After finishing speaking, he didn’t say anything to the stewards, took his wife’s little hand, and walked straight to the exit.","The two stewards who had no knowledge were drenched in cold sweat, and they didn’t dare to say a word.","Offending a god-level genius was bad enough, but it’s not the worst.","Because, they offended two of them in a row today, it’s worth crying just thinking about it.","Seeing that Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already reached the door, Elder Chen suddenly jumped out again and shouted loudly: “Wait, you can’t just leave like this! This old man will have another match with you!”","Huang Yueli paused, turned her head, and raised her eyebrows in surprise, “What? You want to compete again? But, haven’t I already passed the test for my cultivation?”","“That’s just a test of cultivation, the old man still has to formally compete with you... Mmmmmmm!!”","In the middle of what Elder Chen said, he was suddenly held down by Steward Jiang and the steward in white.","The steward in white tightly covered Elder Chen’s mouth to keep him from making a sound.","At the same time, he smiled dryly at Huang Yueli, “I’m sorry, Young Master Li, Madam Li, Elder Chen is getting old and his mind is a bit confused, so don’t take it to heart. It’s really not early, both of you should go back and rest quickly. The residence where the Cloudy Qilin Clan stayed is at the southeast corner of the island.”","It wasn’t until Huang Yueli and Li Moying left that the two stewards let go.","Elder Chen was so angry that he was about to explode, “Why are you two stopping me! I just accidentally let her got the upper hand just now, and her last move was clearly a trick!”"]},{"number":4032,"title":"Chapter 4032 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (4)","paragraphs":["4032 Isn’t It Embarrassing Enough? (4)","“If I compete seriously, I will definitely defeat her easily! I can’t just let it go!”","Elder Chen still refuses to admit defeat.","The steward in white glared at him, “Elder Chen, you...don’t you feel ashamed enough?”","“Shameful? It’s even more shameful for the old man to admit defeat like this!”","Steward in white and Steward Jiang looked at each other, knowing that Elder Chen’s stubborn temper had come up again.","His biggest shortcoming was his stubbornness. He has been like this since he was young, and he has made many enemies because of this.","The two had no choice but to save face for him, so they could only speak clearly.","“Elder Chen, don’t continue. You are in the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm. If you really want to say it, your strength must be stronger. But, even if you win again, what face can you get back? You forgot, Madam Li is not yet twenty years old this year! Moreover, she only has a mid-stage cultivation of the Heart Profound Realm...”","Originally, Elder Chen had an angry expression on his face, but when he heard this, the expression on his face suddenly froze.","He suddenly remembered the content on the side of the registration form. His whole body felt as if he had been struck by a thunderbolt from the beginning to the end, and he couldn’t recover for a long time.","That’s right, that Young Miss Li was only eighteen years old, only at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","And when he fought her with all his strength just now, he had already had the illusion that the opponent was a cultivator of the same level as him, but in fact... the opponent was just a little girl whose cultivation level was much lower than his!","In other words, the information that that little girl filled in on the registration form is not only true, but she also has a fighting power far beyond her cultivation!","This is... a true peerless genius!","She really has a god-level talent!","After realizing this, Elder Chen suddenly shook, fell to the ground, and passed out.","“Elder Chen, how are you doing?”","“Hurry up, take Elder Chen out!”","...","On the other side, Huang Yueli hugged her husband’s arm and obediently followed him to the residence of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","As one of the biggest forces in the God Realm, the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s inn is quite good. Not only is it a treasure land with rich profound energy, but it also has a very beautiful courtyard.","Li Moying’s room is naturally the most comfortable and luxurious.","As soon as the two of them entered the room, Huang Yueli rubbed her stomach and complained that she was hungry. Li Moying doted on his wife and hurriedly ordered the maid to prepare food.","Not long after, someone knocked on the door.","“It’s so fast! That’s great!” Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, and she hurried to the door to open it.","As a result, when the door opened, it was not the maid who was carrying the food, but Li Shihong and several Elders were standing outside instead.","“Huh? Patriarch and the Elders, why are you here at this time?”","When Li Shihong saw her, he was pleasantly surprised, “Young Miss Li! And Moying! It’s really you who have finally arrived at the Floating Sea! Where did you two go? It’s a day later than the time we agreed on, and if you were even later, you’re going to be late for registration! This was making me worried to death!”","Huang Yueli laughed dryly, “He he, this... There was an accident on the road, but didn’t we catch up? Sorry, we’ve let the Patriarch worry about it.”","Li Shihong looked at her, then at Li Moying, he was relieved.","“It’s good that you are here, it’s good that you are here! You are not here these days, there are too many rumors outside, I also heard a particularly outrageous one today, saying that the Young Master of our Cloudy Qilin Clan actually mixed in with ordinary cultivators and queued up to sign up. And what kind of cultivation test did you participate in, destroying a test array in Floating Sea!”"]},{"number":4033,"title":"Chapter 4033 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (1)","paragraphs":["4033 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (1)","Hearing this, Huang Yueli could only continue to laugh dryly.","“Ahem, is that right? Are there still such rumors?”","Li Shihong said indignantly: “Really, Young Miss Li? You also think this kind of rumor is too outrageous, right? Those who spread such rumors must have never seen anything in the world, and they don’t even know that Ancient God cultivators don’t need to queue up to sign up.” Even if ordinary people are like this, Moying, as the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, how could he be squeezed together with ordinary cultivators? He also participated in the cultivation test? Which Steward is so blind that he dares to let Moying participate in the cultivation test? There are ten test arrays, all of which must be dismantled by him!”","The corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth kept twitching.","She wanted to say something to get around this embarrassing topic, but she really didn’t know what to say.","Li Shihong’s guess was not correct in any way.","Wasn’t it too embarrassing to tell the truth directly?","She didn’t expect that gossip would spread so quickly in Floating Sea!","She and Li Moying had just left from the testing array. In less than an hour, even Li Shihong and the others, who stayed at in, had already heard the rumors.","It must be because the Floating Sea is too small and there are too many cultivators gathered.","Li Moying didn’t have as many scruples as Huang Yueli. After hearing what Li Shihong had said, he calmly said, “Patriarch, you misunderstood. This rumour is true. They are talking about me.”","He said it lightly, but when Li Shihong and several elders heard it, they were all stunned.","“What... what do you mean? Moying, what did you just say? Is that really you?”","Li Moying nodded.","Li Shihong looked at him in disbelief, “You...you are alright and ran to queue up to sign up? Don’t you know that our family has already signed up for you? Also, why are you going to take some kind of cultivation test? ”","After thinking about it, Li Shihong found it incredible.","Li Moying ran to queue, but it is possible that this god-level genius is devoted to cultivation and doesn’t know about the affairs of the family, so he doesn’t know that the clan has signed up for him.","However, he still took part in the cultivation test, and even destroyed his array!","This really doesn’t sound like something Li Moying would do.","He has always been a cold and arrogant person. If others did not provoke him, he would not be bothered to take the initiative to deal with others.","Li Moying frowned slightly, feeling that Li Shihong had too many questions.","However, after he glanced at the little fox beside him, he still patiently explained.","“I know that the clan has signed up for me, but my Little Li’er still needs to sign up for the competition. I don’t worry about her going to the queue alone, so I went with her. After reading our information, several stewards of Floating Sea seem to not believe that there could not be two god-level geniuses in the God Realm, so he felt that we were lying and made things difficult for us. In desperation, we could only follow them to test the array...”","He gave a general explanation, and the elders immediately pieced together the cause and effect.","To be honest, their first reaction was not to share the same hatred with Li Moying, but to empathize with the steward of Floating Sea.","Back then, when they hadn’t seen Huang Yueli’s score in the illusion array with their own eyes, they also felt that it was impossible for her to be a peerless genius comparable to Li Moying.","But later, they were all severely slapped in the face by Huang Yueli!","But, they all really feel wronged. It was perfectly normal for them to think like that, alright?"]},{"number":4034,"title":"Chapter 4034 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (2)","paragraphs":["4034 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (2)","The ones who were really abnormal were Li Moying and the lady beside him.","Such kind of perverse talent was beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","And Li Shihong is worthy of being the Patriarch. Apart from emotion, he quickly noticed another key point.","“Wait, wait a minute! Moying, you said just now that you accompanied Young Miss Li to sign up? Why did she go to the queue to sign up alone?”","Li Moying did not answer, but turned his gaze to the little fox beside him.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, looking innocent she replied coyly, “Oh? I don’t have to wait in line? But, I’m a human race, and I don’t belong to any first-class power, so I must have to wait in line, right?”","When Li Shihong heard this, he immediately became anxious, and hurriedly said: “Young Miss Li, you... what are you talking about? Aren’t you and Moying already together? The engagement ceremony will be held soon! Then You are a member of our Cloudy Qilin Clan! Of course you can sign up with the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Sigh, what are you wasting your time in line for?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli frowned, still puzzled, “Patriarch, what you said is not right? After all, Moying and I are not engaged yet! Even if it’s settled, it’s not official yet. We aren’t husband and wife? According to the God Realm’s past practice, only husband and wife can be regarded as the same power by default. If they are not married, then both parties belong to their own power. Even if they are unmarried couples, they can’t be confused!”","When Li Shihong heard this, he became even more anxious.","“Oh, Young Miss Li, of course what you said is correct, but isn’t your situation different from that of Moying? You have no other forces behind you, and you are not a child of any other God Clans, so you should be the same as us, Moying?”","Huang Yueli frowned, shook her head again and again, and said with a serious expression: “Patriarch, I appreciate your kindness, but this is really different! Although I am in love with Young Master Li now, but, we’re not married. After all, there are still variables, maybe we will quarrel and separate in a few days? Besides, if I remember correctly, the Patriarch seems to want to marry Brother Moying to a young lady of the same clan? Not to mention, at first, you disagreed with us being together. What if you go back on your word in a few days?”","“Repent? How is this possible? Young Miss Li, don’t think about it. In the eyes of all members of our Cloudy Qilin Clan, you are the best match for Moying!”","Li Shihong hurriedly patted his chest, desperately promising.","Back then, he had sent women to Li Moying’s bed, and arranged various fiancees for him. He had even been on guard several times, worrying that Li Moying would get too close to the female doctor beside him.","Thinking back on those actions back then, he can’t wait to go back to the past and give himself a few resounding blows!","He doesn’t know what was wrong with him! What was he thinking! Was he blind?","He couldn’t even recognize such a peerless genius in front of him!","If he had found out earlier and brought this Young Miss Li and Li Moying together earlier, then at least the engagement ceremony has been completed now, and it would be a logical thing to pull Young Miss Li to the chariot of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","But it’s over now, Young Miss Li was desperately unwilling to fight on behalf of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","“I didn’t get married yet, so I rushed to fight for Moying’s family. If it spreads, it would appear that I’m worthless!”"]},{"number":4035,"title":"Chapter 4035 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (3)","paragraphs":["4035 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (3)","Hearing Huang Yueli’s complaints, Li Shihong was about to cry.","He was thinking in his heart, ‘You still dare to say that you are worthless, who would dare to think that you are worthless! Can’t you see that even the majestic Cloudy Qilin Clan, the whole clan is almost kneeling down to you?","However, no matter what Li Shihong and the Elders said, Huang Yueli insisted that it was inappropriate to represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the competition now!","And Li Shihong and the others had nothing to do with Huang Yueli.","Even in an ordinary family, if the new daughter-in-law’s family background was particularly strong or the dowry was particularly large, she will have a lot of status in her husband’s family and have a great say.","Now it’s the Ancient God Clan, the reason was the same.","After all, the dowry that Huang Yueli brought in was the only one in the entire God Realm – a god-level peerless genius! Talented bloodline!","She was so headstrong, Li Shihong and others have to be careful with her, for fear that a word will offend this ancestor and turn her head away from marrying their Young Master. It would be too late to cry then.","Seeing that the Patriarch had been rejected several times, and he was a bit unable to step down, Li Yuntao had an idea, pulled Li Shihong aside, and whispered persuasion in his ear.","“Patriarch, Young Miss Li is not competing in the name of our Cloudy Qilin Clan this time, and it’s actually not a bad thing! After the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over, Young Miss Li’s reputation will definitely spread throughout the God Realm. The top genius in the world will come to propose marriage...”","When Li Shihong heard this, he couldn’t take it any longer, and interrupted him, “This is not a bad thing! So many people come to propose marriage, what if Young Miss Li changes her mind?”","Li Yuntao hastily said: “Patriarch, you are wrong. Although Young Miss Li is very outstanding, how can our Young Master not be as good as her? She is also extremely talented and a good-looking talent! Let me ask you, among the young generation of the God Clan, who can compare to him? How blind must Young Miss Li be to be able to see others?”","Hearing this, Li Shihong thought for a while, and his brows gradually relaxed.","“That’s right, Moying and Young Miss Li are naturally the best match. However, I’m afraid that Madam Li is young and doesn’t know how important a man’s strength is. If she is deceived by sweet words...”","Li Yuntao laughed, “The Patriarch is too worried. This subordinate has heard a lot of things from the tribe these days. It is said that our Young Master usually looks cold and unapproachable, but in front of Young Miss Li, he is no worse than others when talking sweet words!”","“Really?” Li Shihong was a little suspicious, and his eyes subconsciously fell on Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","Seeing that the Elders started discussing again, these two people simply ignored the others and sat down beside them.","Li Moying held Huang Yueli’s hand, and his eyes flashed with worry, “Why did it take so long for a snack? It’s been so long, I’d better go and see for myself.”","“No need.” Huang Yueli hurriedly grabbed the man who got up to leave, “Actually, that maid left not long ago, just wait.”","Li Moying frowned slightly, “If I knew it earlier, I should have taken you to dinner before coming back. I didn’t think it through.”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help coughing a few times, “Ahem, let’s forget it! If we eat in restaurants outside, we probably won’t be able to come back!”","Floating Sea’s gossip spread faster than lightning, and the two of them became famous this time.","When they sat down in the restaurant, she wondered how many people would be attracted, wanting to see Young Master Li’s peerless demeanor!","Sigh, why does this scene feel a little familiar?"]},{"number":4036,"title":"Chapter 4036 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (4)","paragraphs":["4036 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (4)","It seems that before they were reborn in their previous life, wherever they went, this effect was the same...","Seeing the two of them close together, almost looking as if they were nibbling each other’s ears, looking extremely intimate in the manner they interacted, the big stone in Li Shihong’s heart finally fell to the ground.","“That’s right, after all, Moying is still reliable. There is nothing in this world that he can’t do. Even marrying a wife doesn’t need us Elders to worry about it.”","Li Yuntao smiled and said: “Think about it, when the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over and the young lady’s reputation is in full swing, we will announce the marriage of the two of you. Wouldn’t that be better than getting engaged now? At that time, I don’t know how many young people’s heart will be broken, which shows the ability of our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Li Shihong nodded again and again, “What Elder Tao said is absolutely true!”","When Li Shihong and Li Yuntao talked, although their voices were very low, Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s five senses were very strong, even beyond the imagination of the elders.","Therefore, they could hear the conversation between the two.","Hearing Li Yuntao’s words, Huang Yueli and her husband looked at each other with strange expressions.","By the time the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over, Huang Yueli’s identity may have been completely exposed.","When the time comes, they really hope that Li Shihong can announce their marriage as proudly as today...","Don’t fight with members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan on the spot!","If possible, they also wouldn’t like to elope...","After discussing with several elders, Li Shihong decided not to interfere with the young couple’s decision, comforted them again, and left.","...","At this moment, in the luxurious Island Master’s mansion in the middle of Floating Sea.","Elder Chen, Steward Jiang and the steward in white were standing anxiously in the corridor and waiting.","“The Island Master agrees to see you. The three stewards, please come with me.” A maid came over.","The three of them followed her into a room.","As soon as they entered the door, they felt a powerful coercion filling every corner of the room, making their chest tight, and lowered their head involuntarily, adopting a submissive posture.","The three of them became more and more tense, not even daring to speak out.","Being able to be the master of the most legendary ancient power of the Gods, the Floating Sea, the Island Master’s own strength was the top in the entire God Realm. It is said that he has already stepped into the helm of the Life Profound Realm thousands of years ago.","To this day, no one knows to what extent his strength has reached.","Usually, the Island Master has been in seclusion all the time, and he will only leave the seclusion before and after the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","If it weren’t for this, it would be impossible for the three stewards to see the Island Master.","The three of them waited for a short while, but it felt like several years.","“You guys came to see the Island Master. I heard that it’s for the array pattern to test one’s cutivation? Do you know that although this array is not of high grade, it was specially created by a god-level array master hundreds of thousands of years ago for Floating Sea? It’s design and layout unique to the entire God Realm?”","Hearing the low voice of the Island Master, the three of them shuddered involuntarily.","At this time, they were extremely regretful in their hearts. Today, they were impulsive during the day and offended that little evil star, Huang Yueli.","Otherwise, there was no need to risk their own life to ask for the array pattern.","Elder Chen bit the bullet and said: “My Lord, it’s all subordinate’s fault for this matter. It’s because I was too reckless and short-sighted that this happened...”","He still wanted to describe the scene in detail, but the Island Master had already interrupted him.","“Needless to say, I already know the situation of that time.”"]},{"number":4037,"title":"Chapter 4037 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (5)","paragraphs":["4037 The Entire God Realm Will Be In Chaos (5)","Hearing this, the three stewards all shivered, and cold sweat broke out on their backs.","They’ve heard a long time ago that although the Island Master seldom leaves the Island Master’s mansion, he’s very clear about everything that happened in Floating Sea.","They used to think that such a statement was exaggerated, but now they realize that it was all true.","And the performance of the three of them in front of Huang Yueli and Li Moying today can only be described as stupid.","They didn’t know what the Island Master would think of them.","Sure enough, the Island Master snorted heavily, and said: “You are a group of frogs in a well, you are standing in front of a god-level genius, and you can’t even recognize one. Yet you still think that the other party is a liar! How ridiculous! You have to wait to be taught a lesson by others. It is only after you’ve been slapped in the face so hard that you realize your mistakes. However, what happened today has become known to everyone, thanks to you, the Floating Sea has now become a joke of the entire God Realm!”","The three stewards all lowered their heads, their faces were full of shame, and they couldn’t even utter a single word of excuse.","This was not only because they were afraid of the strength of the Island Master, but also because they had truly realized their mistakes.","Now, it was different from usual. There are so many geniuses and experts from all over the God Realm gathered in Floating Sea. If any scandal happens, it only takes a few hours for every force to know about it.","The Island Master snorted again, “The three of you will all go to the punishment hall to receive your punishment later. Considering your meritorious service in Floating Sea for many years, you can avoid capital punishment, but living punishment cannot escape.”","The three kowtowed hurriedly, but none dared to beg for mercy.","“As for the array pattern that Miss Huang wanted... Someone, come, find it in the warehouse immediately, and send it to her tomorrow.”","The guards under the steps immediately responded.","When the three stewards heard this, they all showed a hint of doubt.","Isn’t the little girl next to Li Moying surnamed Li? Why did she become Miss Huang again?","Besides, isn’t the surname Huang exclusive to the Sacred Phoenix clan? How could she be surnamed Huang when she’s a human race?","Although they were full of suspicion, the three of them didn’t have the guts to make trouble in front of the Island Master, so they could only retreat in desperation, preparing to go to the punishment hall to receive their punishment.","After everyone left, the Island Master sat alone in the spacious chair, with a hint of worry on his face.","“I didn’t expect, I really didn’t expect... These two god-level geniuses would be... If this matter is not handled properly, the entire God Realm may be in chaos.”","...","In the northwest corner of the Floating Sea, the residence of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Huang Sanbai’s face was full of anxiety, and the wrinkles on his face were twisted together, making him look even older.","With his hands behind his back, he kept pacing back and forth, his heart full of ominous premonition and he was still muttering to himself.","“No, it’s impossible. This kind of thing shouldn’t have happened. The bones of that dead girl should have been turned into ashes! Otherwise, a few months ago, the Cloudy Qilin Clan would have found the girl for Li Moying. When negotiating with our clan, they will bring that little girl to threaten us! How could it be possible to keep silent?”","“Yes, that’s right, she must be dead, absolutely dead!”","What happened at the testing array today quickly spread throughout the Floating Sea. As the sworn enemies of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, the Sacred Phoenix clan probably reacted the most to this among all the forces.","The Cloudy Qilin Clan actually has two god-level geniuses!","If this was true, it would definitely mean the end for the Sacred Phoenix Clan."]},{"number":4038,"title":"Chapter 4038 Plan for Punishment (1)","paragraphs":["4038 Plan for Punishment (1)","In the next thousand years, the entire God Realm will be dominated by the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","As for the Sacred Phoenix Clan...if they were lucky, they may just be suppressed but if they were unlucky, they may even be exterminated!","After all, the relative peace between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix clan at this stage is based on the fact that the strength of the two clans was on par with each other, and that the other ten ancient god clans can restrain each other.","If the Cloudy Qilin Clan can really suppress all other forces, then the so-called God Realm peace contract would be nothing more than a piece of paper, and there was no way to protect the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","So, as soon as the news came out today, the Patriarch, Huang Tianhao, anxiously summoned the Elders of the clan to hold a meeting to discuss the matter.","This discussion continued until late at night, but no conclusion was reached.","The most elusive point of the whole incident was that Huang Yueli did not conduct the cultivation test in front of all the cultivators in the end, but followed the three stewards to the arena, out of everyone’s sights.","Now, the three stewards don’t know where they went, and no one can explain whether the little girl next to Li Moying was a god-level talent!","Therefore, on this point, the Elders of the Sacred Phoenix Clan had been divided into two factions.","One faction believes that the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan really found a god-level genius of the human race, and caught up with him with that handsome face. Now the Sacred Phoenix Clan is really over.","On the other hand, the other view is the opposite. They feel that there was no second god-level genius at all. This was all a conspiracy of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If they tell their lies, then it’s really over, and they should be completely ignored!","The two sides debated fiercely, only Huang Sanbai remained silent.","Because, after learning of this rumor, he immediately had a terrible conjecture in his heart, and this was something no one else could have imagined in their dreams.","At that time, he brought Huang Shuangyu and others to chase and kill Huang Yueli near Forest Shade Town. At that time, he already knew that Huang Yueli and Li Moying were married when they were in the lower realm!","If a girl with god-level talent suddenly appeared next to Li Moying, and she claimed to be his wife, then besides Huang Yueli, was there anyone else?","If Huang Yueli really comes back, then he was really doomed!","Huang Sanbai’s whole body was icy cold, and he was extremely nervous. He didn’t know how he got back after meeting with Huang Tianhao.","After returning, he immediately sent someone to find the eyeliner he had planted in the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","It was not until late at night that the eyeliner sneaked into Huang Sanbai’s room.","As soon as he saw the person coming, Huang Sanbai immediately greeted him excitedly, “Why are you here now?”","Hearing this, the eyeliner couldn’t help complaining, “Elder Sanbai, do you still think I came too late? I also want to ask, why are you looking for me at this time? It’s the period of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and the entire Floating Sea is full of people. I’m a cultivator from all major forces, so I’m easy to be caught by others if I do anything casually! I worked hard to avoid the cultivators from all major forces and successfully sneaked in.”","Huang Sanbai was so anxious that he ignored his complaints and asked directly: “Alright, don’t talk nonsense. Let me ask you, I heard that the Cloudy Qilin Clan found a girl with a god-level talent? Moreover, she also followed Li Moying together, is there such a thing?”","The eyeliner nodded, “I knew it, this is why you kept looking for me!”"]},{"number":4039,"title":"Chapter 4039 Plan for Punishment (2)","paragraphs":["4039 Plan for Punishment (2)","“I’m just the steward of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and I can’t compare to a real clansman. I can’t get definite information about many things. However, I’m basically sure that the things about the god-level genius are true.”","After hearing this, Huang Sanbai frowned, “What do you mean by ‘basically sure’?! Please explain clearly!”","The spy explained: “This is going to start from the beginning. A few days ago, Young Master Li was injured by you, Elder Sanbai, and he has been in a coma. The Cloudy Qilin Clan had been looking for a miracle doctor who can treat the Young Master. It was then when she followed her Senior Brother Liu Buyan to the Cloudy Qilin Clan together with Divine Doctor Liu. This Divine Doctor Liu has extraordinary medical skills, and he really cured the Young Master. Since then, Young Miss Li has been very close to the Young Master.”","“At that time, Li Shihong was still very worried about Li Moying’s marriage, and he promised all the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, any woman from any branch of the clan, as long as she can be the first to conceive Li Moying’s heir, she can become the Young Madam of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","“As a result, Li Moying has never been close to women, but he was getting closer to Young Miss Li. Li Shihong once wanted to drive Young Miss Li out, but then, something happened...”","He paused.","“What’s the matter, tell me quickly!” Huang Sanbai kept urging.","The spy briefly explained what happened to Huang Yueli’s trial in the Illusion Array at that time, because The spy had not personally seen the situation at that time, and even, as a foreigner, he couldn’t enter the training ground at all, so many details were unclear.","Huang Sanbai asked several times, but couldn’t get any more detailed information.","Seeing Huang Sanbai’s extremely entangled look, the spy hesitated for a moment, and still said: “Elder Sanbai, in my opinion, this Young Miss Li should indeed be a god-level genius. Although I have never seen her make a move, but, Everyone has seen Li Shihong and the elders’ performance during this time. If Young Miss Li was not really talented, they would not be able to flatter her so wholeheartedly, as if they were afraid that she would abandon Li Moying!”","After finishing speaking, he looked at Huang Sanbai, who looked like a mourning concubine, and persuaded in a heavy tone: “Elder Sanbai, please tell the Patriarch to make preparations as soon as possible. It is best to transfer the younger generation of the Sacred Phoenix Clan and retain their vitality. Just in case... Alas, the era of the Sacred Phoenix Clan seems to be over.”","Huang Sanbai couldn’t hear the spy’s advice to him at all.","At this moment, the fear in his heart has reached its peak!","From the description of the spy, it is not difficult for him to judge that this girl with divine talent must be Huang Yueli.","Even if he still had such a fluke mentality before, he can only wake up now.","Although he couldn’t figure it out anyway, how could Huang Yueli survive the desperate situation at that time, cured Li Moying, and even managed to hide her own identity and infiltrate the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","But, all these were facts!","Huang Sanbai’s mind was buzzing, he couldn’t believe that Huang Yueli’s luck would be so good!","Now that things have happened, can we just wait for Huang Yueli to expose everything he has done?","No, he can’t sit still!","Now that he already knows the other party’s identity, he can act first!","Thinking of this, he suddenly took a stride and stopped the spy who was about to leave.","“Wait a minute, I still have something to tell you.”"]},{"number":4040,"title":"Chapter 4040 Plan for Punishment (3)","paragraphs":["4040 Plan for Punishment (3)","“Elder Sanbai, what are you trying to do?” Seeing his excited look, the spy immediately became alert.","Huang Sanbai said: “The old man suddenly thought of an idea, which can solve this trouble once and for all.”","When the spy heard the words, his first reaction was to shake his head, “No, no, Elder Sanbai, don’t be impulsive! At this stage, the best way for our Sacred Phoenix Clan is to stand still. Let’s take a look at the Cloudy Qilin Clan first. Let’s talk about what to do over there, it is absolutely not suitable to act rashly! Even if there is any action, you have to discuss it with the Patriarch.”","“Tsk, look at how courageous you are, why are you so cowardly!” Huang Sanbai said with a look of hatred, “I can tell you, my plan is foolproof, killing people without anyone’s knowledge and it is most effective only if it is used now. If you miss the opportunity, it’s too late to think of a solution! Don’t you want to make this great contribution for the clan? With this contribution, you can be directly promoted to an Elder, and you don’t need to be a spy anymore!”","Huang Sanbai knew the details of this spy very well, so he immediately changed the subject and started to tempt him.","It has to be said that Huang Sanbai’s remarks were very deceptive.","To be promoted to an Elder, to become a real high-level member of the clan, and to be able to enjoy various resources of the clan without taking risks, is the greatest pursuit of every member of the clan.","The spy hesitated for a moment, “Then...Elder Sanbai, is your plan really foolproof?”","“Hehe, although it’s an exaggeration to be sure, even if it fails, it won’t implicate you. Because, to put it bluntly, this method is actually very simple.” Huang Sanbai stroked his beard and said slowly.","“Oh? Please enlighten me, Elder Sanbai.”","Huang Sanbai said: “After you return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, find a chance to see Li Shihong alone, and say...you found out the identity of that Young Miss Li, she is actually the missing god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan! ”","“What... what??” After hearing this, Yanlin’s legs softened and he almost fell to the ground.","Hearing what Huang Sanbai said so lightly, he really thought it was a trivial matter, but he didn’t expect that it was indeed a trivial matter, but he was asked to tell such a shocking lie.","Huang Sanbai said calmly: “The people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely protect the two god-level geniuses. It must be difficult for us to do it secretly. Therefore, if the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan can take the initiative to get rid of one of them, That would save us a lot of trouble. Of course, it is impossible for them to get rid of Li Moying, but, after all, that Young Miss Li is an outsider, we can still divide them by using the strategy of alienation.”","The spy thought about it carefully, and felt that it made sense, but he still shook his head, “Elder Sanbai, you have a good idea, but the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are not fools! How can they believe such nonsense? Our Sacred Phoenix The god-level genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, will he go to the Cloudy Qilin Clan? And kiss me with their Young Master? Hey, how can there be such a miracle in the world! If this can all come true, the sun would rise from the west?”","When Huang Sanbai heard this, the corners of his mouth couldn’t help twitching.","He didn’t know if the sun would rise from the west, but the god-level geniuses of the Sacred Phoenix Clan and the Cloudy Qilin Clan are really together!","However, as long as he alone knows this secret, it’s fine.","He coughed twice, “The old man knows that this statement is a bit outrageous, but we must find a way to make the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan think it is true.”"]},{"number":4041,"title":"Chapter 4041 Plan for Punishment (4)","paragraphs":["4041 Plan for Punishment (4)","The spy still thought it was impossible, and shook his head again and again, “It’s impossible! This kind of thing, if you think about it, you know it can’t be true. How can you convince them?”","Huang Sanbai smiled, and said: “It’s actually not difficult to convince the people of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but you haven’t figured out the key point. Think about it, in just two years, the God Realm unexpectedly has so many god-level geniuses, one from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, one from our Sacred Phoenix Clan, and now, even the human race has a god-level genius! Don’t you think it’s strange? When did the god-level geniuses become chinese cabbage that can be easily found on the street?”","“So, if you tell Li Shihong that the so-called god-level genius of the human race is the one who disappeared from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, even if he didn’t believe it at the time, he will inevitably have doubts and associations afterwards. If the members of the Phoenix Clan have any similarities, Li Shihong will definitely find her more suspicious the more he looks at her.”","The spy thought for a while, frowned, and said hesitantly: “Elder Sanbai, what you said is indeed reasonable. But... how does Young Miss Li resemble the Sacred Phoenix Clan? She is a human race! And she is also a Spirit Medicine Master. If we want to talk about it, it is only similar in age to the god-level genius we killed, but the Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely not doubt her because of her outrageous young age?”","Huang Sanbai smiled mysteriously again, and said slowly: “As far as I know, this Young Miss Li also seems to be majoring in fire-attribute exercises.”","The spy widened his eyes in shock, “Elder Sanbai, is this true? Where did the news come from?”","As the most important pawn of the Sacred Phoenix Clan under the eyes of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he doesn’t know anything about it!","Huang Sanbai laughed and said: “Don’t worry about it, the old man also found out by accident. Tell me, isn’t this a coincidence? Young Miss Li has such a high talent, is so young, and has a fire attribute. These three points, saying that she is not from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, probably no one will believe it? If there are other coincidences in normal times, I am afraid that people from the Cloudy Qilin Clan will not be suspicious!”","The spy frowned and thought for a while, but still hesitated.","After all, it is definitely not a trivial matter to deal with the young lady of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","As long as he is a little careless, his spy will be completely exposed. At that time, there must be only one dead end.","“This...but... Elder Sanbai, is your news reliable? If Young Miss Li is really of the fire attribute, it is impossible for the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to have no suspicion all the time and only want to match her with Young Master Li. Unless she has never made a move in front of the high-level Cloudy Qilin Clan, but in this case, Li Shihong can’t be sure of her true talent, right?”","Huang Sanbai snorted, and said, “Why don’t you even understand this? Didn’t you tell me just now that Li Shihong treated Li Shihong differently because of Young Miss Li’s amazing performance in the Illusion Array of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? What kind of place, even I, an outsider, has heard of it, so it’s impossible for you to know everything about it?”","Hearing what he said, his spy came back to his senses.","The situation inside the Illusion Array cannot be seen from the outside at all.","That is to say, when the little girl made a move, the top management of the Cloudy Qilin Clan didn’t actually see it with their own eyes at all, they just saw her Illusion Array points.","In this way, it made sense."]},{"number":4042,"title":"Chapter 4042 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (1)","paragraphs":["4042 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (1)","Seeing that his expression had softened, Huang Sanbai added, “Don’t worry, can I still harm you? There are only a few people in our clan who have a spy like you, so it’s impossible for me to let you die without being sure.”","Only then did the spy feel relieved.","The two discussed in the room for a while, and confirmed the details of the action to wait for.","Then, the spy didn’t stay any longer, and after finding the right time, he sneaked back to the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","...","The next day, as soon as Huang Yueli and Li Moying woke up, Liu Buyan came.","“Junior Sister, Junior Sister, I’ve heard about what happened to you yesterday, but I didn’t expect you...”","His excited voice stopped abruptly, and he looked at the young couple who hugged and kissed me early in the morning, with expressions of choking on dog food.","“Damn, didn’t you have enough intimacy last night? What did it look like this early in the morning? The door’s not even closed!” Liu Buyan accused them angrily.","Li Moying’s expression was cold, and he glanced at him lightly, “I thought that when most people enter other people’s rooms, they would know to knock on the door.”","Liu Buyan choked suddenly and couldn’t speak.","Indeed, just now he heard the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan telling about the test of the array yesterday, he was so excited for a moment, he ran over to talk to Huang Yueli and the others, seeing that the door was only ajar, he pushed the door open without hesitation and entered without knocking indeed.","He knew he was in the wrong, so he could only touch his nose and forcibly change the subject.","“He he, I didn’t? I don’t remember if I knocked on the door... Oh well, that’s right! I heard that when you signed up yesterday, you were questioned by the Steward of Floating Sea, and you directly destroyed their test array. I didn’t get to see such excitement! If I had known, I would have signed up with you.”","Because he didn’t want to be stuffed with the romantic atmosphere that was lingering around the two of them all day, Liu Buyan purposely didn’t follow them yesterday, and went to sign up alone.","The whole process of his registration was very smooth. He returned to the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s residence early and locked himself in his room to cultivate. He didn’t know that so many things happened after he retreated.","Looking back at this moment, he was really annoyed.","He has never seen such a big commotion!","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched, “You are really afraid that the world will not be chaotic! Your Junior Sister has been bullied by the steward of Floating Sea. You don’t want to come to help me get justice, but you want to come and have fun?”","Liu Buyan waved his hand disapprovingly, “Have you been bullied? Are you kidding me? It’s good that you didn’t bully others! Besides, you obviously bullied others yesterday! Such an array that has been used for tens of thousands of years has been ruined by you guys!”","Li Moying frowned slightly, and looked at Liu Buyan with displeasure.","“What on earth are you here for? If there’s nothing else, you can get out!”","He came back too late last night. Little Li’er went to bed after eating. He finally waited until his little fox woke up and wanted to eat some tofu. Finally, he kissed her but that stinky Liu Buyan had to come out from nowhere!","This guy was really lingering everywhere!","His voice was cold and severe. If it were someone else, he would have been scared out of his wits by Young Master Li’s power.","However, Liu Buyan was already used to him like this, and he was not affected at all, with a smug look on his face, “I came to give you information! I went to sign up yesterday, but I heard a lot of news. It’s especially about the masters who participated in the God Realm’s Grand Meet! How about it? Do you want to know? If you want to know, just ask me?”"]},{"number":4043,"title":"Chapter 4043 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (2)","paragraphs":["4043 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (2)","It was rare to be able to show off in front of these two, so Liu Buyan was very smug.","To participate in such a competition, strength was one aspect and intelligence was another aspect. They were equally important.","After all, only by knowing your enemy and yourself can one win every battle.","However, as soon as he spoke, both Huang Yueli and Li Moying cast contemptuous looks at him, and then completely ignored him.","After Liu Buyan was stunned for a moment, he couldn’t help jumping up, “Hey, didn’t you two listen to what I just said? You don’t want to know who are your biggest competitors in the God Realm’s Grand Meet?”","Huang Yueli curled her lips, “Should they all be heaven-level geniuses? I’ve heard that the strength of these people should not be much different from Li Leyun, so how strong can they be? Why bother?”","To her, dealing with the affairs of the Sacred Phoenix Clan was the most important thing.","Others were not worth wasting effort.","After Liu Buyan heard this, the corners of his mouth twitched, feeling depressed for a while.","He had been despised by his Junior Sister again!","The gap between this person and another person is too great!","Apart from these two monster-level geniuses in front of them, which other cultivators are not desperately seeking news about the participating masters? He even heard that the exclusive news sold in the teahouse have been sold at sky-high prices!","“Alright, I told you I’m not interested anymore, why haven’t you left yet?” Li Moying issued the order to evict the guest again.","Liu Buyan came back to his senses, and hurriedly said: “You really don’t want to hear it? In fact, the cultivators in the God Realm are not only heaven-level geniuses, some mysterious families will still have hidden masters participating in the competition, such as the Veracious Wyvern Clan, which was one of the special branches of the great god clans. Because the clan used to be the royal clan that dominated the gods. I heard that their geniuses are not divided by god-level and heaven-level grades, but have their own set of judgment standards. It’s hard to see how strong they are.”","These words caught the attention of Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","The two looked at each other and thought of Jun Sihan at the same time.","Jun Sihan and Li Moying once fought against the Sky Devil. At that time, his strength was slightly higher than Li Moying’s, and it was indeed beyond the reach of ordinary heaven-level geniuses.","“Brother, are you talking about Jun Sihan? Do you have any information about him?” Huang Yueli turned her head and asked.","Liu Buyan didn’t answer right away, but raised his chin, “Now you know how important I am?”","Huang Yueli laughed dryly, “Senior Brother, of course you are important! Is there any need to ask? If you have anything to say, hurry up and say it.”","Only then did Liu Buyan say: “The news about Jun Sihan is...he didn’t come.”","“Didn’t come?” Li Moying frowned slightly, looking very surprised, “How is this possible? Last time when I separated from Big Brother Jun, he made an appointment with me to fight in the God Realm. Besides, Even if he doesn’t want to come, for the honor of the Veracious Wyvern Clan, he has to come.”","As the Young Master of the clan, this was an inescapable responsibility.","Moreover, Jun Sihan is different from Li Moying. He grew up in the Veracious Wyvern Clan and has a great sense of clan honor. It is impossible for him to miss such a grand event.","Liu Buyan said: “Everyone finds it strange, but Jun Sihan really didn’t come, and the Veracious Wyvern Clan has confirmed the news. However, I heard some gossip that something happened to Jun Sihan’s son which was why he couldn’t make it. This must be fake, right? How could Jun Sihan have a son?”"]},{"number":4044,"title":"Chapter 4044 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (3)","paragraphs":["4044 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (3)","Jun Sihan was indeed a few years older than Li Moying, but not by much.","At least in the God Realm, he was still considered a teenager.","It was rare for a peerless genius with such a high talent to get married at such a young age. Like Huang Yueli and Li Moying, it can be said that there are not many couples in the entire God Realm.","And Jun Sihan was even more powerful, and he already has a son?","Wasn’t this nonsense?","Huang Yueli frowned, showing a bit of worry, “How could this happen? Something happened to Yunxi’s son? How worried she must be! Sigh, it hasn’t been long since we left the Empyrean Fox Continent, and unexpectedly we didn’t even know about such a big event!”","Xia Yunxi was the first friend she made after arriving in God Realm.","When the two parted, Xia Yunxi even invited her to Veracious Wyvern Continent as a guest, saying that she would bring her son to her and recognize her as a godmother!","In the end, before she even saw her future godson, she said that something happened to him.","Moreover, Huang Yueli guessed that what happened to Jun Sihan’s son must not be trivial, otherwise, it would not affect the Young Master’s participation in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","Li Moying also frowned, but when he saw the worried face of the lady beside him, he calmed down and comforted her: “Don’t worry too much, the background of the Veracious Wyvern Clan even exceeds that of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan, no matter what happens, there must be a way to deal with it. When the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over, we will find a time to go and see them.”","Huang Yueli nodded, “Sigh, that’s the only way.”","Hearing the discussion between the two, Liu Buyan’s eyes widened.","“Wait, what do you two mean...Could it be that Jun Sihan really has a son?”","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “Yes, I heard from his wife himself that he is already five years old!”","The three of them were talking when suddenly someone knocked on the door.","A servant girl came in and reported: “Young Master, young lady, the Right Protector of the Island Master’s mansion suddenly arrived, and the Patriarch asked the two of you to go to the front to meet him.”","“Right Protector?” Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows in doubt.","Li Moying was also slightly taken aback, “I heard that the Island Master of Floating Sea is a peerless powerhouse in the Life Profound Realm. He rarely leaves the Island Master’s mansion. If there is any important matter, it is done through the two Protectors, the Left Protector and the Right Protector.” This time, the Right Protector came to convey his message. This Right Protector is also a powerhouse at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm, and is a well-known master in the entire God Realm. I wonder what he came here for?”","“Could it be related to what happened to us yesterday?” Huang Yueli guessed.","While discussing in low voices, the two had already stood up and walked out the door.","Although the ones who came were first-rate powerhouses from the God Realm, none of them showed any nervousness.","In the front hall, Li Shihong’s voice came from afar.","“Moying, Young Miss Li, come in quickly! His Excellency, the Right Protector, has been waiting for you for a long time.”","“Are you really here to look for us?” Huang Yueli muttered, and was pulled in by Li Moying.","As soon as they entered the room, they felt a powerful pressure of profound force!","This astonishing momentum, with an unprecedented sense of oppression, made Huang Yueli feel a strong impact, and her body shook before she stood still.","For a moment, deep thought appeared in Huang Yueli’s eyes.","Since coming to the God Realm, this is the first time she has come into direct contact with a strong person at the peak of the Dao Profound Realm. He was indeed several times stronger than a second-rate guy like Huang Sanbai!"]},{"number":4045,"title":"Chapter 4045 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (4)","paragraphs":["4045 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (4)","However, if it was just a normal contact, Huang Yueli didn’t think that the other party could form such a powerful impact on her.","It can only be said that the Right Protector intentionally released his profound strength with the intention of testing and probing, and wanted to test the depth of Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","Sure enough, the Right Protector immediately retracted his profound energy after releasing it, and at the same time, a hint of shock flashed in his eyes.","“Ha ha, I believe the two are Young Master Li and Young Miss Li. They are indeed extremely talented. I have organized more than a dozen Grand Meets in the Floating Sea all these years, and I have never seen such peerless geniuses like these two! ”","The Right Protector was shocked by the strength of the two, and his attitude became much more polite.","Previously, the Island Master specially asked him to come here to give the array patterns, but he was still a little reluctant.","After all, with the status of the Right Protector in Floating Sea, he can completely sit on an equal footing with the Patriarchs of the major forces. Even if Li Moying is a god-level genius, he was only a junior, and now he was only a cultivator of the Heart Profound Realm.","It’s more or less unreasonable for him to have such a well-known top expert come to visit him in person.","But just now, after he released his profound strength and secretly tested each other with this young couple, he realized that he was completely wrong.","He also thought that the so-called god-level geniuses were just a little bit better than heaven-level geniuses.","But now he understands that there is no comparison between a heaven-level genius and a god-level genius!","That kind of talent can only be described as against the sky!","These two juniors were only in their twenties, and both were only in the Heart Profound Realm. However, under the might of him, a strong Dao Profound Realm, they didn’t back down even a single step and beared it easily.","And right behind them, there were several elders in the Dao Profound Realm of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, all of whom were pale and couldn’t bear it.","The Right Protector had the intention of making friends, so he immediately stopped being a secret, and said directly: “I came here today at the order of the Island Master.”","Li Moying raised his eyebrows slightly, thinking of something.","“I’ve heard about the reputation of the Island Master for a long time, but I don’t know what he would like from us?”","The Right Protector chuckled, “The two of you caused quite a ruckus yesterday on Gravity Island’s Square. Even our Floating Sea test array that has been used for tens of thousands of years can’t resist Young Master Li’s random move! It’s true that each new generation excels the previous, making us old fellows ashamed!”","Hearing this, Li Shihong’s expression changed slightly, and he jumped in front of Li Moying to intervene: “Your Excellency, you really dare not take this seriously. Moying and Young Miss Li are still young, and young people are bound to be arrogant, and their actions are not prudent. Please don’t be harsh on them. We, the Cloudy Qilin Clan, can compensate for the loss caused by the Floating Sea.”","Li Shihong seemed a little nervous.","Yesterday, he heard that Li Moying had damaged Floating Sea’s array, but he didn’t take it seriously, but today the Right Protector came in person and said he was ordered by the Island Master. This was not an easy matter.","The strength of the Island Master was at least in the top ten among all the masters in the God Realm.","Although the Cloudy Qilin Clan also has a few Supreme Elders in the Life Profound Realm, they couldn’t come here after all.","Moreover, they were now on the territory of the Island Master.","If the Island Master blamed Li Moying for this, the matter would be difficult.","Hearing this, the Right Protector shook his head repeatedly, “Patriarch Li, you misunderstood. I have already understood what happened yesterday. It was our Floating Sea Steward who behaved inappropriately. How can we blame Young Master Li?”"]},{"number":4046,"title":"Chapter 4046 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (5)","paragraphs":["4046 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (5)","“Several stewards were also acting according to the rules, but there were some misunderstandings. They’re all misunderstandings!”","Hearing that, the Right Protector had voluntarily backed down, Li Shihong hurriedly said a few polite words.","Not only was he heaving a sigh of relief, but he also felt a burst of secret joy in his heart!","Judging from the Right Protector’s tone, not only did he not mean to blame Li Moying, but he also admired him quite a bit. Could it be... Li Moying’s performance yesterday didn’t offend the Island Master, but got the Island Master’s favour?","While he was still guessing, Right Protector had already taken out a book with a blue cover from his pocket.","“Young Miss Li, I heard that you made a bet with those stewards at that time, saying that as long as Young Master Li can destroy the test array, the stewards will give you the array pattern. It’s a pity that they can’t get the pattern and can only report to the Island Master. The Island Master personally issued an order, to let me send it to you. Please take a look, is this what you want?”","Hearing this, Li Shihong and the elders in the room all widened their eyes and looked at Huang Yueli in shock.","They never thought that Right Protector You came to the residence of the Cloudy Qilin Clan for this reason!","Young Miss Li actually dared to bet with the steward of Floating Sea!","Moreover, it was not accidental that Li Moying destroyed the test array, but it was all likely to help the girl he likes get the array pattern!","Even if they were god-level geniuses, it would be too arrogant to do so, right?","What’s even more outrageous is that the Island Master didn’t even think there was anything wrong with it, and even made a special trip to ask the Right Protector to send them the array pattern!","After a short period of shock, Li Shihong couldn’t help but flash a gleam of joy in his eyes!","It seems that Li Moying and Huang Yueli must have shown amazing talent and strength at that time, and even the top powerhouses like the Island Master wanted to win over them, and they did not hesitate to send out patterns to show their favour.","If this kind of thing gets out, it will definitely greatly enhance the prestige of Li Moying and the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Compared to the cautiousness of the elders, Huang Yueli herself didn’t take it seriously at all.","She reached out her hand calmly, took the blue book, opened it and took a rough look.","Then she said in surprise: “Yes, that’s it! It’s exactly the same as the pattern that flashed on the array yesterday. Your Excellency Right Protector, thank you very much, and I would like to trouble you to thank Lord Island Master for me. This is very helpful. It’s really important to me and it’ll help me so much.”","Seeing that Huang Yueli’s attitude was so natural, the Right Protector was taken aback for a second, and then he couldn’t help sighing in his heart.","Real geniuses are indeed different, and it’s no wonder that the Island Master values them so much.","After the matter was over, Li Shihong still wanted to invite the Right Protector to stay for dinner, but the Right Protector insisted on leaving.","Before leaving, he didn’t forget to take a few more glances at Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","These two peerless geniuses actually fell into the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Could it be that the future God Realm really belongs to the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","After the Right Protector left, Huang Yueli was in a hurry to go back to study the array patterns, so she quickly went back to their courtyard with Li Moying in hand.","As soon as they left, there was a burst of exclamations in the main hall.","The Elders who witnessed everything just now were all very excited.","“I didn’t expect, I really didn’t expect that even the Island Master of the Floating Sea would think so highly of our Young Master, and let the Right Protector personally send over the array pattern! This is the only copy in the entire God Realm! He’s really worthy of being our Young Master!”","“What you said is not very right? They obviously gave the array pattern to Young Miss Li?”"]},{"number":4047,"title":"Chapter 4047 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (6)","paragraphs":["4047 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (6)","“Even if it’s for Young Miss Li, isn’t the person who damaged the array the Young Master? Besides, Young Miss Li and the Young Master have such a good relationship, they will definitely be a couple in the future. What is the difference? Young Miss Li’s, isn’t it the Young Master’s as well?”","“That’s right, what you said is so true! We, the Cloudy Qilin Clan, have hit the jackpot this time!”","“When the Young Master marries her into the clan and gives birth to a few Young Masters of pure blood, won’t our Cloudy Qilin Clan be invincible?”","Li Shihong also twirled his moustache and smiled very complacently.","However, as the Patriarch, he was still much more stable than the others. Seeing that the people were talking more and more outrageously, he coughed a few times in a hurry.","“Ahem, everyone, don’t think about things so far away. The most important thing right now is God Realm’s Grand Meet. As for the marriage between Moying and Young Miss Li, we have to trust Moying. If we rush too quickly, it may backfire! ”","Hearing the joyful laughter in the main hall, at the door, a middle-aged man in a black robe had an increasingly ugly face.","“Unexpectedly, even the Island Master... If the two god-level geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan continue to grow, then the Sacred Phoenix Clan will really have no way out!”","Thinking of what the Right Protector said just now, after hesitating for a while, he finally made up his mind and walked into the main hall.","“Patriarch.”","Seeing the man in black approaching, Li Shihong was a little surprised, “Steward He, why are you here?”","This Steward He was one of the spies placed by the Sacred Phoenix Clan in the Cloudy Qilin Clan and he was the most successful one.","Because although his blood was impure and his talent was very low, he was a rare talent in business.","Such kind of talent is very scarce in the major forces, and once one is found, it can be reused by the clan.","After all, so many cultivators in the clan need to consume a lot of resources to cultivate, so it was definitely not enough to sit and eat.","Most of the clansmen with low talents, as well as ordinary people who were attached to the big forces, mainly work in the industries of the big forces.","It was very difficult to find a Steward who can manage these industries well and even further expand them.","Therefore, Li Shihong attached great importance to Steward He.","Steward He approached Li Shihong, lowered his voice and said, “Patriarch, this subordinate has something very important to report, and I hope we can take a step aside to speak.”","Li Shihong gave him a strange look, “What’s the matter? All the Elders present here are the Elders of the clan, why don’t we just talk about it.”","Steward He looked embarrassed, “Patriarch, this is really not a good thing to say! This subordinate has delayed your time. This news is really important.”","Although Li Shihong was full of doubts, seeing what he said was so serious, he still decided to listen.","He waved his hand and told the Elders to leave.","“Tell me, what exactly is it?”","Steward He looked around, looking terrified, and made sure that there was no one around, so he whispered: “Patriarch, I overheard the conversation between two cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan in the teahouse in Floating Sea, and they even designed a shocking Big conspiracy, and our Cloudy Qilin Clan has already stepped into their trap!”","“What? What conspiracy? Please explain clearly.” Hearing this, Li Shihong frowned and asked.","Steward He said word by word: “It is said that the mysterious girl Li next to the Young Master is the god-level genius who was rumoured to have been murdered by the Sacred Phoenix Clan!”"]},{"number":4048,"title":"Chapter 4048 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (7)","paragraphs":["4048 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (7)","“What... what? You... what did you say?!”","As Li Shihong stood up from his seat in shock, he accidentally knocked over the teacup on the table and it fell to the ground, shattering all over the ground with a resounding crash.","But soon, he calmed down again, sat down again, and said: “What kind of nonsense rumours are these, can you believe such nonsense? This was clearly a plan by the Sacred Phoenix Clan to sow discord! Steward He, I think you are usually a calm and collected person, can such a stable person as yourself even believe such words? It is obviously nonsense!”","“Young Miss Li is just a human race, and she doesn’t have the aura of the Ancient God Clans at all. Moreover, if she is really a god-level genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, the Sacred Phoenix Clan will immediately recognise her. How could she be allowed to come to the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","Li Shihong felt that he still had brains. How could such an obviously impossible thing happen?","“Those people from the Sacred Phoenix Clan may have let you hear these words on purpose, so you take it seriously! Don’t spread it outside, do you hear?”","Li Shihong’s first reaction was complete disbelief, which was already expected by Steward He, so he didn’t feel any panic at all.","Of course, on the surface, he still made a frightened expression, bowed his head and admitted his mistake.","However, when Li Shihong waved him to go down, he insisted on standing where he was, hesitating to speak several times.","“Patriarch, this subordinate knows that this is inappropriate, but... but... this subordinate still thinks that Young Miss Li is a bit suspicious...”","“What do you mean?” Li Shihong’s face darkened, “I have already made it very clear that Young Miss Li cannot be from the Sacred Phoenix Clan. If she is, there are so many elders with outstanding cultivation bases in the clan. Doesn’t it mean that not even one of them can see that?”","“Subordinate...subordinate doesn’t mean that...” Steward He gritted his teeth, and with an expression of resignation, he said loudly regardless: “Patriarch, this subordinate really can’t see you being deceived by a little girl again, no matter you believe it or not, what I should say, I still want to say!”","“The origin of that Young Miss Li is very suspicious. She said that she is the daughter of a Spirit Medicine Master. She lived in seclusion in the mountains with her father and Senior Brothers since she was a child, learning medical skills. Where did her cultivation come from? Even if her talent is high enough, as we all know, the higher the talent, the more resources are needed to advance, and staying in the deep mountains without the support of big forces, can she easily reach the Heart Profound Realm?”","“Also, she suddenly appeared in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. The timing is too good, right? The Young Master was unconscious, and she appeared, and even concealed her talent. Is there really no purpose?”","“When I say this, you may think that I am making wild guesses, Patriarch, but I have evidence! Once I happened to pass by the Young Master’s residence and saw Young Miss Li practicing in it. She is clearly of a fire attribute!”","Steward He looked like he was going all out, and spoke quickly, like pouring beans, and said what he wanted to say.","Li Shihong had no time to interrupt him.","Originally, Steward He was so rude, but Li Shihong couldn’t help but want someone to drag him out.","However, Li Shihong’s expression changed on the spot after he heard the last sentence he said clearly.","“What did you say? That Young Miss Li is a fire attribute cultivator? How is this possible?”","Steward He said: “How is this impossible? That’s the truth! Patriarch, please recall, has she never formally made a move in front of the Elders?”"]},{"number":4049,"title":"Chapter 4049 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (8)","paragraphs":["4049 Her Identity Is Very Suspicious (8)","Li Shihong frowned slightly, and began to recall various deeds of Huang Yueli after he arrived at the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","At first, he didn’t have any expression on his face, but as time passed, the expression on his face became more and more serious.","When no one mentioned it, he had never thought about it carefully.","However, once he was led to think about it, Li Shihong easily found some doubtful points.","For example, he has never seen Huang Yueli make a serious move.","Although Huang Yueli had had several disputes with Li Leyun and Li Zijun in front of him, the two sides were relatively restrained in their actions, and neither time has she ever shown any special skills.","Under such circumstances, it was too easy to hide one’s own strength.","And the time when they were really asked to confirm Huang Yueli’s talent, Huang Yueli was actually fighting inside the Illusion Array, and she couldn’t be seen from the outside, and her strength was only judged based on points.","So, no one can tell what kind of attribute she had.","Steward He stood aside, looking at Li Shihong’s gradually gloomy face, knowing that he had already succeeded by half, he couldn’t help but feel secretly happy.","At this moment, Li Shihong looked at him, and he quickly put away the smile on his lips, and put on a respectful and rigorous posture.","Li Shihong frowned and said, “But, there is one thing that doesn’t make sense. If Young Miss Li is really from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, she can’t hide herself from morning till night, right? Moying eats and lives with Young Miss Li. They cultivate together, if she has a problem, how can it be impossible to hide it from Moying?”","Steward He couldn’t help but said: “Patriarch, this... this subordinate dares to say that the Young Master is obviously fascinated by that Young Miss Li now. Even if Young Miss Li has any problems, he will...”","“Shut up!”","Hearing this, Li Shihong’s expression changed, and he suddenly stopped him.","“Young Master’s rights and wrongs are something that a servant like you can talk about indiscriminately?”","Steward He quickly shut his mouth, looking extremely terrified.","In fact, it is impossible for him not to know that with Li Moying’s identity and status in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it was very taboo to discuss the Young Master’s conduct.","Saying that Huang Yueli has a problem is easy to offend, but after all, she is an outsider and has not yet married into the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","However, Li Moying has already been recognized as the future Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. His reputation cannot be damaged in the slightest. All members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan cannot discuss it casually.","Steward He was aware of this, but he had to say these words.","Li Shihong reprimanded Steward He and sent him away.","From the beginning to the end, he never stated whether he believed his words.","However, Steward He was not in a hurry, because he believed that Li Shihong would definitely not allow a person with a suspicious identity to become the Young Madam of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","As long as the news Huang Sanbai gave him is true, and that Young Miss Li is really a fire attribute cultivator, then this matter will become a big deal sooner or later.","Even if she can prove that she is a human race, but the two parties have already fallen out, this marriage will definitely fall through.","Steward He guessed right.","After he left, Li Shihong stayed in the room alone, thinking for a long time, and didn’t come back to his senses until it was dark.","The first thing he did was to instruct his guard, “Go and invite Elder Tao to discuss matters.”"]},{"number":4050,"title":"Chapter 4050 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty (1)","paragraphs":["4050 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty (1)","Li Yuntao rushed over quickly.","When he saw Li Shihong, he was startled.","During the day earlier, Li Shihong was still full of joy, because Li Moying and Huang Yueli had appeared in the sights of the Island Master, and the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan was beaming with joy from top to bottom.","But only a few hours later, Li Shihong had a sad expression on his face, as if he was under some huge pressure.","“Patriarch, subordinate...”","“Yuntao, go and close the door first. I just called you here alone this time. I have a top-secret matter to discuss with you. Don’t let others hear it.”","Li Yuntao’s heart skipped a beat.","In the middle of the night, Li Shihong even called him to discuss matters alone...","Could it be that something serious happened in the clan?","“Yuntao, I came to you this time for one thing, and I want to hear your opinion.”","Li Shihong hesitated again and again, but still felt that he should find someone to discuss with him, and he should not make a rash decision.","This kind of thing must be done with extreme caution, at least until Young Miss Li’s real identity has been confirmed, she must not feel that something was wrong.","On the one hand, if she was really a cultivator of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, once she starts to scare the snake, she will not be able to figure out the plot of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","On the other hand, if Young Miss Li is innocent, and after she gets angry with her, if she turns against Li Moying, the Cloudy Qilin Clan will also suffer a heavy loss.","Li Shihong sighed, and repeated in front of Li Yuntao what Steward He had told him earlier.","Finally, he asked: “Yuntao, what do you think...is it true or not?”","Li Yuntao never expected that what Li Shihong wanted to discuss with him would be such a shocking event!","The more he listened, the more stunned he became. He was stunned for a while, and only came back to his senses under Li Shihong’s repeated questioning.","“This... this... this subordinate feels that this matter is unlikely to be true. If the Sacred Phoenix Clan can let their god-level geniuses come to our Cloudy Qilin Clan to do detailed work, it would be too hearty! What if If something happened to them, their god-level geniuses would be dead! Besides, last time we reasoned with the Sacred Phoenix Clan because of the young master’s coma, the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan were filled with righteous indignation and accused the young master of killing him first. Without their god-level genius, it doesn’t look like a lie.”","“This is the second thing I can’t figure out!” Li Shihong twitched his beard, “Moying is not going to kill people if he doesn’t agree with him. Moreover, if the Sacred Phoenix Clan really has a god-level genius, their strength should be It won’t be too far behind Moying. How can they kill him if he wants to? After Moying woke up, I asked him about it, and he only said that he had fought with the other party, and he didn’t admit that he killed the other side.”","“This...” Li Yuntao was also lost in thought.","After a while, he said: “Since the Patriarch is worried, we can find a way to test Young Miss Li first. We can’t just say that she is a spy, right?”","“That’s right, I thought so too, but...how can we test her so as not to arouse her suspicion?” Li Shihong looked worried.","Li Yuntao thought for a while and said, “Actually, this matter is not difficult to say. Since Steward He said that he had seen Young Miss Li practice and found out that she is a fire attribute cultivator, let’s confirm this first.”","As soon as Li Shihong heard it, he understood, “That’s right. The God Realm’s Grand Meet is coming soon. Young Miss Li must be cultivating now. Let’s sneak in and know it at a glance.”"]},{"number":4051,"title":"Chapter 4051 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty (2)","paragraphs":["4051 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty (2)","After the two discussed and decided, they both felt that this matter should not be delayed.","If Huang Yueli and the others were prepared, the results would be inaccurate, so they had to go that very night.","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao changed into a set of black robes and sneaked towards Li Moying’s courtyard.","However, what they could not have imagined was that when the two of them pushed the door out, a little purple silhouette by the door, under the cover of the night, quickly rushed out along the corner of the wall.","It was so fast that it ran into Li Moying’s small courtyard and went straight to the main hall.","“Master, Master! And Lil’ Big Sister! I heard a huge secret!”","In the main hall, Li Moying was holding his wife’s slender white wrist and pulling her into his arms.","Today Huang Yueli has been concentrating on cultivating and had no time to talk to him. He managed to find the time just after dinner and planned to kiss her secretly.","But who knew, just as he lifted Huang Yueli’s delicate chin, he heard an immature voice coming from outside the door.","Immediately afterwards, a purple figure flew in like lightning.","Huang Yueli immediately pushed away the man who was hugging her, and looked back at the Little Qilin, “Lilac Jadeite, you’re back! What did you just say? What did you hear?”","Li Moying was interrupted, feeling unhappy, frowned slightly and glanced at the Little Qilin.","The Little Qilin trembled, quickly moved her short legs, ran to Huang Yueli’s lap and lay down on her stomach.","Huang Yueli shook her head amusedly, “Moying, why are you so cruel to children! Alright, Lilac Jadeite, tell us quickly what you heard.”","Thinking of his reason for coming, Little Qilin quickly raised her head and said loudly, “Miss, it’s not good! I heard the Patriarch and that elder Tao talking secretly, trying to expose your identity!”","Both Huang Yueli and Li Moying were shocked, and then they looked at each other.","“What’s going on here? Why did the Patriarch suddenly doubt Little Li’er’s identity?” Li Moying suddenly became serious.","This morning, when the two of them left from Li Shihong’s place, they saw Steward He from the outer gate rushing back from the outside.","Moreover, when he looked up and saw Li Moying and the others, he seemed to be taken aback, and hastily lowered his head to avoid their sight.","Such an attitude seems a bit suspicious. Although Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t know what he wanted to do, but for the sake of caution, they still left the Little Qilin nearby, and let her secretly listen and see what was going on with this Steward He.","As a result, the Little Qilin stayed outside all day and didn’t come back until night.","Both Huang Yueli and Li Moying thought she was playing outside, so they didn’t think much about it.","But who would have thought that at night, she would suddenly come back with such shocking news.","“Just... that is, the Steward He in front was hiding in the room with the Patriarch, muttering, I can’t hear clearly, it seems that the Sacred Phoenix Clan was mentioned... After Steward He left, the Patriarch went to Elder Tao. The two are on their way to our courtyard after changing into a set of black robes, covering their faces in disguise, as if they wanted to test Lil’ Big Sister. Lil’ Big Sister, they won’t know that you are from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, right?”","The Little Qilin spoke rapidly.","Huang Yueli frowned, “What’s the origin of Steward He? How could he know my identity?”"]},{"number":4052,"title":"Chapter 4052 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty (3)","paragraphs":["4052 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty (3)","If it is said that the guards around Li Moying betrayed him and leaked her identity, it was still possible.","However, Steward He...","He was an outsider who was in charge of running the family business, it was impossible for him to enter the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s back mountain residence at ordinary times, and he had no contact with Li Moying and Huang Yueli at all. How could he possibly guess Huang Yueli’s identity?","Li Moying thought for a while, “There are very few people who can get in touch with you. The guards around us are all carefully selected, and it is impossible to do such a thing. The only explanation is that the news from Steward He came from... ...outside.”","As he spoke, he took a deep look at Huang Yueli.","Although Li Moying’s words were not complete, Huang Yueli was connected with him and completely understood what he meant.","“We have the same thoughts. I’m afraid this matter has something to do with Huang Sanbai. This time round, we made such a big commotion, he must have heard about it. Others can’t guess my identity. However, it is impossible for him not to know. He knew that we were together since Forest Shade Town.”","Li Moying nodded, “Come to think of it, Huang Sanbai must have been scared to death when he found out that you were still alive, otherwise, he wouldn’t be so eager to find someone to test you.”","“He’s really not a fool, this strategy of sowing dissension is really well played.” Huang Yueli sneered slightly, “If we didn’t happen to bump into Steward He who was acting so suspiciously, we would not have been so careful. Then when Patriarch Li comes over, they would have bumped into me cultivting. Based on their knowledge of cultivation, if they saw me cultivating at close range, they would be more or less have some doubts and it would not be easy to fool them.”","As she spoke, she raised her hand and touched the Little Qilin by her feet, “Lilac Jadeite, this time is thanks to you. You are so clever.”","The Little Qilin shook her tail happily.","It was very comfortable to be touched by Huang Yueli. At first, she wanted to rub against her palm, but at this moment, she suddenly felt a chill.","Looking up, Li Moying was looking at her coldly.","The Little Qilin was so frightened that she jumped out from under the hostess’ hands, rushed into the courtyard with a whoosh.","Woo hoo, why is the Master so jealous? She was a female Qilin!","Huang Yueli watched the Little Qilin turn into a bolt of lightning and left, feeling a little dumbfounded, “Lilac Jadeite is still young, she can’t sit still, she only stayed for a while, so she can’t wait to go out and play.”","Seeing that she misunderstood, Li Moying didn’t explain, but said: “Fortunately, we got the news in advance, so this matter is not difficult to deal with, so we can simply use their plan and let them see you cultivate and confirm that you are not a fire attribute cultivator, that’ll be fine.”","Huang Yueli smiled, “That’s right, it looks like God is on our side. However, if we want to hide the truth, I need my Senior Brother to help. I’ll go find him first, and then we’ll just...”","...","Not long after, two figures donned in black appeared near Li Moying’s courtyard.","The speed of the two of them was not fast, but there was no sound under their feet, and there was no sound at all.","When they got closer, the two of them suddenly stopped at the same time and communicated with each other with their spiritual sense.","“Be careful! Moying’s courtyard is surrounded by simple defensive arrays! Rushing in will definitely alarm them.”","“Looking at it this way, the matter is even more suspicious. If there is nothing wrong, why deploy a defensive array?”"]},{"number":4053,"title":"Chapter 4053 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty(4)","paragraphs":["4053 Young Master Enamoured By Beauty(4)","“Maybe... it’s just that she doesn’t want to be disturbed when she is cultivating?”","“I hope that’s the case! However, now that we are in the residence of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, who would disturb their cultivation? Making such an arrangement is purely superfluous!”","As both Li Shihong and Li Yuntao exchanged glances, their gaze deepened.","There was one thing that they all had doubts in their hearts, but they all tacitly kept silent.","That is, if Young Miss Li really has a problem, does Li Moying know about it?","If he knew, why didn’t he tell the Patriarch and still stay with Young Miss Li every day?","In fact, judging from the two of them being inseparable every day, the possibility of Li Moying knowing about it was ninety-nine percent.","However, both Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were unwilling to face this fact, and kept silent at the same time.","“It’s not an option to guess here, just go and have a look.”","“But those arrays...”","“It’s alright, this is just a very common defensive array. I have been in the army for many years, and I know a little bit about the array. It should be no problem to go around it.”","With Li Yuntao’s statement, Li Shihong felt a little relieved and nodded.","Li Yuntao led Li Shihong to find a meandering path among the nearby bushes.","Since it was already late at night, many birds had returned to their nests in the trees. By the way, all kinds of extremely smelly bird droppings also fell from the sky from time to time.","As soon as Li Shihong raised his head, a lump fell on his face, making him so disgusted that he almost vomited out.","Seeing that he was about to lose his temper, Li Yuntao quickly reminded him through sound transmission with his spiritual sense, “Patriarch, don’t move around or make a sound! We are already inside the array now, you must follow me closely, if you make a mistake A little bit, it will touch the array, and if the two of us are seen by then, it will be hard to explain it!”","Why doesn’t Li Shihong know this truth?","It’s just that at the moment when the stench hit, he was just impulsive.","Not long after, he calmed down, suppressed his nausea, and said, “Alright, stop talking nonsense, and move forward quickly.”","The two quickened their pace, but the array was very complicated. Even with Li Yuntao’s rich experience, it took half an hour to walk out of the bushes.","When they saw the sun again, the two of them were almost moved to tears!","Finally, they’ve managed to leave that horrid place!","“Alright, we’ve entered the small courtyard now. The courtyard is not big. Young Miss Li must be in one of the three rooms in the middle...”","“Moying’s guards are all guarding the door, let’s be careful, pass this way, don’t go through the main door.”","After the two discussed it, they hid secretly in the darkness, thinking that no one else was aware of them.","How could they have imagined that the whereabouts of the two of them had already been reported to Huang Yueli by the Little Qilin.","After listening to Little Qilin’s narration, the corners of Liu Buyan’s mouth couldn’t help twitching, “I finally understand, why, Junior Sister, you deliberately left the flaw in this array in that position!”","Huang Yueli was drinking a cup of hot tea, when she heard what he said, she smiled slightly, “Why? Don’t make wild guesses! I didn’t keep it on purpose at all, it was just a coincidence.”","“I’ll believe you only if I’m a ghost!” Seeing that she still refused to admit it, Liu Buyan was even more speechless, “Anyone who offends you is really unlucky.”"]},{"number":4054,"title":"Chapter 4054 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (1)","paragraphs":["4054 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (1)","Huang Yueli will definitely take revenge on anyone who offends her!","Moreover, she didn’t simply beat people up. She wouldn’t give up until the other party doubted life and was on the verge of collapse.","Offending her was really worse than offending some Life Profound Realm expert!","Liu Buyan turned to look at Li Moying who was sitting next to Huang Yueli, “Hey, can you still take care of your wife? The ones outside seem to be the Patriarch and Elder of your Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“So?”","Without looking back, Li Moying raised his hand to wipe away the bits of crumbs on the corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth, before he casually said, “As long as Little Li’er is happy. Anyway, it was them who came here first. If anyone wants to bully my little Li’er, hmph, they must be prepared to be bullied back by her.”","The corners of Liu Buyan’s mouth twitched again, “Alright... you guys are...simply amazing!”","This pair was simply a true portrayal of doting the opposite sex and losing all humanity!","In the past, he was abused when he had nothing to do, but now, Li Shihong and the others were the ones!","Thinking about it this way, he suddenly felt a little psychologically balanced...","At this moment, Li Moying stood up suddenly, and glanced at Liu Buyan, “Alright, don’t sit here, the Patriarch and the others will be here soon, it’s time to work.”","Liu Buyan snorted, “Obviously, it’s time for you to appear on stage, right? Why can’t I just sit down for a while?”","“Because, Senior Brother, your matter is more important!” Huang Yueli looked at him with a smile, “Whether you can fool Patriarch Li and the others today depends entirely on you, Senior Brother. You should go next door to prepare first!”","Usually, when one faces a beautiful lady who can captivate a city with a smile, one can’t take their eyes off.","However, Liu Buyan only felt his back drenched in cold sweat.","Sigh, he won’t be tricked by his Junior Sister again, right?","“Don’t be in a daze, let’s go!” Li Moying waved his hand casually, and a wave of profound energy swept towards Liu Buyan. Liu Buyan couldn’t dodge it, and directly knocked against a small hidden door behind him.","The door was knocked open by him, and immediately after, his figure disappeared behind the door.","Li Moying looked at Huang Yueli, his gaze softened as he said gently, “Then I’ll head off first.”","Huang Yueli nodded again and again, “Yeah, my husband has worked hard!”","Liu Buyan behind the small door: “...”","You only know that your husband is working hard, why don’t you know that your Senior Brother is working harder!","Li Moying suppressed the urge to grab his little fox and give her a kiss, turned around abruptly, and walked outside the door.","As soon as Li Moying’s figure appeared, Li Tianyi immediately understood, and shouted: “Who is there!”","His loud cry was like a signal.","The guards who had been hiding in every corner of the small courtyard jumped out one after another, looking left and right.","“What’s going on? What’s going on? Is there anyone here?”","“Brother Tianyi, did you make a mistake? Who would dare to come to the Cloudy Qilin Clan to sneak around in the middle of the night?”","“Isn’t it? Which little thief is so courageous, he really doesn’t want to live! Think we Cloudy Qilin Clan people are easy to bully?”","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao thought that their whereabouts were very secretive, but they never expected that they would be spotted while still some distance away from the main hall.","Moreover, these young guards had regarded them as petty thieves.","The majestic Patriarch and Elder of the Ancient God Clan were actually called thieves by their own clansmen... it was extremely humiliating!"]},{"number":4055,"title":"Chapter 4055 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (2)","paragraphs":["4055 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (2)","The faces of both of them were very ugly.","However, those guards seemed to be endless. They obviously didn’t see anything, so they began to scold the thief.","“If I find these thieves, I will definitely chop them up!”","“Even trying to steal our Young Master’s things, hmph, these thieves must be absolutely tired of living!”","Listening to these people getting more and more outrageous, Li Shihong and Li Yuntao almost couldn’t help but wanted to jump out several times.","Fortunately, they were still a little rational at least. At critical moments, they remembered their purpose of coming here, and kept their original posture, remaining motionless.","Both of them were veterans with rich experience. They know that at this time, the best way for them was to continue to hide. Unless these cultivators directly catch them, otherwise, they should not show up.","Even with Li Tianyi’s words just now, he may not be able to accurately pinpoint their positions.","It’s very possible that the other party just sensed that the array was touched by someone, and deliberately said that in order to trick them out.","In fact, Li Tianyi was very clear about where Li Shihong and the others would come from after receiving Huang Yueli’s instructions early in the morning.","Seeing that there was no movement around, he waited for a while.","In the end, he had to admit that she was right.","It was impossible for Li Shihong and the others to show up on their own initiative.","Li Tianyi coughed a few times, and then the guards, who were full of drama, stopped performing.","“Alright, you’re all talking so much nonsense, each one of you said it so nicely, you’re going to chop the thieves up into eight pieces, why don’t you move? Why don’t you hurry up and search carefully! Now is the critical moment before the God Realm’s Grand Meet, someone may harm the Young Master secretly. If someone really comes in, it is likely that they are members of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and we must arrest them all!”","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were extremely embarrassed to hear this.","None of them had ever dreamed that there would be a day when they would be regarded as secret agents of the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","If they were caught by Li Tianyi and the others, where will their old faces be put!","The two really couldn’t figure it out. With their cultivation base, even if they couldn’t find out what attribute Huang Yueli was, they shouldn’t be discovered without seeing anything, right?","What was going on now?","Did the guards really discover them, or was it a feint?","Before they could figure it out, Li Tianyi had brought a few guards and started searching around.","When they searched, they were quite cautious and not fast.","Seeing this, Li Shihong and Li Yuntao secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","According to the current situation, they will definitely not be exposed.","After all, with the skills of the two of them, they can completely move when the guards are approaching. In this way, even if the guards search every corner, it is impossible to find two living people who are always moving!","The facts were just as they expected.","As soon as the guards approached, they moved not far away under the cover of surrounding trees and buildings.","Time and time again, although they were only a little bit close to revealing their secrets, in the end, they managed to escape.","“Hey, I’ve been looking for it for so long. If there is anyone, I’m sure we should have found them by now, right?”","“Well, Brother Tianyi must have misheard. Forget it, let’s go back and rest after we finish looking over here.”","Several guards were discussing.","When Li Shihong and the others heard this, they couldn’t help being happy.","These guards finally gave up. Next, their plan can be implemented smoothly.","However, before they had time to smile, suddenly, one of their feet stepped on the air, and they suddenly fell backwards."]},{"number":4056,"title":"Chapter 4056 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (3)","paragraphs":["4056 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (3)","“Damn it!”","“Damn, careless!”","The two of them realized that something was wrong, but it was too late to react at this time.","They had been skillfully forced to the front of a trap by the guards, and even fell directly to the centre.","In fact, this trap was not set up delicately. With the strength and experience of the two of them, even under the veil of the dark night, they shouldn’t have fallen into it.","However, their attention was attracted by the whereabouts of the guards, and they listened to what they said without realizing that there was a trap waiting for them not far away.","Under this trap, there was a swamp-like black mud. After the two of them fell, the black mud trapped them in it.","Li Shihong immediately knew that something big was going to happen.","Ordinary traps, even if they are covered with sharp spikes, are not much of a threat to Dao Profound Realm experts like them.","They can still jump out of the trap in time and sneak away in the dark, and those guards in the Heart Profound Realm may not be able to see their appearance.","But this special black mud trap was particularly insidious.","Once it falls, struggling desperately will only sink deeper and deeper in it, and in the end, it may really be buried alive.","The only way is to stand still and wait until a balance is formed between one’s body and the black mud.","After the black mud no longer flows, one can move slowly a little bit before escaping from the trap.","But now, how can there be time for them to crawl out slowly?","When the guards heard that something had fallen into the trap, they immediately became agitated, and all surrounded them in this direction.","Moreover, everyone held brooms and feather dusters in their hands, as well as rotten tomatoes and rotten eggs, etc., and threw them into the trap with their heads covered.","Throwing, hitting, and yelling at the same time.","“Kill you little thieves!”","“The bastards of the Sacred Phoenix Clan dare to infiltrate the Cloudy Qilin Clan secretly, and even want to harm our Young Master and Young Madam! Kill you!”","“Tell you, the Cloudy Qilin Clan is not a place where you can run wild!”","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were caught off guard, and they were hit on the head and face. Immediately afterwards, they were hit on the head by a broom.","Although, with just such broken brooms, there is no way to injure them at all, but this was really hurting self-esteem!","The Patriarch and Elders of the dignified Cloudy Qilin Clan were trapped in a gutter like rats crossing the street, unable to move casually, and were shouted to be beaten and killed by a group of young cultivators!","Originally, the two were still worried, afraid that their identities would be exposed, and felt that they should bear it.","But now that something like this has happened, if they don’t reveal their identities, they don’t know what these people will do to them!","Finally, Li Shihong couldn’t bear it anymore, and yelled loudly, “Hey, guards outside, stop! Do you know who I am? How dare you treat me like this?”","“Stop? Why stop? If you dare to peep and plot against our Young Master, we dare to beat you!”","“That’s right, you are the ones hitting.”","The broom and feather duster fell down again.","Li Yuntao couldn’t care about anything else, and hurriedly shouted: “Stop, stop! We are not the Sacred Phoenix Clan! I am Li Yuntao! The Elder of my clan! I am here to visit the Young Master!”","Hearing this, the movement outside stopped.","The two of them had just breathed a sigh of relief when someone said, “This rascal is too courageous, he dared to pretend to be Elder Tao!”"]},{"number":4057,"title":"Chapter 4057 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (4)","paragraphs":["4057 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (4)","“That’s right, do they think we’re stupid? The dignified Elder will sneak out of the small courtyard to peep in the middle of the night?”","“That’s right, if it’s really an Elder, when we were looking for someone just now, why didn’t they stand up and just explain clearly, why are they still dodging around? It’s clear that they have evil intentions, and they must be spies from the Sacred Phoenix Clan!”","Hearing the analysis of several guards, Li Shihong and Li Yuntao almost spit out a mouthful of old blood!","It was indeed a major mistake for them not to reveal their identities just now, because they never thought that they would be tricked by these guards!","They thought that the worst outcome would be that their whereabouts would be exposed, and they used their profound skills to run away quickly, at least not revealing their identities.","But who knows, things have become like this now!","“Alright, what are you talking nonsense with them? These two guys dare to pretend to be the Elders of our Cloudy Qilin Clan. They are so bold. You must show them some color! Keep fighting!”","The feather duster and broom fell down again.","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao dodged left and right, and at this moment they also understood that it was impossible for them to hide their identities.","The two gritted their teeth, and were about to use their profound strength to shake these young cultivators away.","At this moment, Li Moying’s voice came from not far away, “What’s going on? Why is it so noisy outside? At the critical moment when Little Li’er is practicing, who gave you the courage to make noise outside? What if you disturb her?”","Upon hearing this, the guards immediately fell silent.","The feather duster and broom were also put away.","Li Tian Er came out from the crowd, bowed and reported to Li Moying: “Young Master, there are two sneaky people here who have been peeping in the dark. I guess they must be sent by the Sacred Phoenix Clan to make trouble before the God Realm’s Grand Meet has started!”","Li Moying raised his eyebrows, “Oh? Really?”","Li Tian Er nodded.","The other guards also scolded the “two spies” one after another.","Li Yuntao couldn’t take it anymore, gritted his teeth, and shouted loudly, “Moying, Moying! Don’t listen to their nonsense, it’s me, the Patriarch, not a spy!”","Li Moying has come, and their identities cannot be kept secret.","Now that the matter has come to this, it’s better to confess directly, so as not to make a bigger joke later.","Hearing this, before Li Moying could speak, the guards were already shouting.","“Young Master, you must never listen to their nonsense! These two people acted strangely, how could they be the Patriarch and the Elder? They are obviously deceitful!”","“This voice sounds quite like Elder Tao, but it’s definitely fake!”","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao finally realized what it meant to be indisputable.","Li Shihong also let go of his face as the Patriarch, and shouted: “Moying, it’s really me, you don’t even know me, do you? This is really a misunderstanding, misunderstanding! Let us come out first and I’ll explain to you.”","Li Moying knew it was Li Shihong, and he couldn’t help laughing secretly when he heard him say that.","This Patriarch was pitiful enough, why was he so free and had to pick to fight against his wife.","Even he himself can’t afford to offend his Little Li’er!","Thinking that he was the Patriarch after all, Li Moying decided to finally give him a break.","“All of you, stop. I think he really sounds like the Patriarch, let me have a look first.”"]},{"number":4058,"title":"Chapter 4058 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (5)","paragraphs":["4058 Leading Oneself Into the Pit (5)","The guards were all loyal to Li Moying. After hearing his order, although many of them felt uneasy, they all stopped according to his words.","Li Moying walked to the outside of the trap.","Before he could speak, Li Yuntao called out, “Young Master, Young Master, can you see clearly? It’s really us!”","It was a dark and windy night, and it was almost impossible for ordinary cultivators to see clearly what was going on in such a deep trap.","However, this was not difficult for Li Moying.","He poked his head out, and Li Shihong and Li Yuntao’s bewildered appearances in the trap immediately came into view.","Seeing the appearance of the two of them, he couldn’t help sighing in his heart: “It’s too miserable!”","The majestic Patriarch and Elder of the Ancient God Clan had their faces covered with broken eggs and rotten tomato juice, and their entire face appearance was almost unrecognizable.","Not only that, but there was also a stench emanating from them, which made people shy away.","“Ahem... It’s really you! Patriarch, Elder Tao, you... How did you end up here? How did you become like this?”","When Li Moying said this, the surrounding guards were shocked.","“What? Young Master, what did you say?”","“It’s really the Patriarch and Elder Tao? How is this possible?”","“Why did the two of them hide in the bushes like thieves?”","Most of the guards really didn’t know the identities of these two people.","Li Moying and Huang Yueli were also worried that these ordinary guards from the Cloudy Qilin Clan might not dare to take action against the Patriarch and Elder, so the action plan was only informed to Li Tianyi and Li Tian Er, and the other guards were only driven into action under their guise.","After hearing Li Moying’s words, their surprise was not feigned.","Moreover, no one could figure out why there was such an outrageous thing!","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were also extremely embarrassed.","They have already deeply regretted it, and should not have acted so hastily.","However, since they have already admitted their identities, they simply broke the can.","With thick skins, the two pretended not to hear the questioning voices of the guards and crawled out of the trap bit by bit.","Li Moying also commanded several guards to help them.","The two climbed up with great difficulty. Seeing each other’s distressed appearance, they all wished they could find a hole in the ground and hide!","Ever since they became the top existences in the clan, they have never been in such a mess!","Moreover, this face was thrown in front of the juniors.","Li Moying coughed twice, “Patriarch, Elder Tao, I have already heard what Li Tianyi and the others said about what happened just now. It’s all my fault that I didn’t discipline them properly. They can’t even recognize their own Patriarch and Elder and offend you two! I will definitely punish them severely!”","Li Tianyi pretended to be aggrieved and argued: “Young Master, this... really can’t blame all the brothers? It was already so late at that time, and the Patriarch and Elder Tao have always refused to reveal their identities...”","“Shut up! What do you know? Do all of you have brains?” Li Moying scolded him, “Will the Patriarch hide like a thief? Will he sneak around and peek around? If that’s the case, then it’s the entire laughing stock of the Ancient God Clans! This is absolutely impossible! It’s clear that you guys caused me trouble, how dare you blame the Patriarch?”"]},{"number":4059,"title":"Chapter 4059 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (1)","paragraphs":["4059 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (1)","Although Li Moying’s words were reprimanding his subordinates, Li Shihong and Li Yuntao felt ashamed when they heard it, and even their ears turned red.","At this moment, they were all a little thankful that there were so many egg washes and tomato juices hanging on their faces.","At least, their embarrassing expressions could not be seen for the time being.","Li Tianyi looked unconvinced, and seemed to want to continue to defend.","Seeing this, Li Yuntao was afraid that if Li Tianyi spoke again, their miserable situation would be exposed again, so he hurriedly spoke first and interrupted him.","“Alright, alright, Moying, these guards are also loyal to you, otherwise they wouldn’t be so loyal to their duties, and they would rush up when they saw a suspicious person. If our Cloudy Qilin Clan’s guards have them so dedicated, that’s a good thing.”","Li Shihong understood Li Yuntao’s intentions, and said, “That’s right, Yuntao and I suddenly thought of some information about geniuses from other forces, and we were anxious to tell you, so we took a shortcut and came here. Unexpectedly, the sky was dark, and these guards didn’t see clearly, it turned out to be such a misunderstanding! Alas, I can only say that the weather is bad!”","The two talked to each other without mentioning the details just now, let alone blaming the guards.","Although their teeth were itching with anger, the two of them had clear minds and knew that these guards had done nothing wrong at all. The two of them were responsible for today’s matter.","However, Li Moying didn’t seem to see how they were besieged just now, so there should be no doubt about their purpose of coming here.","If the guards talk too much, it will easily make Li Moying suspicious.","It’s better to expose this matter quickly, lest Li Moying think too much.","Li Moying knew their intentions very well, and secretly laughed in his heart, but there was a sincere expression on his face.","“Thank you, Patriarch and Elder Tao for your understanding. My guards are indeed loyal, but they are all brainless! Seeing you two pleading on their behalf, I will let them go today. Hurry up and leave!”","Knowing that his mission had been completed, Li Tianyi quickly evacuated with the group of guards.","Li Moying walked in front of Li Shihong and Li Yuntao, cupped his hands, “I’m really sorry, I surprised you two. Look at the two of you...cough cough, why don’t you sit in my courtyard for a while so that you can clean up? ”","Naturally, Li Shihong and Li Yuntao couldn’t wish for more.","They sneaked here today because they just wanted to enter Li Moying’s small courtyard to find out the truth.","Normally, no one else is allowed to enter Li Moying’s courtyard. Even Li Shihong has to be notified before he can approach.","Now, it is really rare to have such an opportunity to make a surprise inspection of his courtyard.","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao had completely given up on today’s action because they fell into a trap, and they both planned to go back.","Unexpectedly, Li Moying took the initiative to invite them in...","“Alright, alright, of course!”","“We just happen to have some information about God Realm’s Grand Meet, and we want to tell you and Young Miss Li.”","Li Moying nodded, led the two into a guest room, and sat down.","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao first greeted Li Moying, and then talked about a lot of gossip about other forces.","It wasn’t until Li Moying gradually became impatient that Li Yuntao tentatively asked, “Moying, why don’t we see Young Miss Li?”"]},{"number":4060,"title":"Chapter 4060 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (2)","paragraphs":["4060 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (2)","Li Moying knew that they would ask, so he took a sip of tea calmly, and then slowly said: “She is cultivating in the room at the back. She just advanced a few days ago, and now she needs to stabilize her cultivation. So I don’t dare disturb her.”","Li Shihong showed a look of astonishment, “What? Young Miss Li has advanced again? When did it happen?”","Li Moying said: “It was on our way to Floating Sea, and because of this, we arrived a day later than expected.”","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao looked at each other, both of them were extremely shocked!","Huang Yueli’s strength has advanced so quickly!","It’s really worthy of being a god-level genius, so heaven-defying.","After the two of them calmed down for a while, they thought of another question at the same time.","If this Young Miss Li is really a genius of the human clan with no influence behind her, then her perverted talent will only be good for the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and there will be no harm. It was really worthy of celebration.","But what if she is really from the Sacred Phoenix Clan?","Then the Cloudy Qilin Clan will be in big trouble!","Moreover, what purpose did the Sacred Phoenix Clan put such a peerless genius beside Li Moying? If you think about it with your toes, there must be a terrifying conspiracy!","Thinking of this, the two became tense again.","They had already rested their minds for a while, but now, they were more eager to find out the specific identity of Huang Yueli.","Li Shihong coughed twice, and asked again: “Young Miss Li’s strength has improved so fast, it’s really admirable, we haven’t congratulated her yet! It’s strange, Moying, didn’t you say that Young Miss Li is cultivating nearby? Why don’t we feel any profound energy fluctuations?”","He wanted to ask this question just now.","Generally speaking, when a one cultivates, he will cause violent fluctuations in the profound energy of the world. The higher the talent, the greater the fluctuations.","A god-level genius like Li Moying can sense fluctuations even from a long distance away.","But now, they have all released their divine senses. After searching for a long time, they still haven’t been able to sense Huang Yueli’s profound energy fluctuations. This was really abnormal.","Li Moying explained lightly: “When Little Li’er was practicing, the fluctuations caused were too great, and the profound energy of heaven and earth in the air was too thin, which was not conducive to cultivation, so she arranged a special spirit-gathering array , not only can absorb the surrounding profound energy, but also shield most of the profound energy fluctuations.”","“What?!”","Both Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were taken aback and almost jumped up!","For a moment, they all felt that Huang Yueli was extremely suspicious!","An array that can shield profound energy fluctuations!","If she practiced like this, it is very likely that she just didn’t want to expose her true nature.","Li Moying glanced at them, “Patriarch, Elder Tao, why are you so excited?”","“Ah? Uh... no, we’re not excited, we’re just... surprised! Such an array must be difficult to set up, right? I didn’t expect Young Miss Li to know how to arrange arrays.”","Li Shihong swallowed the question that came to his lips.","Now, they haven’t got the evidence yet, and they haven’t seen Young Miss Li practice with their own eyes, so there is no basis for what they say.","Still can’t show doubts in front of Li Moying.","Li Moying raised the corners of his lips, showing a gentle expression on his usually cold face, “She really knows a lot, she is completely different from other girls.”"]},{"number":4061,"title":"Chapter 4061 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (3)","paragraphs":["4061 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (3)","Just then, there was a knock on the door.","“What’s the matter?” Li Moying looked outside the door.","Li Tianyi cupped his hands, and said: “Young Master, Divine Doctor Liu said that he has refined a batch of new pills and has invited you over.”","Li Moying nodded, “I see.” He turned to Li Shihong again, “Patriarch, I’ll go to see Divine Doctor Liu, are you interested in going together with Elder Tao? Divine Doctor Liu has recently improved several kinds of medicinal pills and it has been quite fruitful, maybe they can be used in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.”","Li Shihong hesitated for a moment.","If it was ordinary times, when he heard that there was a more effective medicinal pill, he would definitely be eager to see it.","Even if he can’t use it himself, it would be good to buy some for the members of the clan who participated in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","However, today’s situation was different.","He hesitated for a moment, but still shook his head, “Forget it, Elder Tao and I still have some things to do, and we plan to go back early, so we won’t go there with you.”","Li Moying said: “Then I will send you two out first...”","Li Yuntao hastily stopped him, “No, no! You have business to do, why waste this time? It’s not that the two of us don’t know the way, we’ll go back by ourselves.”","Li Yuntao immediately understood Li Shihong’s intentions, knowing that he was planning to secretly investigate Young Miss Li’s situation.","The two refused together, so Li Moying naturally had no reason to insist.","He nodded, “Alright, then I’ll take a step first, Patriarch, Elder Tao, please go your own way.”","Li Moying turned around and left.","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao waited in the room for a while, then walked to the corridor at the door, released their consciousness, and searched back and forth.","“The Young Master should have gone to the backyard and won’t be back in a short time!”","“Great, I thought there was no chance this time. Unexpectedly, Moying left suddenly. This is a god-sent opportunity!”","“That’s right. Let’s take this opportunity to clarify the matter so that we don’t have too many dreams.”","The two reached a consensus and immediately started to act, walking along the corridor to the back wing.","Earlier, Li Moying had already mentioned that Huang Yueli was practicing in the back room.","The two walked forward cautiously. Fortunately, they didn’t meet any guards on the way.","Not long after, they arrived at the door of the wing room.","“It seems that Young Miss Li is right in this room. Look, Mr. Patriarch, the complicated patterns at the door should be used to hide the breath.” Li Yuntao pointed to the door and said.","“It’s no wonder that you still have such profound attainments in array techniques, so how can we see what’s going on inside?” Li Shihong frowned, “By the way, we must be careful, we must not let Young Miss Li find us.”","They had just been in an extremely embarrassing situation and they were almost made a big joke.","Fortunately, Li Moying appeared in time, and the two of them were resourceful enough to find a reason to cover up the matter.","Now, it was even more necessary to be extra cautious.","If they were exposed again, it was really hard to explain!","Li Yuntao stared at the array pattern at the door for a long time, and said in embarrassment: “This... Although this subordinate has learned a little bit of array technique, it is still incomparable to a real Array Master. These array patterns are too complicated. If it is forcibly destroyed, it is still possible, but it is difficult to go around without anyone noticing.”"]},{"number":4062,"title":"Chapter 4062 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (4)","paragraphs":["4062 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (4)","Li Shihong also became anxious, “What can we do? Think of a way! We finally got here, so we can’t just go back like this?”","Li Yuntao was also very clear that they had lost such a big opportunity to be able to sneak in.","It will be difficult to have similar opportunities in the future!","Now, they were only one step away from the truth. If they were to return empty handed like this, they would really be unreconciled!","Li Yuntao faced the eagerly looking eyes of the Patriarch, so he could only bite the bullet and say: “This subordinate... this subordinate should think of a way, please wait.”","...","At this moment, the interior of the wing room.","Huang Yueli was sitting on a chaise lounge, holding a teacup in one hand and eating melon seeds on the table with the other.","Sitting next to her, Li Moying saw that a melon seed husk was stuck on her face, he raised his hand to gently pick it up for her.","Huang Yueli immediately rewarded him with a sweet smile, “Thank you husband! You are so kind to me! These are the melon seeds I just peeled, you should eat some too!”","She handed a crystal bowl full of melon seeds to Li Moying, and watched him grab a handful.","Liu Buyan sat across from them, gagging from time to time.","“Haven’t the two of you had enough? Don’t you feel disgusted?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, “I don’t think so! Senior Brother, we call it being in love, not sleazy, and you’ll know when you get married in the future.”","Liu Buyan laughed dryly: “Looking at you like this, I feel that getting married is not a good thing at all...”","All of them have only the opposite sex in their minds and have no humanity at all! They were completely different from before they got married.","It’s terrible, it’s terrible!","“Alright, you two don’t show affection. Didn’t you hear the voice outside? Patriarch Li and Elder Tao are already outside. Why haven’t you come in for so long?”","Liu Buyan was so depressed.","He also hoped that Li Shihong and Li Yuntao could break in quickly, so that he wouldn’t need to continue to be mentally abused by these two inhumane ones.","But after waiting, half an hour has passed, and the two of them were still whispering at the door.","Huang Yueli also found it a little strange, “That’s right, why are they moving so slowly!”","The plan they set up was to let Li Moying leave at the right time, and then guide Li Shihong and Li Yuntao out of this room, let them break the array by themselves, and see Huang Yueli show some wood attribute practice with their own eyes.","Whether it was letting them fall into the trap or letting them find a way to break the array, it was all part of the plan.","It was so complicated, not just because she wanted to torment the two old people.","It’s because Huang Yueli knows very well that only the truth that she overcomes all kinds of difficulties and dangers can look more real.","If Li Shihong and Li Yuntao had been respectfully invited in by Li Moying, and Huang Yueli had shown them her skills openly, the two of them would have no way of believing her, and they would definitely feel that something was wrong.","It’s only after going through a lot of tossing like this that they will be convinced.","Huang Yueli had a good plan, but, for some reason, they waited in the room for so long, but Li Shihong and the others didn’t come in.","Li Moying used his divine sense to probe and checked the situation outside the room before he raised his eyebrows.","“Little Li’er, what kind of array did you arrange outside? Elder Tao tried for a long time, but he couldn’t break it.”","“Eh?” Huang Yueli couldn’t help being taken aback when she heard this."]},{"number":4063,"title":"Chapter 4063 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (5)","paragraphs":["4063 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (5)","She was a little surprised and said: “No way? I have obviously simplified the array already? Now these arrays are the most basic, all right? It should be easy to crack, right? Didn’t you tell me last time that Elder Tao also learned array techniques in the Allied Armies? Why can’t he even handle such a simple one?”","Before Li Moying could speak, Liu Buyan had already spoken.","“Cough, Junior Sister... Do you have any misunderstandings about the word “simple”? Can you stop judging others by your own standards?”","Hearing what Huang Yueli said just now, Liu Buyan’s first reaction was to vomit blood!","He was the one who has been affected by Huang Yueli’s understanding of “simple” the most!","Every time, Huang Yueli told him that this was very simple, and that had been simplified, but in the end, for him, it was still as difficult as ever!","He could figure out the current situation with his toes. It must be that Li Yuntao was completely stumped by her “simple” array!","“I think you should hurry up and think of a way. If Li Yuntao can’t solve the array, maybe the two of them will have to go back instead.” Liu Buyan reminded.","At this moment, he still envied Li Yuntao very much.","Although Li Yuntao couldn’t solve the problem Huang Yueli left behind, at least he didn’t have to listen to Huang Yueli’s ‘simple’ theory, and he didn’t have to be despised by her over and over again.","This was really a blessing in misfortune.","Otherwise, Li Yuntao might have left a psychological shadow after tonight.","Huang Yueli pondered for a while, “Well... it seems that what you said, Senior Brother, makes sense. It’s been half an hour, and they haven’t cracked the array and they are worried that Moying will go back at any time and find their whereabouts. The immense pressure under such a situation, they are likely to give up!”","In fact, not only Li Shihong and the others didn’t want to give up today’s opportunity easily, Huang Yueli didn’t want to give up either.","After all, no one wants to have a master of the Dao Profound Realm by his side, who will always doubt her identity, come here to make troubles from time to time, and try a few times.","The best way was to seize this opportunity and dispel their suspicion once and for all.","“Oh, a smart person like me sometimes makes mistakes! I actually overestimated Li Yuntao’s level of array! This is a bit troublesome. After the array pattern is drawn, I can only change it outside the array, but surely I can’t go out now?”","Huang Yueli fell into deep thought.","Her mistake didn’t seem like a big deal, but it was a very fatal flaw in their grandplan.","If it can’t be resolved, all previous efforts will be wasted.","However, she couldn’t think of a good solution for a while.","“It’s not impossible to find a solution.” Li Moying suddenly spoke in a low voice.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, and she turned to look at him, “Husband, what can you do?”","Li Moying said: “Since they can’t destroy the array from the outside, then we might as well take the initiative to break the array from the inside. However, in this way, the Patriarch and the others may suffer again...”","“What do you mean?” Liu Buyan was stunned for a moment before he understood.","The corner of his mouth twitched, “I said a long time ago that you lose your humanity when you have a wife. It’s true after all!”","Li Moying’s expression did not change at all, it was as if he didn’t hear his ridicule at all. He simply stood up and nudged Liu Buyan.","“Alright, don’t be lazy, it’s time to work!”","“Hey, Li Moying, I’m your sworn brother, don’t push me!”"]},{"number":4064,"title":"Chapter 4064 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (6)","paragraphs":["4064 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (6)","Outside the door, Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were still stumped by the array.","Li Yuntao racked his brains and used all the array knowledge he had learned over the years, but he still couldn’t find a single flaw in the array.","Li Shihong didn’t dare to rush him at first, but as time went by, his patience became worse and worse.","“Elder Tao, how is the situation? Is there any way?”","Li Yuntao was already sweating profusely, and his level of array skills was indeed not high, but Li Shihong now has such high expectations of him, and what they had to do was so important, if he says he couldn’t do it, he did nt how how disappointed Li Shihong would be and in turn he was worried that it will also affect his own status in the mind of the Patriarch.","In desperation, he could only grit his teeth and say, “I’ll try again, there is one last way!”","If it doesn’t work, we can only use destructive methods to directly destroy the array from the outside.","If the damage is not serious, they still have time to take a look at the situation inside the array before slipping away immediately...","Li Moying and Huang Yueli may not be able to catch up with them.","While Li Yuntao was thinking, suddenly, there was a loud “rumbling” noise from the array.","Immediately afterwards, the entire ground began to tremble.","The expressions of the two changed at the same time.","“Not good! It must have destroyed the pattern that shouldn’t be touched just now. This time, the entire array will collapse!”","It’s a pity that although they knew it in their hearts, they had no time to react in action.","A powerful and unparalleled profound force suddenly gushed out from the array!","The two of them clinging to the outside of the array, there was no room to dodge at all, and they were directly blown into the air!","Both of them are strong in the Dao Profound Realm. Logically speaking, they shouldn’t be thrown away so easily.","However, they were unprepared before, caught off guard, and flew several hundred metres before falling from midair.","There was a resounding “bang”.","The two fell on the roof of a house, and even smashed through the roof.","“Oops! Where did we fall?”","“It’s over, it’s really over now...”","The moment they landed, Li Shihong and Li Yuntao finally remembered that they were not in the Amethyst Paramount Palace in Cloudy Qilin Clan Continent, but in the residence of Floating Sea!","Amethyst Paramount Palace occupies a huge area with few people. They were thrown hundreds of metres away without attracting anyone’s attention.","However, the residence of Floating Sea was immensely huge. They flew a few hundred metres and flew directly to another courtyard. Every room in this courtyard was filled with members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Suddenly two people fell from midair and smashed through the roof.","Such a huge movement immediately attracted everyone’s attention.","The cultivators who had already fallen asleep were all awakened. They all picked up their weapons and rushed out immediately.","“It’s not good, someone came in, is it a spy?”","“It may also be a high-level spirit beast rushing in from outside!”","“Everyone, be careful, this place is too dangerous! Everyone, quickly surround this room!”","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao fell to the ground. Before they could recover, they were surrounded by people, and all kinds of profound skills were thrown towards the room they were in without any words.","“Damn it! Stop it! You dare to be so disrespectful to the Patriarch, don’t you want to live?”","Li Yuntao’s face was livid, and he immediately scolded them sharply.","Li Shihong’s expression became even uglier, but he didn’t stop Li Yuntao from speaking out.","The two of them were humiliated and thrown home anyway, and they no longer cared about what others would say about them afterwards.","The most important thing was to get out of the current predicament first."]},{"number":4065,"title":"Chapter 4065 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (7)","paragraphs":["4065 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (7)","Sure enough, the fighters besieging them outside stopped their movements after hearing Li Yuntao’s shout.","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao learned their lesson from Li Moying’s small courtyard, seized this opportunity, and jumped out of the house suddenly.","Seeing the two suddenly appear, the cultivators were all on guard.","“Wh...who?!”","“Damn, it’s really... really the Patriarch and Elder Tao!”","“No way? How could the Patriarch and Elder Tao fall from the sky? Are you dreaming?”","“If you don’t believe it, just have a look for yourself!”","Fortunately, there were people with sharp eyes. Despite the darkness, they managed to recognize the two in front of them.","These young cultivators still respect the Patriarch and Elders, although no matter how hard they think about it, they can’t figure out what kind of tricks they are playing when they descend from the sky, even their beards were blown off.","However, facing the two Elders of the clan, they still bowed down very respectfully.","Seeing the performance of these people, Li Shihong and the others let out a long breath.","Li Yuntao coughed hard twice, “Ahem, I have some things to do with the Patriarch, you should leave, it’s so late, you should all go back, it’s time to rest or spend the little time left to cultivate.”","The cultivators present had countless questions in their hearts.","However, they did not dare to disobey Li Yuntao’s order. After hesitating for a while, they retreated and prepared to leave.","Li Yuntao and Li Shihong hadn’t had time to relax when they heard a burst of chaotic footsteps not far away, as if someone was hurrying towards them.","A bad premonition arised in their hearts.","It was at this moment when the sweet voice sounded.","“It turned out to be Patriarch and Elder Tao! I thought I was wrong just now! What do you two mean today? Do you have any opinion on me?”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s voice, both Li Shihong and Li Yuntao showed panicked expressions on their faces.","However, there was nowhere to hide even if they wanted to hide now.","The girl clad in an ethereal lilac dress had already walked towards this side, followed closely by Li Moying behind who had on a solemn expression.","Seeing this, the cultivators present took the initiative to give way to them.","At this moment, one person stopped and those who were going to leave also stayed behind.","What happened today? Not only the Patriarch and Elder who had descended from the sky, but even the Young Master and the future Young Madam appeared. It seemed that they even had a dispute with the Patriarch and Elder!","Seeing that there was definitely a hot gossip topic, no one was willing to leave like this.","Li Shihong coughed a few times, and went forward bravely, “Ahem, Young Miss Li, what happened today was actually a misunderstanding, a misunderstanding...don’t get angry, let me explain to you slowly.”","Huang Yueli was full of anger, walked up to the two of them and stopped, and said angrily: “Alright, Patriarch Li, then explain in front of everyone what happened. When I was cultivating in the Qi Gathering Array, you wanted to hide outside and peek? It’s fine to peek, but to actually destroy my array!”","“Wow... Peeking??”","“What Young Miss Li means is that the Patriarch and Elder Tao were hiding to watch her?”","“Or else? Is there any other explanation for the word peek?”","The cultivators talked a lot, and the two old men couldn’t hold back their expressions, and their faces were full of embarrassment.","“Young Miss Li, you misunderstood, we... were really not peeking.”"]},{"number":4066,"title":"Chapter 4066 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (8)","paragraphs":["4066 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (8)","They never dreamed that one day they would fall into such an embarrassing situation.","Both Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were decent people, and they have been very respected in the clan all their lives.","Who knew they would be accused of peeping by a little girl in front of all their clansmen!","Moreover, what the other party said was still true...","This time, they really couldn’t prove their innocence!","Li Yuntao said: “Young Miss Li, I can’t explain this matter in a few words, why don’t we find a place to sit down first, and I will explain to you slowly?”","“That’s unnecessary! If you really have a valid reason, you don’t have to be afraid of being heard by others. Which of the cultivators present here is not a talented cultivator carefully cultivated by your Cloudy Qilin Clan, the best of the younger generation, even if there is something confidential, I’m not afraid of them telling it.”","Huang Yueli crossed her arms and narrowed her eyes as she looked at them with an expression of “I’ll see how you explain it”.","Li Yuntao hastily winked at Li Moying, hoping that he could say something nice in front of Huang Yueli, and first control the situation before speaking.","At the very least, Huang Yueli should be persuaded to leave the crowd first.","However, he stared so hard that his eyes almost cramped, but Li Moying remained expressionless and didn’t even look at him.","“Ahem, Moying! You should know that I am with the Patriarch. We are definitely not some perverts who peep at girls. This matter is really a long story... Young Miss Li has a bit of a temper, can you help us out?”","The hint was unsuccessful, so in desperation, Li Yuntao could only choose to speak out.","But Li Moying didn’t answer him at all. After glancing at him, he spoke in a cold tone.","“Elder Tao, I also really want to know what the hell you and the Patriarch are doing? First you sneaked close to my courtyard, and then took the opportunity when I walked away to run outside to my lady’s wing! If it wasn’t a premeditated spying on her, what other explanation could there be?”","Li Yuntao was tongue-tied, never expecting that Li Moying wouldn’t give him any face.","He didn’t know how to answer for a while, so he could only turn his attention to Li Shihong for help.","Li Shihong noticed Li Yuntao’s gaze, and couldn’t help but want to curse.","This guy Li Yuntao usually looks clever, why was he not at all right now?","Such a manner of forced explanation was actually pushed to the Patriarch! Don’t take the blame when it’s time to take the blame!","He cleared his throat, “Ahem, this...Moying, didn’t I already tell you when I was in your courtyard earlier? Elder Tao and I just went to see you and tell you It’s just a little bit of information about other forces, nothing malicious. As for going to see Young Miss Li practice, it’s just...just...”","He hesitated for a while, then suddenly remembered an explanation, and said quickly: “Yes, it’s just curiosity! Because you said that the Qi Gathering Array arranged by Young Miss Li not only works very well, but also shields the surrounding profound energy fluctuations. I was curious for a while, so I went to have a look. I really didn’t expect such a thing to happen later...”","After finishing speaking, he touched his beard and looked at Li Moying, “Moying, don’t you believe us?”","Li Moying looked cold and did not speak.","Huang Yueli sneered directly: “Patriarch Li, what you said sounds nice! Is it just curiosity? Will pure curiosity destroy my array?”"]},{"number":4067,"title":"Chapter 4067 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (9)","paragraphs":["4067 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (9)","“The two of you have outstanding cultivation bases and extensive knowledge. Don’t you know that when one is cultivating, the sudden explosion of the Qi Gathering Array will affect the practitioners in it? If you are not careful, the other party may suffer from a backlash and suffer from Qi Deviation. Anything more serious, it may kill someone!”","She spoke harshly and looked extremely angry.","Li Moying cooperated tacitly with his wife, and also said: “Patriarch, Elder Tao, I really can’t figure it out. Where did my Little Li’er provoke you, and you actually want to hurt her like this! Don’t tell me that you intend to kill her?”","This was very serious.","When the cultivators onlookers heard this, they couldn’t control themselves and were in an uproar.","No one expected that what they heard was such amazing gossip when they stayed behind out of curiosity for a while!","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao actually wanted to kill the future Young Madam, Young Miss Li?","This... No matter what it is for, if it is true, then those who know this secret will not be silenced, right?","Seeing the terrified eyes of the young cultivators, Li Shihong’s expression turned extremely ugly.","“Moying, you... how can you think like this? Are we such people? Young Miss Li, this is really a misunderstanding... Sigh, I also put down this old face and don’t want to, tell you the truth! Yes, Elder Tao and I really made a fool of ourselves this time, because we were provoked by someone with a few words, so we did such a wrong thing...”","By now, he didn’t care about face anymore, so he could only tell the real reason in detail.","Otherwise, after tonight, rumours of him murdering Li Moying’s fiancée might spread throughout the entire God Realm.","Regardless of whether such a thing was true or not, once it gets out, it will be impossible to tell.","At that time, whether it is other forces or the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they will suspect that the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was not in harmony with the Young Master, and the strength of the entire clan will be affected by this.","“Anyway, I was thinking about this matter. I didn’t know what was going on at the time, and I listened to the nonsense of that shameless villain as soon as I thought about it! Now that I think about it, he is definitely a secret agent sent by the Sacred Phoenix Clan to sow discord between us!”","At this moment, Li Shihong completely believed that Huang Yueli was a cultivator who majored in wood attributes.","At that time, at the moment the array was shattered, strong wood attribute energy suddenly burst out!","Even the flowers and plants planted in the courtyard of the resident were affected, and they grew a lot taller all of a sudden!","This was definitely the strength only a god-level genius can have.","He didn’t know that although Huang Yueli also had a bit of wood attribute talent, her wood attribute talent was far from the god level.","At that time, she was able to burst out such a powerful force in an instant by fusing the wood attribute profound energy of Li Moying and Liu Buyan through arrays.","If she was asked to do it a second time, she would definitely give up.","However, Li Shihong never thought of this. At this time, he had already “misunderstood” Huang Yueli because he had listened to the villain’s slander, and he felt extremely guilty, wishing he could find a hole in the ground and go down there.","Li Yuntao was also full of shame, “Young Miss Li, you can’t blame the Patriarch for this matter. I am a fool, not only failed to dissuade the Patriarch, but also came up with stupid ideas. If you want to blame, blame me! What the Patriarch has done is all for the Young Master, there is absolutely no malice!”"]},{"number":4068,"title":"Chapter 4068 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (10)","paragraphs":["4068 Misunderstanding, It’s All A Misunderstanding! (10)","Huang Yueli raised her chin, glanced at him coldly, and said mockingly: “That’s right, you are all thinking about Li Moying, and I’m afraid that I don’t know where the vixen came from and abducted you. Young Master! I can understand, I understand too much!”","Hearing her say “I can understand”, the cultivators present didn’t know why, and none of them felt relieved. Instead, they all felt their backs drenched in cold sweat.","After Huang Yueli finished speaking, she dodged, passed through the crowd, and walked straight towards the gate.","Li Moying showed a shocked look on his face, “Little Li’er, Little Li’er! What’s wrong with you? Where are you going?”","Huang Yueli’s voice came coldly, “Aren’t your clansmen worried that I will bring you down? If that’s the case, let’s just split it up! I can’t bear this charge! You, Young Master Li, have a bright future. , is the future hope of the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, is there any woman to find. Let’s leave now!”","Hearing this, both Li Shihong and Li Yuntao turned pale with shock.","They never expected that after this incident, Huang Yueli would be completely angered, and she would actually want to separate from Li Moying!","Then how come?","If this Young Miss Li really dumped Li Moying, where would they go to find a second girl with god-level talent to marry Li Moying?","Moreover, Huang Yueli said unceremoniously: “By the way, don’t you suspect that I am a spy of the Sacred Phoenix Clan? Just in time, I heard that Huang Juexuan, the genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, is also one of the top geniuses of the God Clan. Even if he’s not as good as Li Moying, he’s pretty much the same, and he’s also a handsome man, why don’t I just go to him, it’s not too insulting to me.”","As soon as these words came out, Li Shihong almost lost his temper on the spot!","The fact that the Cloudy Qilin Clan was able to find two god-level geniuses at the same time was definitely a blessing from their ancestors!","If, as the Patriarch, he not only failed to seize this opportunity, but also pushed the god-level genius he had already obtained to the Sacred Phoenix Clan, even if he died, he would have no face to meet the ancestors of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","He was so anxious that his hands were shaking, “Young Miss Li, calm down...Calm down! We already know we were wrong, we really know we were wrong, you can’t just sentence us to death because of such a momentary negligence!”","Seeing Huang Yueli’s complete indifference, he could only turn to Li Moying, “Moying, why are you standing there stupidly? Why don’t you hurry up and stop Young Miss Li! Are you willing to let Young Miss Li go like this? It’s true that I was thinking about it, but you didn’t offend Young Miss Li, she might still reconsider because of you!”","Things have come to such an extent, if there was any way to keep Huang Yueli, they could only rely on their Young Master’s looks.","A god-level genius like Young Miss Li will be confessed to wherever she goes.","However, if she wants to find a husband who matches her, apart from Li Moying, it is impossible to find a better one.","Li Shihong’s reaction was quick, and he immediately realised that this was the biggest bargaining chip currently held by the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","However, after Li Moying heard his words, the expression on his face was still very cold, “Patriarch is right, I really don’t want to miss Young Miss Li just like this, so if she must leave, I will just go with her.”","“Go? What do you mean?” Li Shihong’s eyes widened in consternation."]},{"number":4069,"title":"Chapter 4069 The Plan Failed (1)","paragraphs":["4069 The Plan Failed (1)","Li Moying said calmly: “It means literally. If the Cloudy Qilin Clan really can’t tolerate Young Miss Li, then I won’t force it. After all, there are so many members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, I can’t be too selfish. However, it is impossible for me to separate from her. Therefore, I am willing to give up my identity as the Young Master and follow her wherever she wants to go.”","Upon hearing this, all the cultivators present were shocked.","No one expected that Li Moying would say such a thing!","Being able to become the future Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan was the dream of any cultivator in the God Realm.","If such a goal could be achieved, they were willing to pay any price!","However, Li Moying didn’t take this identity seriously at all, and gave up easily. He said he would give up, just to be with a girl?","After being shocked, everyone turned their attention to Huang Yueli, and then fell silent again.","To be honest, if there was a woman like Young Miss Li, it was also a good thing that can’t be dreamed of. It was really difficult for people to choose...","So, it doesn’t seem strange that Li Moying would make such a choice?","Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were more shocked than any cultivator present!","Because they know Li Moying best, and they know that with his character, he either doesn’t speak up, and once he speaks up to make a decision, no one can change it!","Since he said he wanted to go with Young Miss Li, he definitely didn’t talk about it, nor did he threaten the family to make concessions, but just informed everyone.","The two suddenly panicked.","“Moying, Moying! Calm down, calm down! How can you leave the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","“That’s right, Moying, you really don’t have to be so impulsive. We never said that we can’t tolerate Young Miss Li’s words? This is really all a misunderstanding!”","“Moying, didn’t you listen to what I said just now? I was really deceived by the villain. At that time, my brain wasn’t working and I didn’t know what was going on, so... I was confused! But now I know I was wrong! Ah! I can swear to Young Miss Li that such a thing will never happen again in the future!”","Li Shihong’s mind was still spinning very fast, and he immediately realised that it would probably be useless to keep Li Moying and work on himself.","However, if Huang Yueli can be persuaded to stay, then Li Moying will naturally follow.","He quickly winked at Li Yuntao.","Li Yuntao understood.","The two walked up to Huang Yueli together, bowed to her in salute, cupped their hands, and apologised sincerely: “Young Miss Li, today’s incident is indeed the responsibility of our Cloudy Qilin Clan, which offended you, I am really sorry! I apologise to you on behalf of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","“Young Miss Li, please be magnanimous and forgive us this time!”","After hearing Li Shihong’s words, there was another burst of confusion and commotion in the crowd.","Young clansmen, no one expected that the majestic Patriarch and Elder of the Cloudy Qilin Clan would show such a respectful attitude, bowing and apologising to a girl who is not yet twenty years old!","With their identities, even if they have offended the principals of other forces, it is impossible for them to apologise like this.","But now...","However, thinking of Huang Yueli’s identity and what happened just now, no one thought it was strange."]},{"number":4070,"title":"Chapter 4070 The Plan Failed (2)","paragraphs":["4070 The Plan Failed (2)","Things have gotten to this point, if the Cloudy Qilin Clan doesn’t take the initiative to apologise sincerely, then maybe Huang Yueli will really leave!","Once she leaves, it’s not just her own business, but also their Young Master, Li Moying!","Two god-level geniuses left at the same time!","If the Cloudy Qilin Clan has never had a god-level genius, then there hasn’t been one from the beginning to the end, and that was nothing.","But now there were two, and they were lost at the same time in one night! The blow to the Cloudy Qilin Clan was huge!","Originally, it was definitely possible to become the number one force in the God Realm in the future, but after the two god-level geniuses left, it would become a complete joke!","At that time, not only will the strength be greatly damaged, but their face will also be ruined.","Heaven knows what people in the entire God Realm will talk about their clan?","Huang Yueli left very quickly, even when Li Moying said that she would go with her, she didn’t look back.","However, it was not too difficult for the two Dao Profound Realm experts to stop her.","Seeing the two people bowing their heads sincerely, Huang Yueli stopped in her tracks.","Li Moying also walked out from the crowd and quickly chased after her.","After Huang Yueli exchanged a look with him, her attitude gradually softened.","“Patriarch Li, Elder Tao, why do you two do this? You are all Elders, and I can’t bear your salutes! I don’t want to blame you for today’s incident. After all, you did it all for the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It is always right to be cautious. However, it is indeed inappropriate for me to stay in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so please understand.”","What Huang Yueli said was neither humble nor overbearing, and she didn’t deliberately make things difficult for them.","But the more she behaved like this, the more shame Li Shihong and Li Yuntao felt.","What a magnanimous and generous girl!","Even if she wasn’t a god-level genius, with her knowledge and mind, she stood at the helm, far from any ordinary cultivators.","Apart from being ashamed, they hoped to keep Huang Yueli even more!","The Cloudy Qilin Clan has Li Moying, and now there’s her! That is definitely a soaring rhythm, no matter what price to pay for it, it’s worth it.","“Young Miss Li, you must not leave. We can really guarantee that what happened today will not happen again! In order to express the sincerity of our Cloudy Qilin Clan... We came to Floating Sea this time and brought several treasures from the ancient times. I will present these to you on behalf of the clan! When the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over and I return to the Cloudy Qilin Clan, I will distribute the clan’s property to you. In short, your treatment is the same as Moying... no, better than Moying!”","Li Shihong patted his chest and promised.","Now that he has given up everything, in his heart, there is nothing more important than Huang Yueli.","Even Li Moying himself can’t match Huang Yueli’s status.","Because Li Moying had already expressed his attitude earlier, that he would follow Huang Yueli to advance and retreat together.","By keeping Huang Yueli, Li Moying was also kept.","But in reverse, it may not be true.","Li Shihong proposed various preferential conditions one after another, and also asked Li Yuntao to immediately fetch all the promised treasures, and he had to honour them on the spot.","A smile finally appeared on the corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth, “This... This, Patriarch Li is so sincere, how can I embarrass you?”","Li Shihong was overjoyed when he heard her ’embarrassed words’."]},{"number":4071,"title":"Chapter 4071 The Plan Failed (3)","paragraphs":["4071 The Plan Failed (3)","“Young Miss Li, it’s an honour for our entire family to have you stay! From now on, you will be the Young Madam of our Cloudy Qilin Clan...”","In the middle of Li Shihong’s words, Huang Yueli coughed twice and interrupted him.","“Patriarch Li, we’re not married yet, so it’s better not to address me as such.”","Li Shihong immediately came to his senses, “Yes, yes, I was in a hurry! Even though this is already a firm matter, it is still inappropriate to call you Young Madam...”","Liu Buyan, who was mixed in the crowd, watched Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s performance the whole time, with an incredulous expression on his face.","“Whoa... that’s what it means to sell someone, and that person being sold still counts the money for you! Seeing my Junior Sister laughing so happily, it must be for the sake of treasures. Alas, poor Patriarch Li took all the treasures at the bottom of the box. In the end it was really given to the Sacred Phoenix Clan...”","Liu Buyan felt that he really couldn’t stand it anymore!","If Huang Yueli hadn’t been his Junior Sister, he really wanted to expose their true colours!","Who told them that in addition to cheating people, they also show affection in front of him every day!","The crisis that day finally subsided as Li Shihong and Li Yuntao desperately apologised and gave gifts.","Not only did Huang Yueli dispel the suspicion of her from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but she also earned a fortune. She was in a good mood, and happily went back to rest with her husband in arm.","But Li Shihong and Li Yuntao were full of anger!","Of course, this anger was not directed at Huang Yueli, but at Steward He who dared to provide them with “fake news” and sow discord!","From their point of view, things were now very clear.","Young Miss Li was indeed a human god-level genius with the wood attribute. To deliberately mislead them by saying that she was a person with the fire attribute was an obvious move that he harboured ulterior motives.","It can be said with 99% certainty that he was a spy sent by the Sacred Phoenix Clan, the purpose was to create a rift between them and Young Miss Li.","As soon as Li Shihong returned to his room, he angrily ordered the guards around him.","“Come on, hurry up and bring Steward He over here! Immediately!”","Li Shihong swore inwardly again that as long as the guards brought Steward He, he would definitely send that Sacred Phoenix Clan to work on it carefully!","But not long after, the guard came back empty-handed, “Patriarch, when the subordinates arrived at Steward He’s residence, there was no one in the room, and I don’t know if he left for a short while...”","“Left for a short while! This guy is clearly running away!” Li Shihong slapped the table vigorously, smashing a rosewood round table into pieces.","Seeing this scene, the guards shuddered secretly.","As the Patriarch, Li Shihong’s temper is relatively peaceful among Dao Profound Realm cultivators, and it is rare to see him in such an angry state.","Li Shihong paced back and forth in the room, and when he saw something that was not pleasing to the eye, he smashed it all into pieces.","He was really annoyed in his heart, hating how he would listen to such clumsy slander.","Fortunately, Young Miss Li has a lot of them, otherwise, he would have no way to end today!","At the same time, he also regretted that after seeing through the scheme of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, he didn’t think of it earlier and asked people to arrest Steward He.","Now, where can he go to find someone?","If you want to find someone to take revenge, there is no way!","“You bastards of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, wait for me! See you when we meet in the God Realm!”"]},{"number":4072,"title":"Chapter 4072 The Plan Failed (4)","paragraphs":["4072 The Plan Failed (4)","On the other side, Steward He has been walking through the narrow alley for quite a while.","He couldn’t figure out why the seemingly foolproof plan would go wrong!","Why did Li Shihong and the others not only fail to arrest Young Miss Li after they ran to the small courtyard to peep, but instead flew out one by two in disgrace.","And the suspicion on Young Miss Li’s body was completely cleared away.","“What the hell is going on here? How did Young Miss Li become a wood attribute? Could it be that the information Elder Sanbai told me was wrong? It can’t be as I am an important pawn.”","Steward He’s current position cannot be replaced by anyone in the entire Sacred Phoenix Clan.","His exposure will inevitably cause heavy losses to the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Therefore, Steward He never thought about the possibility of Huang Sanbai entrapping him.","Seeing that the residence of the Sacred Phoenix Clan was right in front of him, Steward He finally secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","“I’ve finally reached...”","He showed his identity token to the guard at the gate, entered the garrison, and immediately rushed to Huang Sanbai’s small courtyard.","When Huang Sanbai saw him, he was also taken aback.","“You... Steward He, why are you here now? Didn’t we agree to implement that plan tonight?”","Steward He said with a pale face: “Elder Sanbai, don’t you know? Our plan has completely failed! That’s why I escaped! Fortunately, I reacted quickly enough, otherwise, I would have been arrested by the Cloudy Qilin Clan now and tortured by them.”","Huang Sanbai’s face suddenly changed, “How is it possible? How could the plan fail?”","He thought that this plan to sow dissension was perfect, and it was impossible for him to fail.","In other words, even if Li Shihong and the others were discovered by Huang Yueli, they would only feel that they were not cautious enough, and they would not suspect the Sacred Phoenix Clan at all.","Steward He shook his head, “Actually, I’m a little confused... I don’t dare to get too close, so I listened to what other people said...”","Steward He told what he knew.","He was not at the scene, and he only heard that an explosion suddenly occurred in Li Moying’s small courtyard. Even the surrounding Dao Profound Realm masters were blown away.","Later, Young Miss Li got angry and ran to the two of them to argue.","Obviously, the so-called temptation was successful, but the result was different from what they expected.","Although Steward He didn’t explain everything comprehensively, Huang Sanbai still knew Huang Yueli quite well. After thinking about it carefully, he understood.","“Damn it, Steward He must have done things unreliably, and the news leaked out! He must have been used by that damn girl, she set up a trap for Li Shihong and the others instead!”","“This damn girl is really too cunning, she can’t even fix her like this! This is really a big trouble... No, no, I will definitely let her get the ranking of the God Realm’s Grand Meet like this, otherwise it’s really over!”","Thoughts flashed quickly in Huang Sanbai’s mind, but Steward He didn’t know what he was thinking, he just felt that his face was strange.","“Elder Sanbai, what do you think is going on here? What’s wrong?”","Huang Sanbai came back to his senses, and waved at him, “Come closer, I’ll tell you secretly.”","Steward He didn’t doubt that he was there, and leaned over.","But immediately after, he felt a pain in his lower abdomen. When he lowered his head, he saw a dagger deeply inserted into his abdomen."]},{"number":4073,"title":"Chapter 4073 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (1)","paragraphs":["4073 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (1)","For a moment, Steward He couldn’t react at all, and stared blankly at the dagger, not knowing what happened.","After a while, he raised his head and stared at Huang Sanbai in disbelief.","“Elder Sanbai, you...you...”","However, it was too late for him to react at this time.","The dagger had been specially soaked in a fast-acting poison that would be deadly within a few breaths.","Therefore, Steward He fell backwards without even finishing a sentence.","His body hit the ground heavily and remained motionless.","Until his death, he didn’t understand why Huang Sanbai, one of the most esteemed Elders of the family, would suddenly attack him.","He obviously did everything according to Huang Sanbai’s request, and things would go wrong because the information provided by Huang Sanbai was wrong, not his responsibility.","“Tsk, I didn’t expect that dead girl to be very capable. She can even see through such a scheme. It’s really difficult to deal with. Fortunately, this old man is simple-minded, and everything has been exposed. He hasn’t seen what’s wrong yet. He even ran back to me. Otherwise, if the things I did behind my back got to the Patriarch and the others, it would be hard to explain.”","After being frustrated, Huang Sanbai felt somewhat fortunate.","He pulled out the dagger from Steward He, wiped off the blood on it and frowned in thought.","“Such a big trouble! The failure of the plan is not the worst in itself. The main problem is that I must have alarmed Huang Yueli now. That damn girl must have prepared herself, and she might be thinking about a way to deal with me! No, I must think of a better way, and it is best to kill her immediately!”","Huang Sanbai’s expression was hideous, with his hands behind his back, he paced back and forth in the room.","After walking back and forth several times, he suddenly stopped in his tracks.","“There is no other way! This time, we can only put all our eggs in one basket! Either she dies, or I die! There is no room for manoeuvre!”","Huang Sanbai made up his mind, and couldn’t wait for dawn, so he immediately took advantage of the darkness and slipped out of the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s residence.","The direction he was heading towards was the house located in the centre of the Gravity Island, where all the stewards of Floating Sea lived.","Carefully avoiding pedestrians, he came to one of the courtyards and secretly knocked on the door.","“Who is it? Come here in the middle of the night?” the guard guarding the gate asked strangely.","Huang Sanbai tightened the cloak on his body, and pulled down the hat on his head, covering most of his face, then lowered his voice and said: “I am an old friend of your Steward Jin, please help me inform him, this is a token.”","He took out a suet jade token and handed it to the guard.","The guard glanced at him suspiciously. Although he felt that this person was very suspicious, but after hearing what he said with certainty and the so-called token in his hand, he hesitated for a moment, and went in to report.","Not long after, Steward Jin greeted him personally.","“Oh, isn’t this Elder Huang? Rare guest, really a rare guest! I knew that you came to Floating Sea along with your clan, but according to our Floating Sea’s rules, I can’t meet with friends privately before the God Realm’s Grand Meet. That’s why I didn’t come to visit. Unexpectedly, you came here in person!”","Steward Jin looked very surprised."]},{"number":4074,"title":"Chapter 4074 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (2)","paragraphs":["4074 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (2)","However, when he saw Huang Sanbai, he was more joyful than surprised.","Without asking any further questions, he was welcomed into the living room.","“Elder Huang, I haven’t seen you for so many years. Your cultivation seems to be getting better and better. It seems that you are at least in the late stage of the Dao Profound Realm, right? You really make us Juniors very envious!”","Steward Jin asked Huang Sanbai to sit down, and asked the maidservants to serve tea and refreshments.","Then, while exchanging greetings with Huang Sanbai, he guessed his reason for coming.","According to common sense, they, the stewards of the Floating Sea, cannot meet privately with the cultivators of the major forces participating in the competition. He has seriously violated the rules of the Floating Sea by letting Huang Sanbai in today. If the Island Master pays attention, it would put him in serious trouble.","However, Huang Sanbai has saved his family’s life. This kindness has been going on for hundreds of years, and he had no chance to repay it.","Therefore, Steward Jin couldn’t say no to Huang Sanbai.","It’s just that Steward Jin doesn’t understand. Huang Sanbai is not a stunned young man who doesn’t understand the rules, and it’s not the first time he has come to Floating Sea. He should be clear about the rules here, yet he still came?","There must be some reason for this.","It’s not easy for Steward Jin to ask questions, so he can only say some irrelevant things.","But Huang Sanbai, after experiencing today’s failure, couldn’t hold his breath any longer. He couldn’t even drink a sip of tea, so he opened his mouth directly.","“Stop talking, Steward Jin, I’ll just ask you, I, Huang Sanbai, have an important matter to ask for your help today, will you help?”","Upon hearing this, Steward Jin hurriedly said: “Of course! Elder Huang, if you have anything to do, just tell me! You know me. I have been trying to repay you for so many years, but I have no chance. If you are willing to give me this opportunity, I can only wish for it!”","Huang Sanbai didn’t tell the matter right away, but asked again: “Even if this matter is likely to cost your life?”","Steward Jin nodded without hesitation, “That’s right! As long as it’s Elder Huang’s request, I will be willing to put my life down for it! You saved not only me, but also my wife and three children. Our family owes your kindness to us. Even if I paid back with my life, I still earned!”","Huang Sanbai nodded, but still hesitated.","Steward Jin took the initiative to urge: “Elder Huang, just tell me, there are shielding arrays around my place, and they won’t spread.”","Only then did Huang Sanbai slowly say: “This matter...it’s really embarrassing to talk about. I heard that the first round of the God Realm’s Grand Meet will be the same as the previous few times. Everyone will gather in one place for a massive knockout match, isn’t it?”","Since there are too many cultivators who signed up for the God Realm’s Grand Meet, it would take several years of hard work to select through one-on-one competitions, and it may not be possible to decide the first, second or third.","Therefore, there would be a huge elimination round to filter out all the good seeds.","Everyone will be thrown into the same arena, and only the remaining 1,000 people will enter the next match.","Through such a round of simple and rough competition, at least 90% of the contestants would be eliminated.","Hearing this, Steward Jin nodded, “That’s right, that’s true.”","“Then you stewards, like in previous years, are responsible for monitoring and protecting the participating cultivators in this round?”","Steward Jin nodded again, “That’s right.”","He quickly remembered something, “Elder Huang, do you want me to make things easier for the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan?”"]},{"number":4075,"title":"Chapter 4075 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (3)","paragraphs":["4075 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (3)","According to the rules of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, for the sake of fairness, all competitors are not allowed to carry any equipment other than standard spirit weapons, and even the pills for supplies are regulated.","These regulations are all for the sake of fairness.","Otherwise, the advantages of cultivators with a powerful background would be too obvious.","If everyone has the same level of cultivation, one was carrying a treasure while the other was using a low-level spiritual weapon, then there is no need to compare.","Huang Sanbai came to him at this time, and asked about the elimination round as soon as he opened his mouth.","Therefore, Steward Jin’s first reaction was that Huang Sanbai, for the sake of the family interests of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, hoped that Steward Jin would be lenient and let the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan bring in some prohibited things.","Steward Jin immediately frowned, “Elder Huang, this favour... To be honest, if you insist on asking me to help you, it’s not impossible, but it’s meaningless to do so? With the genius level of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, they should be able to pass the round without much problem. Besides, it is no longer the number of people who pass the elimination round that determines the status of a powerful force like the Sacred Phoenix Clan, but the ranking of the top talents. Isn’t the Sacred Phoenix Clan aiming for the top ten rankings?”","For such a small matter, it was not necessary to use the favour of life-saving kindness as repayment.","Steward Jin felt that this was unreliable.","Huang Sanbai shook his head, “No, I want your help. Naturally, it’s not such a small favour. I hope that you can help me find the position of a certain cultivator during the elimination round, and then open the array at the right time to let me get into the arena!”","The arena of the elimination round was covered by a huge array.","Because the stewards of Floating Sea are responsible for protecting the safety of the contestants, they all have the authority to check the location of the contestants, and they can also slightly open the array to reveal the gap, and teleport the fighters in the array.","This can save lives in an emergency!","Upon hearing this, Steward Jin was taken aback.","He stared at Huang Sanbai, thinking about it quickly. Suddenly, he thought of an astonishing possibility, and his whole body trembled.","“Huang... Elder Huang! You can’t be... you can’t be the one who wants to... ahem, who wants to deal with the Cloudy Qilin Clan...”","Steward Jin’s face became extremely pale.","Although he had already guessed when Huang Sanbai asked him if he was afraid of dying, Huang Sanbai’s request might be astonishing.","However, he didn’t expect that it would be so shocking!","It seems that Huang Sanbai actually wants to enter the elimination round in person to deal with Li Moying, the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","At this moment, Steward Jin still remembered the rumours he heard when chatting with someone a few months ago.","It was said that Huang Sanbai had already dealt a poisonous hand against Li Moying before, and even caused the only god-level genius in the God Realm to be seriously injured and unconscious for a long time, almost killing him.","However, in Steward Jin’s mind, Huang Sanbai has always been an upright and majestic old man, so he didn’t believe such nonsense at all, and even scolded the person who said it.","But looking at Huang Sanbai’s reaction now, could it be...all those are true?","Huang Sanbai looked at the change on Steward Jin’s face, but he was still very calm.","He shook his head, “No, you made a mistake. The cultivator I want you to inquire about is not Li Moying, but the girl beside him.”","“Girl? You mean...that fiancee of Young Master Li?”"]},{"number":4076,"title":"Chapter 4076 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (4)","paragraphs":["4076 Would Definitely Not Be Able To Escape This Time (4)","Huang Sanbai nodded with a serious expression, “That’s right, it’s her!”","Steward Jin frowned suspiciously, “Is there something wrong with Young Miss Li? Look at her young age, she is not outstanding except for being pretty. Besides, she is really arrogant. You must have heard about what happened at the trial array yesterday, right? She actually said that she is also a god...”","Speaking of which, Steward Jin suddenly stopped.","Immediately afterwards, his eyeballs almost popped out, and he opened his mouth wide, with a look of shock on his face.","“Could it be that what Young Miss Li said is true? She is really a god-level genius? That’s why you...”","Steward Jin was not a fool, and quickly analysed that the most likely reason is that Young Miss Li is also a true god-level genius!","If this is the case, it’s no wonder that the Sacred Phoenix Clan is so nervous, and even made such a bad move, sending a top powerhouse like Huang Sanbai to deal with her!","If the Cloudy Qilin Clan really has two god-level geniuses at the same time, what will happen to the Sacred Phoenix Clan...","He simply did not even dare not think about it!","The corner of Huang Sanbai’s mouth twitched, and he glanced at Steward Jin, neither confirming nor denying it.","“Anyway, this reason has little to do with you, and you don’t have to guess wildly. I just want to know if it’s possible for you to do what I just said.”","Steward Jin managed to recover from the shock, frowned, thought for a while, and said, “It shouldn’t be difficult to check the location of Young Miss Li. However, when the competitors are sent into the arena, their locations are random, and she may not be sent to the my assigned area. It really depends on the situation at the time. I will find a way to exchange positions with the corresponding steward, but there is no guarantee of success.”","Huang Sanbai pondered for a moment, then nodded, “Even if she doesn’t land in your area, it’s not a big problem. The safe area on the field will gradually shrink, and the area where she can move will become smaller and smaller, there’s my chance.”","“Then this matter...it’s settled.” Huang Sanbai looked at Steward Jin.","But Steward Jin had a look of hesitation on his face, “This...”","“What’s the problem? Are you planning to go back on your word?” Huang Sanbai frowned in displeasure.","Steward Jin hurriedly said: “No, no, Elder Huang, you misunderstood, of course I have no problem here, but have you really considered it? If you really do it in the elimination round, you will almost certainly be discovered. You know the strength behind our Floating Sea, even if you are an Elder of the Sacred Phoenix Clan, it is very difficult to escape the responsibility. Maybe your life may be in danger!”","Huang Sanbai snorted coldly: “You don’t need to worry about that, I’m already prepared. Besides, I’m already at this age, so what does it matter if I lose my life for the clan?”","After hearing what he said, Steward Jin immediately became serious.","“Elder Huang is indeed the humerus of the Sacred Phoenix Clan. It is really a blessing for the Sacred Phoenix Clan to have a senior Elder like you!”","For a while, the image of Huang Sanbai in his heart became even taller.","There were really too few cultivators who could sacrifice their names for the future of the clan.","What’s more, Huang Sanbai still has such an identity!","Making such a choice was even more commendable.","Seeing that Steward Jin was completely fooled by himself, Huang Sanbai finally showed a smile.","That dead girl... This time, she will definitely not be able to escape!"]},{"number":4077,"title":"Chapter 4077 The Start Of The Grand Meet (1)","paragraphs":["4077 The Start Of The Grand Meet (1)","The next morning, Huang Yueli and Li Moying also heard the news of Steward He’s disappearance, and felt a little pity.","“This guy should have been sent by Huang Sanbai. Now that he’s gone, he’s definitely not going to survive.” Huang Yueli sighed, “Oh, if we can detain him earlier, maybe we can get some information. I don’t know what kind of tricks Huang Sanbai will do next.”","Li Moying frowned slightly, “With Huang Sanbai’s cunning personality, he probably didn’t tell the truth to Steward He, so even if he was caught, he probably wouldn’t be able to tell us anything.”","Huang Yueli nodded, expressing her agreement.","“Husband is so right! However, Huang Sanbai can definitely guess that I will reveal my identity after the God Realm’s Grand Meet, so if he wants to make a move, he will probably choose it during the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and the sooner he starts, the better!”","After thinking about it for a while, Huang Yueli had already guessed a large chunk on Huang Sanbai’s next move.","In the preliminary round of elimination, there were many contestants. Hundreds of thousands of people will be thrown into the middle of a large array at the same time. It would not be surprising if one or two people disappeared inexplicably.","Moreover, no one would notice.","At this time, it was definitely the most appropriate time to do it.","If it drags on to the next round, a one-on-one round-robin match and knockout match will begin.","Moreover, as the number of participants decreases, each match will attract more and more attention.","At that time, no matter what means are used, they will take even greater risks.","Li Moying obviously also thought of this, and his face suddenly became a little dignified, “This is a bit troublesome. During the elimination round, after everyone is teleported, they will all appear in a random position. It’s impossible for us to teleport to the same place, and we can’t contact each other. I can’t protect you at all.”","Huang Yueli looked at her husband’s furrowed brows, and a slight smile appeared on the corner of her mouth.","She walked up to Li Moying, and raised her hand to massage his furrowed brows to smooth them out.","“Husband, don’t worry, I’m still at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm now! Besides, my actual combat ability is also very good, and many fighters in the Dao Profound Realm may not be able to match me! This elimination round is against me. It is not difficult for me, even if Huang Sanbai wants to play tricks, it will be difficult to pose a real threat to me.”","When she said this, she was not boasting, but purely seeking truth from facts.","Floating Sea’s rules are very strict, and the Island Master is very authoritative. None of the stewards dare to disobey his orders.","And as long as there are no problems with the steward, what tricks can Huang Sanbai come up with?","Looking for cultivators from the Sacred Phoenix Clan to besiege her?","To be honest, even if a heaven-level genius comes to fight, that person is no match for her at all. It can only be said that person was suicidal!","If Huang Sanbai really did such a stupid thing, after the attempt failed, he would definitely become a sinner of the clan.","This old guy is insidious and cunning, it’s impossible for him to be so stupid.","Huang Yueli thought for a while, but couldn’t think of what Huang Sanbai would do.","“It doesn’t matter, it’s useless to guess now. I’ll bring more hidden weapons and medicinal pills, just be prepared.” Huang Yueli smiled, not taking it seriously at all.","However, her husband kept frowning.","“I always feel that things won’t be that simple. No, I’m still worried! Is there no way to create a spirit armament so that we can communicate in the big array?”"]},{"number":4078,"title":"Chapter 4078 The Start Of The Grand Meet (2)","paragraphs":["4078 The Start Of The Grand Meet (2)","Huang Yueli shook her head helplessly, “If there was a way to communicate, I would have gone to refine Spirit Armaments long ago. But the fact is that there are Spirit Armaments for communication, but there are countless shielding arrays in Floating Sea’s massive array, which can completely counteract the effects of these Spirit Armaments.”","“This massive array was handed down from ancient times, and it is said to be the masterpiece of an array master in the Life Profound Realm. I can’t even guarantee that I can crack this kind of array.”","After hearing this, Li Moying was obviously disappointed.","He glanced at Huang Yueli, hesitating to speak several times.","Huang Yueli glared at him, “Don’t try to persuade me to give up the competition! If I dare not even participate in such an important competition because of a possible ‘threat’, then this will definitely become my inner demon. Having one will prevent me from making more breakthroughs in future!”","Of course Li Moying knew that what his Little Li’er said was correct.","However, as her husband, he was really worried about her, and wished he could stay by her side every moment to protect her from the wind and rain, instead of letting her face the deadly threat of a famous and powerful man in the God Realm!","However, he knows better that his Little Li’er is a phoenix soaring above the nine heavens!","Rather than a canary bird that was locked in a golden cage and kept at home.","Therefore, his love must not be an obstacle to her reaching the peak.","Although he knew that as long as his attitude was strong enough, Huang Yueli would definitely compromise with him in the end because she loved him, but he would never do that.","In the end, Li Moying could only shake his head, “I don’t mean to let you give up the competition. However, you must listen to me these few days and make some preparations.”","Huang Yueli naturally nodded happily, “Alright, I will listen to my husband!”","...","Three days later.","After the last few days of intense preparations for the battle, the God Realm’s Grand Meet officially started.","This match was destined to be a grand event in the entire God Realm.","Not only did the major forces send the most talented fighters to participate, but even the most important personnels in the clan all came to Floating Sea.","In addition, the dignified Island Master with unfathomable strength, also came here in person.","His appearance made all cultivators present feel a deep pressure!","For almost everyone, a strong person at the Life Profound Realm was an unattainable height.","Only Li Moying and Huang Yueli quickly returned to normal after the initial discomfort.","They all looked eagerly in their eyes, and looked in the direction of the Island Master.","After all, the Life Profound Realm was the goal that they were pursuing and it was also an achievable goal!","However, for some reason, when they met the Island Master’s gaze, they felt that the Island Master’s gaze stayed on Huang Yueli for a while longer, as if he was thinking about something.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, “It must be an illusion...”","The Right Protector of Floating Sea was the main person in charge of this God Realm’s Grand Meet. He walked to the high platform in the middle of the square, first said some polite words to welcome all cultivators to come to participate in the competition before he then quickly spoke on the preliminary round of elimination without further ado.","“Starting today, the God Realm’s Grand Meet will officially begin. The first round is the elimination round.”","“This competition is no different from previous years. To put it simply, all competitors will be randomly teleported to a certain location on Paradise Island. The entire island of Paradise Island has been shrouded in a large array. Your competition will be conducted in this large array.”"]},{"number":4079,"title":"Chapter 4079 The Start Of The Grand Meet (3)","paragraphs":["4079 The Start Of The Grand Meet (3)","There were seven islands of different sizes in the Floating Sea.","Among them, Gravity Island where they were now was the largest one, and it was also where the Island Master’s Mansion was.","There were many houses built on the Gravity Island, which can accommodate a large number of cultivators to live in.","Except for the Gravity Island, the other six islands were basically deserted islands. It was left uninhibited, and there were a lot of spirit beasts and spirit plants growing. It was a good place for experience.","However, apart from time where the God Realm’s Grand Meet was held, these six islands did not allow cultivators from other forces access.","Paradise Island was the largest of the six deserted islands.","“On Paradise Island, all of your cultivations will be uniformly suppressed at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, and the gap in cultivation between each other will disappear. What will play a decisive role will be your actual combat ability, and this depends on your comprehension of the laws of attributes as well as understanding the application of combat techniques and the ability to adapt to changing situations.”","“Two hours after you enter Paradise Island, a green poisonous mist will appear on the island. Anyone who touches this poisonous mist will immediately become powerless, and the profound strength of the whole body will be suppressed immediately, and they will completely lose their fighting power. If you don’t detoxify within three hours, you will die immediately. Therefore, once you get poisoned, you have to release the signal flare immediately, and let the steward come to rescue you. At the same time, leaving Paradise Island also means that you will be eliminated in the competition! ”","“Moreover, this poisonous mist will continue to spread inwards, that is to say, in order to ensure that you will not be brought down by the it, you must escape from the range where the poisonous mist is located. This range will definitely become smaller and smaller. At the end of the round, a large number of you will all be squeezed into a small area. At this time, you have to find a way to throw others into the poisonous mist, forcing them to withdraw from the competition, and the remaining thousand people will enter the semi-finals, understand?”","Most of the cultivators present had some understanding of the rules of the competition.","After listening, there was not much expression on their faces, and they all nodded to express their understanding.","The Right Protector was still worried and frowned, earnestly repeating the importance of his words.","“Please understand, although in the protection of the big array, even if there is a fight between you, in most cases it will not hurt your life, but you still have to try to avoid causing fatal injuries to your competitors.”","“Please don’t take advantage of the problem to resolve personal grievances in the Grand Meet organised by our Floating Sea.”","“If you don’t listen to our advice, we can punish you in Floating Sea!”","The Right Protector spoke very calmly, neither slow nor fast, but the deterrent force in his words was still very powerful.","After all, the person standing behind him was the Island Master!","Not many people would dare to disobey the words of those at the Life Profound Realm.","All the cultivators present nodded their heads in a hurry, expressing their agreement with the rules of the competition.","The Right Protector just nodded and announced: “Alright, then... the competition will officially begin! All contestants, please take out the tokens you received when you signed up, and hold them firmly in your hands. That is the medium of your transmission.”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying also took out the tokens as they said.","“The teleportation array has been activated!”","Following the order of the Right Protector, teleportation flashes were everywhere in the square.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying only had time to look at each other before they were sent out at the same time."]},{"number":4080,"title":"Chapter 4080 The Start Of The Grand Meet (4)","paragraphs":["4080 The Start Of The Grand Meet (4)","Huang Yueli only felt a blur in front of her eyes, and when she saw clearly again, she had disappeared from her original position and had already arrived on Paradise Island.","She stood up straight, looked left and right and observed the surrounding environment.","Judging from the scene in front of her, she should be in a clearing in the woods, surrounded by tall and short trees, and the roars of spirit beasts could be heard from time to time not far away.","“Well... It is said that the entire Paradise Island is a large forest. Except for a large plain in the centre of the island, it is surrounded by trees. Therefore, the most I can judge now is that I was not randomly placed in the centre. As for others, It’s impossible to judge.”","Huang Yueli thought about it for a while, and the information she got was very limited, even less useful.","The only thing she knew was that the poisonous mist would enclose them from the edge of the island to the centre. Therefore, if she had been sent randomly to the centre at the start, then there was no need to move and dodge from time to time, just sit and wait for the competition to enter the final stage.","She obviously didn’t have such good luck.","Of course, for ordinary cultivators, being randomly assigned to the centre position cannot be said to be a completely good thing in itself, it can only be said that there were advantages and disadvantages.","Because, there must be more and more people in the central position, and the possibility of battles was also the highest. Most probably, from the first hour of entering, they will start to face various battles!","People with slightly weaker abilities will probably be eliminated from the very start of the competition!","For an ordinary person who was randomly sent to a relatively marginal position they would be worried to be besieged with all sorts of attacks. However, for a person like Huang Yueli, she would be able to survive no matter what.","For a strong exponent like her, as for fighting? Nope, she had never been afraid.","“Sigh, since it’s already like this, there’s nothing I can do. I don’t know how far I am from the centre, and which direction is the correct direction to go. So, for now, I can only wait!”","Huang Yueli sat down cross-legged under a tree out of boredom, wanting to pass the time by cultivating first.","But she didn’t sit for a long time before she suddenly opened her eyes.","“Hmm, somebody is coming this way?”","Hearing the sound of footsteps, Huang Yueli’s first reaction was to climb up a tree and hide.","One thing more was no worse than one thing less. She has no interest in bullying those ordinary fighters in the elimination round. It was more enjoyable to bully those geniuses in the final round.","So, try not to get in touch with these people, it will save a lot of trouble.","As soon as she climbed up the tree, she saw a youth with short black hair coming from the end of the forest. He was not very old, just an ordinary human.","His face was full of vigilance, he looked around very warily, and walked forward slowly.","Huang Yueli didn’t say a word, just waiting for him to pass by.","But who knows, not long after, there was another sound of footsteps. This time, a young man in a purple robe appeared in her field of vision.","Huang Yueli checked his aura, and felt that he should be a cultivator of the Empyrean Fox Clan.","The two met on a narrow road, and Huang Yueli immediately felt sorry for that human cultivator.","Alas, it’s a pity, he was going to be sent out as soon as he came in.","Sure enough, as soon as the Empyrean Fox cultivator saw the human youth, he immediately attacked him without saying a word!","Now that everyone has entered the elimination round, they are competitors!","Less than a quarter of an hour after the human youth came in, he was sadly knocked unconscious and was then teleported out soon after."]},{"number":4081,"title":"Chapter 4081 The Start Of The Grand Meet (5)","paragraphs":["4081 The Start Of The Grand Meet (5)","Not only that, but a Spirit Armament in the human youth’s hand fell to the ground during the battle.","The victorious Empyrean Fox clan cultivator smiled, strode over, and picked up the weapon.","“Ha ha, today is really my lucky day! Although this Spirit Armament is standard equipment, it has obviously been improved. It should be an improved Spirit Armament that’s been newly developed by the military that has been circulating in the God Realm recently. This thing is worth a lot now!”","At this moment, he suddenly thought of something and looked around very vigilantly.","Huang Yueli immediately retracted her protruding head.","She was a little excited when she saw the weapon she designed, and wanted to see it clearly. Unexpectedly, the cultivators of the Ancient God Clans had some skills after all, so they could sense her peeping.","The cultivator of the Empyrean Fox Clan looked left and right, but couldn’t find anyone nearby. He finally felt relieved and happily put away the spoils.","After he left, Huang Yueli came out from her hiding place.","However, she was very cautious and found a hidden place to rest.","Although the battle just now ended very quickly, it also explained a truth.","On Paradise Island, all cultivators are hostile to each other.","They don’t even need to have any disagreement with each other, as long as they simply encounter another cultivator, they will attack each other.","Therefore, even if she was strong enough to crush almost all cultivators on the island, the best way to pass the elimination round was to be as cautious as possible.","After all, there were hundreds of thousands of cultivators on this island!","Who knows what kind of accident will happen?","In previous God Realm’s Grand Meet, there were cases where the favourite to win was knocked out in the chaotic elimination round.","Just like that, Huang Yueli simply sat cross-legged behind a big tree. During this period, some cultivators passed by one after another, but none of them noticed her existence.","Six hours later, she suddenly stood up from the ground.","“It seems that the location I teleported to is still very close to the edge of Paradise Island... I have to leave so soon!”","Within the range of her vision, a mass of light green mist could already be seen slowly drifting towards her position.","Huang Yueli patted away the grass on her body, then strode in the opposite direction.","Since all the cultivators in the vicinity were escaping from the poisonous mist, they were all moving in the same direction.","Therefore, Huang Yueli found that she met more and more cultivators.","However, under the current situation, there was no fighting between cultivators, and everyone ran forward with one mind.","The poisonous mist was not far behind, and no one dared to attack others rashly.","Huang Yueli’s movement was much faster than others. After running forward for a while, when she looked back, she could no longer see the shadow of the green mist.","“Well... you should be able to rest for a while. Moying told me earlier that the poisonous mist will only spread towards the centre every hour. After a while, it will stop spreading and continue until the next hour. It should be safe for now.”","Huang Yueli was thinking about where to spend another hour.","But at this moment, a male voice suddenly came from behind her.","“Hey! The girl in front, please stop!”","This man was not polite.","Huang Yueli frowned, not planning to talk to him.","However, the other party seemed to have set his eyes on her and quickly chased after her."]},{"number":4082,"title":"Chapter 4082 The Start Of The Grand Meet (6)","paragraphs":["4082 The Start Of The Grand Meet (6)","“Hey, I told you to stop, didn’t you hear me?”","Huang Yueli finally stopped in her tracks and when she looked back, she found that it was still a person she had an impression of.","It was the first battle she witnessed when she first entered Paradise Island, the cultivator from the Empyrean Fox Clan.","Huang Yueli had no expression on her face. She glanced at him and asked, “I don’t seem to know you, right? What do you want?”","He stared at the short sword hanging on Huang Yueli’s waist, and said with a chuckle, “You are a cultivator of the human race, right? It’s not bad for the human race to save enough money to travel all the way to the Floating Sea to participate in the competition and you don’t want to be eliminated at the beginning, do you?”","“So... what do you mean?” Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows.","With a conniving smile, he continued on: “It’s very simple, you give me that short sword as a tribute, and I will let you stay here. Otherwise... I will send you out early!”","Huang Yueli looked at the greedy gaze in his eyes, and she felt a little more enlightened in her heart.","Obviously, when this Empyrean Fox cultivator first came in, he got an improved version of the standard Spirit Armament by killing that human youth.","This unexpected windfall made him even more greedy.","Now this can be regarded as a robbery.","After all, if the opponent was killed directly, the opponent’s weapons and equipment may not necessarily fall off, or they may be held in the hand and transported out of the array together.","In this way, he wasted his profound energy in vain and won’t get anything.","Blocking and robbing was different. As long as you specifically choose a young human cultivator, the opponent’s strength was limited, and when suppressed by his strength, 99% of them will be forced to hand over their weapons.","I don’t know how many human cultivators this guy had used this insidious method to deal with during the previous period.","Huang Yueli pretended to be terrified, and blinked her big eyes several times, as if she was quite frightened.","“You... what do you want to do? If I give you this sword, will you really let me go?”","The Empyrean Fox Cultivator originally wanted to simply rob her sword, but after a closer look, he discovered that Huang Yueli was extremely beautiful and his gaze changed again.","Such an outstanding beauty, even in the Empyrean Fox Clan, which was famous for their beauty in the God Realm, was very rare. A sinister glint flashed across his eyes as he looked at her lewdly and continued his arrogance.","“It’s not enough just to give me the weapon. Accompany me and make me happy...he he then I will not only let you go, but also let you form a team with me and go to the centre together.”","Huang Yueli almost scolded all eighteen generations of his ancestors in her heart!","Unexpectedly, not long after entering the array, she had encountered such a disgusting scoundrel.","The Empyrean Fox Cultivator thought that Huang Yueli was thinking about it, and added with satisfaction: “You have to think clearly, following me, it will only be good for you and not bad for you. A little girl like you, moreover you’re still a human, I guess your real strength is at the middle stage of the Dream Profound Realm at most, right? In the arena of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, it is really not very outstanding! It is a fluke that you can survive these six hours, and continue to the central area later , anyone can kill you instantly! Others are not as sympathetic as I am...”","Huang Yueli was so disgusted that she almost vomited out.","She chuckled and said, “What you said is quite reasonable. I never thought I would meet such an expert as you, so come here, let’s get close.”","When the cultivator of the Empyrean Fox Clan saw the beauty smiling, he was immediately entranced as he stood there in a daze for a moment."]},{"number":4083,"title":"Chapter 4083 The Start Of The Grand Meet (7)","paragraphs":["4083 The Start Of The Grand Meet (7)","Without a second thought, he immediately walked towards Huang Yueli quickly.","“Ha ha, I knew it, you are a smart girl!”","As the Empyrean Fox Cultivator said, he stretched out his greasy right hand towards Huang Yueli, and was about to touch her fair and tender face.","At this moment, he suddenly felt a sense of danger!","He didn’t have any time to react but could only feel a burst of profound force slamming into his chest!","An excruciating pain hit him and he felt as if all the bones and internal organs in his body had been crushed in an instant!","Immediately, he was sent flying back!","It took awhile for him to fly in the air before he landed on the ground heavily with a reverberating “bang”.","There was a burst of dizziness in his mind, and he felt that the power in his body was rapidly draining.","He couldn’t hold on any longer and passed out.","Immediately after, he was teleported out of Paradise Island.","Never would he have imagined in his dreams that a robbery that he thought would be foolproof would directly kick him out of the competition!","Now that the competition has only been going on for six hours, not many had been eliminated, and 99% of them were from the human clan, and there were very few cultivators from the Ancient God Clan.","He was eliminated like this. It can be said that he suffered a shameful defeat!","After Huang Yueli threw the man into the poisonous mist, she clapped her hands casually without looking back.","She was too lazy to argue with these ordinary cultivators. Fighting with them was like an adult bullying a child. So boring!","However, if the other party comes knocking at her door, she doesn’t mind letting the other party know what a real peerless genius was!","“It seems that there are still too many people here. How about I walk inside and find a quiet place?”","Huang Yueli was thinking about it, and was about to walk into the forest to the east.","At this moment, someone stopped her again, “Uh, this lady in front, please stay!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help frowning, why did she just dismiss a scoundrel who didn’t have eyes, and then ran into someone else to make trouble so soon?","She turned around and looked towards the person who spoke.","This time, it was a young man who stopped her. Wearing a long robe with silver and white borders, he looked good-looking and talented.","However, what attracted Huang Yueli’s attention was not his appearance, but the aura that naturally exuded from him.","Although on Paradise Island, the cultivation of all cultivators was affected by the array, turning them into the same early stage of the Heart Profound Realm.","However, there was still a big difference between the strong and the weak, and anyone with a little knowledge can easily tell the difference.","For example, the human race youth who was eliminated when he first came in, obviously only had an initial cultivation level in the Dream Profound Realm, so it was not surprising that he would become cannon fodder in seconds.","And the cultivator from the Empyrean Fox Clan who attempted to rob her just now was much more powerful. Huang Yueli speculates that his real cultivation base is at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, which was consistent with the cultivation base simulated by the array.","This kind of cultivation is actually the most advantageous in the competition, because it was no different from one’s usual strength, and one can fully display in battle.","In addition, that person was still an Ancient God Clan cultivator and has learned several profound skills, so he was so confident.","As for... the silver-robed cultivator who stopped her now...","Huang Yueli focused her gaze, thoughtful.","This person’s true cultivation was in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm, which was very rare for cultivators of his age."]},{"number":4084,"title":"Chapter 4084 The Start Of The Grand Meet (8)","paragraphs":["4084 The Start Of The Grand Meet (8)","In the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Li Leyun and Li Zijun were the only ones who could achieve this level of cultivation.","So, this person should be one of the seed players of his clan, one of the top batch of god-level geniuses in the God Realm.","“You called me... What’s the matter?” Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows.","Such a person stopped her, it was definitely not with the intention of robbing her!","A genius like this needs face, and generally won’t do such low-end things.","Besides, his strategy should be the same as hers in the finals, that is, hide your strength and bide your time, avoid fighting ordinary fighters, preserve your strength, and wait until the finals to exert your strength.","The young man nodded towards Huang Yueli, and said: “This girl, I am An Mingyan, a cultivator from the White Fen Clan. It was a coincidence that I saw you make a move just now...”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, “What? Can’t I send that obnoxious guy away?”","An Mingyan hurriedly shook his head and said, “No, this lady, you misunderstood me. I just saw your outstanding skills, and I want you to join my team and go to the central area with us.”","He just came here to explore the way, but he happened to see the dispute between Huang Yueli and that Empyrean Fox cultivator.","Originally thought that this delicate human girl would definitely not escape the fate of being humiliated, but who knew that the situation was reversed instantly in just a few breaths.","The one who was sent flying was actually that cultivator of the Empyrean Fox clan who had a fairly good cultivation base and strength!","Moreover, this human girl shot decisively and fiercely. She sent her opponent flying at least a few hundred metres in one fell swoop. He couldn’t even see where the opponent landed.","It is estimated that the cultivator will definitely be eliminated on the spot!","An Mingyan saw it, and immediately thought of soliciting her.","Seeing that Huang Yueli didn’t speak, he immediately explained, “This lady, I don’t know which faction you belong to. Have you heard about the elimination round before? Because the elimination round has to eliminate so many cultivators, you must fight alone. It will soon be unbearable, so many cultivators will form a team and help each other. As the saying goes, there is strength in numbers, and if there is a confrontation at that time, the chances of winning will be much greater.”","Huang Yueli naturally understood what he meant.","A team of people fighting is definitely stronger than a single person.","If a single cultivator meets a team of cultivators like An Mingyan, 99% of them will have to escape for their lives.","Moreover, once he escaped a little slower, he would be eliminated on the spot.","Of course, this does not mean that the more people in the team, the better.","Bringing cultivators who are not strong enough in the team can only be a burden. Not only can it not improve the strength of the team, but it may also cause various variables.","Besides, there are only a thousand people who can pass the elimination round in the end!","One thousand people were selected out of hundreds of thousands, which was a one-in-one ratio.","After the safe area is reduced to a certain extent, the weaker members of the team will definitely be eliminated. When the time comes, whoever protects and who abandons will cause disputes.","Therefore, when forming a team, there should not be too many people, and all of them must be elites.","Huang Yueli thought for a while, then smiled, “I never thought that you, a heavenly genius of the Ancient God Clan, would invite a human cultivator like me to form a team.”","“You...” An Mingyan showed shock.","After he entered Paradise Island, he used some treasures to cover up his cultivation.","He initially thought that unless he met someone who knew him, he wouldn’t be seen through, but he didn’t expect that Huang Yueli would break down his facade in one sentence."]},{"number":4085,"title":"Chapter 4085 Trash Of The Human Clan (1)","paragraphs":["4085 Trash Of The Human Clan (1)","An Mingyan couldn’t help but look at Huang Yueli more highly.","To be able to judge his cultivation so accurately is either because her vision was very sharp, or because she possessed a rare treasure.","Regardless of the situation, it shows that Huang Yueli was not an ordinary cultivator.","An Mingyan looked Huang Yueli up and down, trying to guess her identity.","Although the cultivators of the human clan were generally not as talented as the Ancient Gods, they were superior in their numbers. The combined number of the twelve Ancient God Clans was only a few tenths of that of the human s.","Moreover, the understanding of the human clan was relatively high, which was a very obvious advantage.","With such a large base, the humans has also established several top forces. The talented cultivated by these forces may not be comparable to the Anceint God Clans in terms of talent, but in terms of strength, there were quite a few who could compete with the top geniuses of the God Clans.","“I don’t know, which force does this lady belong to, I really have no impression...”","An Mingyan pondered for a while, then gave up.","In his opinion, although Huang Yueli’s strength was not bad, there was still an obvious gap with a genius like him.","It’s no problem to form a temporary team, and he can still suppress her.","He showed a friendly smile towards Huang Yueli, “This lady, to be honest, among the cultivators I have met so far, there are not many cultivators who can compare with you. Our alliances and teams only depend on strength, not all are from the same clan. We have some from the human clan and some from the God Clans. Are you a resident of the God Realm? Why should you be so particular about it?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli looked at him with admiration.","During the time she came to the God Realm, almost all the cultivators from the God Clans she met looked down on the humans.","An Mingyan’s ability to say such words, no matter whether he was completely sincere or not, it also shows that he still has a heart.","An Mingyan saw that she was a little moved, and continued to persuade: “Besides, you can’t bring in too many pills in the elimination round. If you really encounter a more dangerous situation and you are alone, you can only choose to give up the competition. It will be different with us, three of my team are from the White Fen Clan, and our clan are all cultivators of the wood attribute who are good at healing and can save lives at critical moments!”","This point was definitely very tempting to ordinary cultivators.","There was a doctor in the team, and a doctor who can heal instantly during the battle, that’s the dream of all cultivators!","An Mingyan has three here at once!","If it was someone else, he would definitely not care about thinking about anything and agree to join without hesitation.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t attach much importance to these things.","She herself also has the wood attribute, so she can perform some simple healing techniques, which was usually enough, and she doesn’t really need the help of the White Fen Clan.","However, after thinking for a while, she nodded, “Alright, then I’ll join your team, let’s go together!”","She walks alone, no matter how low-key she is, she will inevitably be targeted by greedy people like just now.","If frequently forced to take action, her strength would be exposed eventually and will be easily besieged by others.","But following a team was different, especially when there was a master like An Mingyan in the team.","Ordinary cultivators definitely took a detour when they saw them, and relatively fewer dared to come up to provoke them, which would save her a lot of trouble.","An Mingyan showed joy on his face, “Alright, please follow me!”"]},{"number":4086,"title":"Chapter 4086 Trash Of The Human Clan (2)","paragraphs":["4086 Trash Of The Human Clan (2)","“By the way, I haven’t had time to ask for this lady’s name?”","Huang Yueli said casually, “Oh, my name is Li Yuehuang.”","“Li Yuehuang?” Hearing this name, An Mingyan couldn’t help frowning slightly.","What a name, she’s such a good-looking lady, yet she has such an awkward name, that sounds like a man!","Huang Yueli chuckled, and said nonsense, “When I was young, I was relatively thin. People said that I had to be called a boy’s name in order to survive. No...that’s pretty accurate.”","“Oh, so that’s the case!” An Mingyan nodded, not sure if he believed it.","After a while, he inquired again: “Then...Young Miss Li, which faction are you from?”","“I’m not from any great power. I just cultivated alongside with my parents and Elders since I was a child. This is the first time I have left my hometown and come to such a far place! Sigh, Floating Sea is such a lively place, there are so many people ! In the small village where I was born, there are not as many people living in the same courtyard as Floating Sea!” Huang Yueli said seriously.","Although An Mingyan was a well-informed Ancient God Clan genius, he was taken aback by her.","Not long after, they came to a clearing in the forest.","In the open space, two men and two women were sitting together.","Seeing An Mingyan approaching, everyone showed excitement and stood up.","“Young Master Mingyan, you are back! You have been away for so long, we are all a little worried.” A pretty girl in a blue dress was the first to greet him enthusiastically.","An Mingyan nodded at her, “Young Miss Meng, please worry about it. This time I went a little farther, and there was an accident on the way, so I wasted some time.”","It was only now that Young Miss Meng saw that there was a person behind An Mingyan, her expression suddenly changed, her gaze that landed on Huang Yueli was very unkind.","“Young Master Mingyan, who is this?”","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows when she heard her blunt words.","Tsk tsk, this Young Miss Meng seems to have an unusual liking for An Mingyan, otherwise, she wouldn’t be so disgusted with the women around An Mingyan.","An Mingyan had an upright face, as if he didn’t notice anything unusual at all, he was still gentle and polite, and introduced Huang Yueli to his teammates.","“Everyone, this Young Miss Li Yuehuang, I met when I was exploring in the woods just now. I happened to see Young Miss Li make a move and knocked out a cultivator from the Empyrean Fox Clan. She is not weak, just as we are still short of manpower, I invited her to join our team and walk along with us.”","Hearing this, the four people present all frowned, with a hint of resistance in their eyes.","“This... Young Master Mingyan, isn’t this a little thoughtless? Although there are many strong people, but that doens’t mean the more people in the team, the better!” A slightly obese cultivator said with a scowl.","“That’s right, this... Young Master Mingyan, why don’t you discuss it with everyone first before making such a decision?”","“We are together, and it is easy to attract the attention of other Ancient God Clan teams. It may not be a good thing for Young Miss Li to follow us. Maybe it is not as safe as walking alone!”"]},{"number":4087,"title":"Chapter 4087 Trash Of The Human Clan (3)","paragraphs":["4087 Trash Of The Human Clan (3)","Several people spoke one after another, and although they spoke from different angles, they all expressed their opposition to Huang Yueli’s joining.","Huang Yueli shook her head secretly, feeling that she might have made this trip in vain.","Seeing An Mingyan’s gentle, polite and personable manner, she thought that An Mingyan’s teammates were similar to him.","Now, it seems that she was thinking too simply!","During the elimination round, the locations where everyone teleported in were random. Even if An Mingyan was a well-connected cultivator, it was impossible for them to be randomly placed together.","These so-called teammates should be cultivators from the same clan or forces with a relatively close relationship. They were formed together when they met temporarily. They are probably not familiar with each other, and naturally they will not agree with each other.","If so many people object, she probably won’t be able to stay in this team.","It’s a pity, at first she thought she could save some trouble by mixing in.","Huang Yueli was already ready to leave, but who knows, when An Mingyan heard these objections, the smile on his face suddenly disappeared, and his always gentle expression became serious.","“Guys, I personally invited Young Miss Li to join our team. You are driving her away without asking any questions. Are you deliberately against me? Have you ever thought about how unhappy Young Miss Li will be when she hears these words? Anyway, that’s all I have to say. Young Miss Li’s strength is what I have seen with my own eyes. She will not hold back the team. I will definitely keep her in the team. If anyone doesn’t want to follow me, they can leave here , I will never stop it!”","As soon as these words came out, the four Ancient God Clan cultivators were all stunned.","No one expected that An Mingyan would suddenly become so tough.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but look at him with admiration.","This kid was not only talented, but also has a strong leadership ability that’s very rare in the White Fen Clan. It seems that he was a very promising person!","Several cultivators wanted to continue to oppose, but after seeing An Mingyan’s firm gaze, they softened one by one.","Although they were all from the Ancient God Clan, the disparity in strength was huge.","An Mingyan is one of the most outstanding heaven-level geniuses of the White Fen Clan, and his strength will absolutely crush any one of them.","It’s hard to say how far they can go without An Mingyan.","Only by following this team can they hope to enter the next match.","Seeing that everyone had shut their mouths, An Mingyan nodded and turned to Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, I was really sorry just now...”","“Young Master Mingyan! You... you actually threatened us in such a manner! We are also doing it for your own good. This is the first match of the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and it is not an ordinary experience. It is possible to enter the battle at any time! With such a person, everyone’s safety will be affected! Young Master Mingyan, you may be so fascinated by her because you see that she is so beautiful!”","An Mingyan was just about to apologise to Huang Yueli, when Young Miss Meng couldn’t help but stand up and said aloud.","As she spoke, she cast Huang Yueli several unkind glances.","An Mingyan frowned, “Young Miss Meng...”","Before he could say anything, the fat cultivator pulled Young Miss Meng from behind, “Enough, Yue’er, stop talking!”","“Brother, what are you pulling me for?” Young Miss Meng frowned.","“Young Master Mingyan has already made a decision, and it’s useless for you to object, it can only make him feel disgusted!” The fat cultivator said."]},{"number":4088,"title":"Chapter 4088 Trash Of The Human Clan (4)","paragraphs":["4088 Trash Of The Human Clan (4)","A look of struggle flashed in Young Miss Meng’s eyes, but seeing the obvious displeasure on An Mingyan’s face, she became a little uneasy.","She glared at Huang Yueli again, and walked away reluctantly.","In this way, despite some twists and turns, Huang Yueli finally joined An Mingyan’s team and became the most unpopular member of the team.","The few of them had rested enough, and after getting to know Huang Yueli for a while, they felt that they would continue to set off and head towards the centre.","The Ancient God Clan cultivators in the team were obviously unwilling to talk to Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli naturally knew very well that the biggest reason these people ignored her was that they looked down on human cultivators. Even though An Mingyan repeatedly emphasised that her strength was very good, these Ancient God Clan cultivators were always arrogant. Before they saw her make a move, they wouldn’t believe it.","They probably already decided that An Mingyan decided to bring her along because she was young and beautiful and some even felt sorry for her.","Huang Yueli didn’t care about this at all.","If these people were too enthusiastic about her and kept asking questions, she wouldn’t know how to answer them!","It’s not good to lie to others, but if she tells the truth, no one will believe it!","Since it was like this, no one cared about her, she could happily follow the team without much effort.","However, she walked around and eavesdropped, and she roughly figured out the composition of the team.","Captain An Mingyan was indeed one of the famous heaven-level geniuses of the White Fen Clan. Not only was his talent outstanding, but he was already an earth-level pharmacist at a young age. In terms of the level of elixir skills, Liu Shuzhi may not be able to tell. Down.","He was really the proud son of the God Realm.","As for his two clansmen, their strength was relatively ordinary, and they were all just earth-level geniuses.","However, they were very lucky. In such a round, they actually met with the genius that their clan had worked hard to cultivate. An Mingyan had to give them a hand as they were from the same clan.","The other two, Young Miss Meng and the fat cultivator were both from the Ice Snake Clan. They were a pair of brothers and sisters. The younger sister was called Meng Yue’er, and the older brother is called Meng Qixing.","Although Meng Qixing was not as outstanding as An Mingyan, he was still a genius at the top of the sky and belongs to the second echelon of the family.","The Ice Snake Clan and the White Fen Clan have always had a lot of contacts, and they were very close to each other, and even marriages often occur between the clans.","An Mingyan valued Meng Qixing’s strength and took the initiative to lure him into the group, and Meng Yue’er also followed.","“This pair of brothers and sisters are really lucky, they can be together despite being sent randomly!”","Huang Yueli felt a little envious.","It would be great if her husband could be with her.","In terms of fighting, she doesn’t need Li Moying’s help, she can handle it easily by herself.","However, this competition was really too boring. It will take seven days for the poisonous mist to completely spread.","In other words, it will take seven days before the candidates for the next match can be determined.","Ughh, how boring!","If Li Moying was by her side, she would be able to cheer up, at least looking at his handsome face would also refresh her mind!","Just as she was dreaming in a daze, someone suddenly patted her heavily on the shoulder.","“Hey, the one surnamed Li!”","Hearing Meng Yue’er’s high-spirited voice, Huang Yueli frowned.","Meng Yue’er sneaked up on her like this, her instinctive reaction was to knock her out!","Fortunately, she remembered that she was in the team in time and controlled herself."]},{"number":4089,"title":"Chapter 4089 Trash Of The Human Clan (5)","paragraphs":["4089 Trash Of The Human Clan (5)","Huang Yueli glanced at Meng Yue’er without any expression before she turned around and prepared to leave.","In the first place, everyone was barely behaving like a team, moreover, she wasn’t interested in talking nonsense with someone who was obviously finding fault with her.","However, Meng Yue’er didn’t let her go at all, and turned in front of Huang Yueli with one stride, blocking her way.","“Hey you, the one whose surname is Li, didn’t you hear this lady calling you? Why didn’t you reply? Are you humans all so rude?” Meng Yue’er raised her chin and glanced at Huang Yueli with disdain.","Huang Yueli chuckled, “I’m overwhelmed, Young Miss Meng, if you say that I was rude, I can’t compare to you, someone who is from the Ancient God Clan! You just addressed me as ‘the one whose surname is Li’, if people who didn’t know, they’d think it came from some shrew who came from the slums who’s talking!”","“You——! What did you say? You said I was a shrew?” Meng Yue’er was so angry that she almost jumped up, glaring at Huang Yueli, wanting to hit someone.","Huang Yueli didn’t move, her voice was still very calm, “Looking at you now, did I say something wrong?”","“You...” Meng Yue’er choked suddenly.","She had already clenched her fists, ready to give this human a lesson.","But now, Huang Yueli has run over her.","If she is really an adult, wouldn’t she really take her seat and become the shrew she calls?","Meng Yue’er was in a dilemma for a while, Huang Yueli didn’t bother to talk to her, raised her hand, trying to push her away, “Alright, please make room for me! Didn’t you see that other people have already walked to the front? Beware of falling behind!”","Only then did Meng Yue’er regain her senses, and remembered the purpose of coming to find Huang Yueli.","“Li Yuehuang, I warn you, stay away from Young Master Mingyan! Don’t think that you can hook up with Young Master Mingyan just because you are pretty! What is Young Master Mingyan’s identity? Speaking out will scare you to death! He is one of the most respected talents, not something you can climb up to!”","“I’ve seen a lot of human women like you who want to climb high. They’re all daydreams! At most, you’re just a bed warmer with no name or title. Young Master Mingyan took you in this time, but it’s simply because he is kind-hearted, he just takes pity on you, so don’t be too sentimental!”","She warned Huang Yueli aggressively.","After hearing this, Huang Yueli didn’t show any embarrassment as Meng Yue’er expected, but couldn’t help but curl her lips into a smile.","Meng Yue’er couldn’t help feeling panicked when she looked into her eyes.","“You... What are you looking at me for?”","She was just a cultivator of the human clan, why was the aura in her eyes so scary?","Huang Yueli smiled calmly and said, “I can’t climb up to An Mingyan, what about you? Young Miss Meng from the Ice Snake Clan, can you make Young Master Mingyan look at you differently?”","Meng Yue’er never expected that not only was Huang Yueli not frightened by her threats, but instead she looked calm and exposed her inner thoughts.","A blush of embarrassment suddenly appeared on her face, “You... want you to take care of it? What do you know?”","Huang Yueli clasped her arms around her chest, and said calmly, “If I’m not mistaken, your brother is still a genius with some strength in the Ice Snake Clan, but you are far behind, right? Seems like, you’re not considered a good match with Young Master Mingyan?”","“You... What are you talking nonsense about?”","Meng Yue’er suddenly became angry when she stepped on her sore spot."]},{"number":4090,"title":"Chapter 4090 Trash Of The Human Clan (6)","paragraphs":["4090 Trash Of The Human Clan (6)","With Meng Yue’er’s natural strength and status in the family, it was indeed impossible to come into contact with a genius like An Mingyan.","Although top heaven-level geniuses were not as rare as god-level geniuses, they were definitely at the top of the training list of the first echelon in the family.","This was absolutely beyond the reach of an earth-level cultivator like Meng Yue’er.","It is also because of this that after Meng Yue’er met An Mingyan on Paradise Island this time, she took the initiative to stick to him, trying to please him in every way.","Because, she knew very well in her heart that if she wanted to marry such an honourable cultivator, this was her only chance.","That’s why when Huang Yueli, who suddenly appeared and was so beautiful, became a thorn in her flesh.","“Hey you, with the surname Li, stop talking nonsense here. I am at least from the Ancient God Clan, with a clean family background, and a brother who is a heaven-level genius! Our Ice Snake Clan and White Fen Clan have always been friends and often intermarried. I naturally have much more hope than you!” Meng Yue’er said through gritted teeth.","What she said was very firm and loud.","She herself did not know if it was to convince Huang Yueli, or to convince herself.","Huang Yueli shook her head amusedly, “Alright, if you think there is hope, there is hope, and it’s none of my business. I’m not interested in An Mingyan, please don’t bother me again.”","“You’re not interested in Young Master Mingyan? Who would believe you? You were standing and talking with him so intimately yesterday!” Meng Yue’er didn’t believe it at all.","Huang Yueli shrugged, “If you don’t believe it, don’t believe it. Why should I care? Get out of the way, I’m leaving!”","After finishing speaking, she didn’t look at Meng Yue’er again, and directly used her skills to bypass her.","Meng Yue’er was startled by her sudden move and was taken aback for a moment.","Obviously, she didn’t expect that a human cultivator could have such a high agility. She didn’t even see the opponent’s movements clearly, and she disappeared.","After she reacted, she became even more angry.","“What the hell! It’s just a trash of the human race. If it weren’t for Young Master Mingyan’s kindness, she would have been eliminated by now! Our team protected her, and she didn’t even have a heart of gratitude! Hmph, Sooner or later, I will show her some colours!”","Seeing that the others had disappeared without a trace, Meng Yue’er could only stamp her feet and chase after them.","Huang Yueli followed this team and walked on for three days.","The poisonous mist spreads out every hour, forcing the cultivators on the island to gather towards the central area.","So, as time went by, they encountered more and more cultivators on the road.","However, the deterrent force of An Mingyan’s team is indeed very strong. Along the way, very few teams dare to provoke them.","A single martial artist, seeing their six-person team, would have no time to escape, so naturally they would come to their door without eyesight to send them to death.","Most of the cultivators in the team are knowledgeable. Once they saw the aura of An Mingyan and others, they knew that this team was not easy to mess with, and they would take the initiative to avoid them.","Only a very small number of teams who don’t have a clue in their minds, or those who feel that they have a large number of people and can crush a team of six with crowd tactics, will run over to provoke them.","Of course, their ending was also very tragic.","An Mingyan looks gentle, but the moment he shoots, it was very powerful and often sends these people out of the game in a few breaths."]},{"number":4091,"title":"Chapter 4091 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise? (1)","paragraphs":["4091 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise? (1)","In this way, the team marched on safely for three days.","By this time, the poisonous mist had actually occupied more than half of Paradise Island.","The battles encountered by the six-member team also became more frequent.","However, Huang Yueli never made a move from the beginning to the end, and stayed at the back of the team.","At the beginning, she actually thought about whether she wanted to fight a little bit and fulfil the obligations of a team member a little bit.","But later, she realised that she really didn’t need to do anything extra.","Because the cultivators in the team all like to show off, as if they were afraid that others would not see that they were very strong, so they all scrambled to make a move.","Huang Yueli was happy to have some leisure time, so she just watched the play on the sidelines.","Of course, Meng Yue’er couldn’t understand her like this, and she would taunt her from time to time: “Tsk tsk, you can actually follow us with a peace of mind? You don’t even want to lift a finger! But that’s right, with your fighting power, I guess you can’t fight against any Ancient God Clan cultivator casually. Anyone of us can knock you out of the game, and you can’t even take a single move! It’s better to stay away!”","“I really don’t know what Young Master Mingyan thinks. With you as a drag, our combat effectiveness has not improved at all, not to mention, there is an extra burden!”","Meng Qixing couldn’t take it anymore, and couldn’t help but give his sister a stern warning, “Yue’er, stop talking!”","“Am I not right?” Meng Yue’er raised her chin unconvinced.","Meng Qixing looked at his spoiled younger sister and said with a wry smile: “Yes, you are right! But, what will Young Master Mingyan think when he hears it?”","“Young Master Mingyan might have regretted taking this person a long time ago! It’s just that he’s an upright person, so he’s too embarrassed to go back on his word. If I help him drive this woman away, maybe Young Master Mingyan will thank me too!”","“Oh, you...don’t worry about it.” Meng Qixing frowned.","At this moment, there was a sound of footsteps in the woods ahead.","Meng Qixing quickly made a silent gesture to Meng Yue’er.","Then, he told her and Huang Yueli to hurry up and catch up with the three White Fen Clan cultivators at the front of the team.","When An Mingyan saw them, he lowered his voice and said, “Qixing, did you hear the footsteps on the other side? It sounds like the other side’s strength is not weak!”","Meng Qixing nodded, “Yes, the strength is very strong, and the number is no less than ours, there should be six!”","An Mingyan said: “Judging from their aura, they are probably the most combative White Tiger Clan. If this is the case, we will be in big trouble today!”","His face looked a little solemn.","Along the way here, in fact, only half of the elimination round had just passed.","As one of the top ten geniuses in the clan, it would be a very shameful thing if he were to be eliminated here.","So, if he meets a strong opponent here, things will be very troublesome.","“I hope that the other party is like us, and wants to reach the central area safely first, and will not take the initiative to provoke a fight.” An Mingyan said.","It’s a pity that although his wish was beautiful, it is just a fantasy.","While they were discussing, a loud man’s voice came from the other side of the woods: “Hey, over there, what are you mumbling about? Have you discussed it? Hiding in the woods, you want to learn how to be a tortoise and shrink into its shell? If you are afraid of us, you can jump into the poisonous mist by yourself, and it will save us a lot of effort.”","An Mingyan’s expression changed."]},{"number":4092,"title":"Chapter 4092 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(2)","paragraphs":["4092 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(2)","Even if An Mingyan doesn’t want to cause trouble, he was still one of the top geniuses of the Ancient God Clans.","He has been called a shrinking tortoise, it was definitely impossible for him to continue hiding.","He coughed heavily, and said: “The friend on the other side really knows how to joke. Why do we have to hide? It’s you who should really be more careful. You didn’t even see who your opponent is and say such provocative words. Aren’t you afraid of getting yourself into big trouble?”","“Hahahaha, I’m afraid of getting into trouble? If you are really capable and send me out, I won’t say anything! Unfortunately, unless you are Li Moying from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, otherwise... if you want to send me out, I’m afraid It’s simply impossible!”","In the woods, An Mingyan and the others turned pale when they heard this.","“What’s going on? This voice sounds familiar? Could it be... him?”","“No way? We can’t be so unlucky, can we?”","“If it’s really that person, our team will probably be eliminated today!”","“What’s even more unfortunate is that he’s not alone. He also has teammates. Even if we want to besiege him, we probably won’t be able to escape...”","Huang Yueli didn’t take it seriously at first, she just hid in a corner and sighed, her husband was really popular!","As the saying goes, the name of a person was the shadow of a tree!","Her husband was actually so famous that in a random battle on Paradise Island, the two sides shouted and even brought Li Moying’s name in.","It seems that after mentioning Li Moying, they would suddenly become very powerful!","After sighing, she noticed the conversation of her teammates. She couldn’t help leaning over and asked curiously, “Young Master Mingyan, who is the person on the other side? Why? Even you can’t handle it?”","Seeing her coming, Meng Yue’er was already unhappy, and when she heard her question again, she immediately showed disdain and sneered.","“Hehe, humans really don’t have any knowledge at all! Young Master Mingyan has already said just now that there should be cultivators of the White Tiger Clan on the opposite side, and the other party’s tone of voice is so arrogant, so it can only be the one of the strongest person in combat at the helm of the White Tiger Clan Genius——Jing Shaojue!”","“Jing Shaojue? What’s his relationship with Jing Shaoyuan?” Huang Yueli blinked and could not help but ask.","She suddenly remembered that when Li Moying and Li Moying were in Empyrean Fox Continent, they seemed to have met Jing Shaoyuan, a cultivator known as the number one master of the White Tiger Clan.","At that time, this Jing Shaoyuan was so abused by her husband that he couldn’t lift his head. Even his fiancee was slapped in the face by her.","Alas, now that she thought back about it, it was really pitiful.","Meng Yue’er laughed exaggeratedly: “It’s not easy, it’s not easy! You actually know Jing Shaoyuan! Jing Shaoyuan is the number one genius of the White Tiger Clan! For this God Realm’s Grand Meet, he’ll surely enter the top ten Masters. Jing Shaojue is his younger brother, his talent is not much worse than his, and he is also the best among heavenly geniuses!”","“Oh...”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli suddenly lost interest.","After working on it for a long time, the guy on the other side was not as good as Jing Shaoyuan, was he? That’s definitely not a master, it’s boring, and it’s not worth her making a move herself.","“Then Young Master Mingyan should be about the same strength as him, right? Why are you so worried?”","Meng Yue’er said angrily: “Are you really stupid? The White Fen Clan is of the wood attribute and has strong healing power, but its attack power is the last among all the Ancient God Clans! The White Tiger Clan is different, with strong metal attributes, their combat power is second only to the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan!”"]},{"number":4093,"title":"Chapter 4093 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(3)","paragraphs":["4093 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(3)","Huang Yueli rubbed her chin, thoughtfully, “So it’s like this...”","Speaking of which, it was a moment of negligence on her part, she didn’t think of it.","Her Senior Brother Liu Buyan was actually not very powerful in combat, but when he was in the Lower Realm, his cultivation base crushed his peers, so the disadvantage in terms of attributes was not so obvious.","Once in the God Realm, things were a little different.","Seeing her disapproving look, Meng Yue’er couldn’t help but sneered coldly: “You understand now? Country bumpkin! If you don’t understand, don’t talk nonsense here, just hide away! You can’t help anyway, come on at such a time, just don’t get in the way and influence Young Master Mingyan!”","Huang Yueli ignored her, but went directly to An Mingyan.","“Young Master Mingyan, how is the discussion going?”","She totally ignored Meng Yue’er, and this infuriated her so much.","Who did this woman think she was? After being warned by her, she still dared to ask Young Master Mingyan to ask him about everything. She didn’t think about her own strength, and she still made trouble here!","Even if Young Master Mingyan has a good personality and loves her, but at such a critical moment, how can he have the time to pay attention to her?","She was so annoyed!","It won’t be long, she will definitely be chased away by Young Master Mingyan!","However, when An Mingyan heard Huang Yueli’s voice, he was not as displeased as Meng Yue’er imagined.","He looked at Huang Yueli, and said politely: “Oh, Young Miss Li, we are in big trouble this time! I didn’t expect to provoke Jing Shaojue, that evil star! Now that our two teams are so close, we definitely won’t be able to run away, but if we really want to fight, we are definitely not opponents, and it seems that we must be eliminated.”","“Speaking of which, it’s because I invited you along the way. If it weren’t for following my team and the goal’s too obvious, you wouldn’t have encountered such troubles, and you wouldn’t have been eliminated so early.”","Others don’t know about Huang Yueli’s ability, but An Mingyan has indeed seen Huang Yueli’s attack with his own eyes.","Although, in An Mingyan’s opinion, Huang Yueli’s cultivation was definitely not as good as his, but Huang Yueli’s combat skills still left a deep impression on him.","It can be seen that Huang Yueli belongs to the combat faction.","Such people usually have special means of hiding and escaping in such complex terrain as the dense forest, they were very difficult to deal with.","It is also often possible to find another way in such a large-scale knockout competition, and become a dark horse in the end.","Meng Yue’er’s eyes widened when she heard the conversation between the two, thinking she had heard it wrong.","Huang Yueli didn’t even look at her, and continued to say to An Mingyan: “Young Master Mingyan, you are overthinking. I just heard someone say that this Young Master Jing Shaojue’s status in the clan is similar to yours, the strength should be about the same, you haven’t fought yet, how do you know you will lose?”","An Mingyan waved his hand, “Young Miss Li, you don’t know something...”","Huang Yueli interrupted him, “I know that wood attribute cultivators have disadvantages, but now it’s a team battle, not a single fight. If we cooperate with each other, we may not be unable to win. Besides, the opponent seems to be getting impatient, just respond directly!”","Hearing this, Meng Yue’er finally couldn’t bear it any longer. She stood up and said, “Li Yuehuang, what right do you have to dictate here and influence Young Master Mingyan’s decision? With your strength, what do you know?”"]},{"number":4094,"title":"Chapter 4094 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(4)","paragraphs":["4094 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(4)","“Young Miss Meng!” An Mingyan frowned, and said sharply, “Young Miss Li is my distinguished guest, you are not allowed to speak of her like that!”","Meng Yue’er’s eyes widened. She couldn’t believe that An Mingyan would say that about her!","This was not the time when they were in a safe situation before!","The battle with Jing Shaojue’s team is just around the corner. In terms of combat effectiveness, although she, Meng Yue’er, was not very good, she was still a hundred times stronger than that delicate Young Miss Li, right?","An Mingyan actually chose to defend Huang Yueli, not her!","Could it be that he was really fascinated by the face of this human vixen?","“Brother...” Meng Yue’er turned to Meng Qixing for help.","However, Meng Qixing didn’t stand by her side either, but glared at her, frowned and said, “What kind of situation is it? See what the other party has to say before you can deal with it.”","An Mingyan nodded, and accepted the suggestion decisively.","He raised his voice and shouted: “Alright, friends, we didn’t want to cause trouble at first, but since you insist on fighting with us, then we are not afraid of trouble! We are just waiting here! How do you compare? Come on!”","As soon as he finished speaking, several figures slowly walked out from the woods.","Huang Yueli glanced quickly.","The six people on the opposing team had the same number as their side.","Therefore, neither side has a numerical advantage, so they can only rely on strength.","Among these six people, the very arrogant looking young man standing in the middle should be Jing Shaojue.","He resembled at least 70% of his Elder brother Jing Shaoyuan and both have red hair, which was very conspicuous in the crowd.","After just one glance, Huang Yueli quickly made a judgement.","Jing Shaojue’s strength was indeed very strong. Although his real cultivation may only be at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm, he indeed had an aura as like a sharp blade, which can be felt even at such a long distance.","His profound strength attribute was very special, and, obviously, he has worked hard on his fighting skills.","Moreover, Jing Shaojue was not the only master in this team.","There were two young cultivators of the White Tiger Clan beside him. Judging from the aura on their bodies, their strength was not weak. Although they may not be as strong as An Mingyan, it was definitely easy to defeat a cultivator of Meng Qixing’s level. Dealing with the rest of their team was even more effortless!","“Tsk tsk, it seems that An Mingyan and the others are really in trouble!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help shaking her head.","No wonder Jing Shaojue’s attitude was so arrogant just now. Of course, it’s because he does have the capital to be arrogant!","Huang Yueli was not the only one who realised this.","In order to intimidate An Mingyan’s team, Jing Shaojue and the others deliberately exposed their aura, so that people can see at a glance how strong they are!","A cultivator with ordinary strength like Meng Yue’er also understood what they were about to face, and her face suddenly turned pale.","In contrast, An Mingyan seemed much calmer.","Although he also felt in his heart that his team must be in danger, he didn’t show any fear because of this.","An Mingyan cupped his hands at Jing Shaojue, “It turns out that it’s the son of the White Tiger Clan. Speaking of which, we still have such a fateful encounter!”"]},{"number":4095,"title":"Chapter 4095 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(5)","paragraphs":["4095 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(5)","Jing Shaojue narrowed his eyes, stared at An Mingyan for a long while before his face finally showed an expression of revelation.","“I was still wondering who you were! So you are from the White Fen Clan... An Mingyan, right? Yes, that’s right! I remember you came to our White Tiger Continent last year, when our clan had a competition. How many moves did the geniuses compete with each other! At that time, I was really surprised that none of you could win!”","Hearing what he said, the two white tiger clan cultivators beside him also laughed maliciously.","“Haha, it is said that the White Fen Clan is the weakest of the ancient Ancient God Clans. I didn’t really believe it! I didn’t expect that they could not win even a game between the geniuses of the two clans?”","“It’s a pity, it’s a pity. When the White Fen Clan came last time, I couldn’t get a rank in the top 20 in the clan, so I didn’t get to see that competition. Otherwise, I can also see how ‘powerful’ the White Fen Clan is!”","Jing Shaojue chuckled, and said, “What’s the pity then? Isn’t today an opportunity? This Young Master Mingyan in front of us is one of the most outstanding geniuses of the White Fen Clan! His status in the clan is no less than mine. .But...in terms of combat power, maybe he can’t beat any of you!”","Speaking of this, he seemed to have suddenly remembered that An Mingyan was on the side, and said exaggeratedly: “Oh, yes, I’m sorry. Young Master Mingyan, you won’t be angry because I told the truth? Actually, I respect the White Fen Clan very much, after all, all of your clan are all Spirit Medicine Masters! However, the competition in the God Realm is not about medical skills, it all depends on strength, this is really not the place you should come to!”","He looked behind An Mingyan again, “Haha, there are actually two Ice Snakes! The Ice Snakes are a little stronger than the White Fen Clan, but unfortunately, these two in your team are trash! And another one, let me see...ha ha ha ha ha...”","Jing Shaojue’s gaze fell on Huang Yueli, and he couldn’t help it, so he burst out laughing.","“What’s going on, An Mingyan, why do you still have humans in your team? No matter how weak you are, with your title of a Spirit Medicine Master, you won’t even be able to find a teammate? You still have humans on your team? However, if you take a closer look, this girl is pretty enough, tsk tsk... You came all this way to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and you still care about women?”","All of An Mingyan’s teammates had been despised by him.","Except for Huang Yueli, everyone had an angry expression on their faces, wishing they could rush up on the spot and tear Jing Shaojue and the others to pieces.","Only Huang Yueli kept smiling, not knowing what she was thinking.","Even when Jing Shaojue ridiculed her for being a useless human who hooked up with An Mingyan by virtue of her beauty, she didn’t show any anger.","Huang Yueli has rich experience, so it was easy to see through it.","Jing Shaojue was a guy who was mean-spirited and aggressive, but he didn’t curse people for no reason.","Talking to stimulate the opponent before doing anything was also a strategy in itself.","Let the opponent gradually lose their minds under the irony and contempt, that has a lot of fighting power, and that person affected may only display sixty to seventy percent of their strength at most.","It seems that An Mingyan’s strength should not be as bad as Jing Shaojue said!"]},{"number":4096,"title":"Chapter 4096 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(6)","paragraphs":["4096 Do You Want To Shrink Like A Tortoise?(6)","Otherwise, Jing Shaojue probably wouldn’t waste time talking nonsense.","Wouldn’t it be much easier to just rush out and knock them all unconscious and throw them into the poisonous mist?","An Mingyan obviously saw this too, with a calm face, he glanced at Jing Shaojue, and said coldly: “Stop talking nonsense, I have never heard before that cultivators of the White Tiger Clan like to satirise others so much. Could it be that you are afraid of losing, so you deliberately said these words to embolden yourself?”","Jing Shaojue never expected him to be so calm, so he couldn’t help being stunned for a moment.","But soon, he sneered, “Do you think I’m afraid of you?”","“Since you are not afraid, let’s talk about it quickly. How are you going to decide the outcome with us? Or just fight casually? However, if you attack directly, it will not benefit both of us. I don’t think you are so foolish, right?” An Mingyan said.","When the two sides meet, they will fight directly. This, of course, was the easiest and most direct way to decide the winner.","However, for a team like them, it was the least cost-effective method.","Because, if you fight like this, it was impossible for the two sides to stop fighting until the last person in one team falls down.","In the case of a huge gap in strength, it doesn’t matter, the weaker side will soon be completely knocked down.","But now that the strength of the two sides is close, when the losing side is all down, it is estimated that there will be no more than two people left on the winning side.","Jing Shaojue snorted, and said, “Alright, then I won’t be foolish, let’s just say it! Let’s use the group arena rules to decide the winner. The rules are very simple. Each team will fight in order, and the winner will win. Every person in the team will take turns to fight, and the loser will be out, and when everyone in the team is out, then it’s considered that that team has lost! What do you think?”","An Mingyan frowned, but didn’t immediately agree.","“I want to discuss it with my teammates.”","“This trivial matter still needs to be discussed? Aren’t you the captain? It is said that the people of the White Fen Clan are indecisive and not like men. It seems that this is not a lie!”","An Mingyan ignored Jing Shaojue’s ridicule, turned around and returned to the team.","Everyone gathered together to discuss.","“The method of the group arena is not impossible. Speaking of it, it is fair.” An Mingyan first expressed his attitude, “What do you think?”","Meng Qixing thought for a while, then shook his head, “This... the group arena itself is fair, but for us, it is a complete disadvantage! Young Master Mingyan, think about it, there are three masters on the opposite side, and their strength is above us, that is to say, to beat their team, you need to beat the three of them consecutively! This...”","Meng Qixing didn’t have the nerve to say it clearly, but everyone understood the meaning.","With An Mingyan’s strength, it was no problem to deal with Jing Shaojue’s followers, but the consumption will definitely not be small.","After defeating two followers in a row, more than half of his profound strength has been consumed, and if he faces Jing Shaojue again, wouldn’t that be more ominous?","An Mingyan said: “That’s true, but now I can’t think of any other way. I can only force myself to try.”","Everyone discussed for a while, but they had no choice but to agree.","An Mingyan nodded, “Alright, then, let’s make arrangements and wait for the order of appearance.”","The teammates fell silent and listened to his arrangement.","The outcome of the group arena is not only related to strength, but also has a lot to do with the arrangement."]},{"number":4097,"title":"Chapter 4097 Order Of Appearance (1)","paragraphs":["4097 Order Of Appearance (1)","Generally speaking, the common arrangement was to have the weakest person to appear first, and the strongest to be the last.","This can ensure that when one’s own strength exceeds that of the opponent, they will not lose due to accidents.","This was a strategy commonly used by the dominant team.","However, in doing so, the disadvantages were also obvious.","If the strength of one’s own team was not very good, with such a step-by-step order, naturally there will only be one loss.","If faced with this situation in a formal match, the disadvantaged side would arrange the order of appearance according to the weakness of each cultivator in the opposing team.","But now, they met Jing Shaojue and others by accident, and they don’t know the specific strength of the other party. Naturally, such a tactic was impossible...","An Mingyan suddenly fell into a dilemma.","After hesitating for a while, he finally made up his mind, “There is no other way now, let’s place in order according to our strength! Anyway, the overall strength of our team is really not as good as that of the opponent. If we really lose, there is nothing we can do. If you fight well, even if you are eliminated, you will have an explanation to yourself!”","The teammates all turned pale and nodded silently.","In fact, everyone already had a hunch in their hearts that this match should be their last time on Paradise Island.","An Mingyan forced himself to calm down, and began to assign: “Young Miss Meng, you take the lead, An Qisheng, you are second, An Qiming, third, Young Master Meng, and then I invite you to play fourth, and then I have to trouble Young Miss Li...”","Before An Mingyan finished speaking, his teammates were already in an uproar.","Meng Yue’er couldn’t bear it anymore, stood up and said, “Young Master Mingyan, you... did you make a mistake? That Li Yuehuang, she is just a human race! How much strength does she have that you placed my brother before her? Isn’t this too childish?”","Just now, when An Mingyan placed her to be the first to battle, she felt a little uncomfortable in her heart.","Although An Mingyan was very careful and said that he was leading the battle, it still couldn’t change the fact that she was the first to appear!","What An Mingyan said before, the first one to appear was the one with the weakest strength in the team!","However, Meng Yue’er knew that her strength was indeed far behind Meng Qixing, and the two cultivators from the White Fen Clan beside An Mingyan seemed to have some strength.","So, although she was dissatisfied, she could only hold back.","But later, An Mingyan actually arranged for Huang Yueli to appear fifth! Just ahead of himself!","Even placed her further behind Meng Qixing’s position!","This made it completely unacceptable for Meng Yue’er!","Although the other cultivators in the team were not as angry as Meng Yue’er, they all felt that An Mingyan’s actions were too unreasonable, and they all protested.","“Young Master Mingyan, do you have any special intentions in making such an arrangement? Otherwise, it’s too unreasonable, right?”","“Isn’t it? This game is related to our survival in the elimination round! Although most of them may lose, isn’t there still a chance of survival? How can we give up now and arrange the order of appearance indiscriminately?”","“That’s right, Young Master Mingyan, this matter is no joke! I don’t know if Young Miss Li’s strength can match that of Young Miss Meng, or should I arrange for her to appear second?”"]},{"number":4098,"title":"Chapter 4098 Order Of Appearance (2)","paragraphs":["4098 Order Of Appearance (2)","After hearing this, Meng Yue’er almost vomited blood!","The person who said this was actually her own brother Meng Qixing!","Meng Qixing actually suggested to let that vixen play behind her. Could it be that he thinks that woman is stronger than her?","In fact, Meng Qixing didn’t think that much at all.","In his opinion, although the order of the first and second one was different, the effect was the same. They were all pure cannon fodder, there was really no difference in his eyes.","Therefore, in order to save An Mingyan’s face, it is not a big deal to arrange Huang Yueli as the second one, which was better than the first one.","Others in the team also nodded in agreement, urging An Mingyan to quickly change the order.","No one noticed the ugly expression on Meng Yue’er’s face.","Although they usually take good care of Meng Yue’er, but now it’s a serious life-and-death match! Who would care about Meng Yue’er’s little thoughts?","But who knows, after An Mingyan listened to everyone’s suggestions, his attitude was still very firm.","“I understand what you mean, but I think you really misunderstood! Who told you that Young Miss Li is very weak? Who told you that she is on par with Young Miss Meng? Since I arranged it this way, naturally I have my reason, but you all don’t want to believe it.”","Hearing An Mingyan’s words, everyone was stunned for a moment, and then looked at Huang Yueli in shock.","An Mingyan’s meaning is not difficult to understand at all. It is to explain that the strength of that extremely delicate-looking human girl was at least higher than that of Meng Qixing!","But, how’s this possible?","Although Meng Qixing’s strength is indeed far behind that of masters like An Mingyan and Jing Shaojue, but no matter what, he was still a heavenly genius from the ancient gods!","Among the cultivators of the humans, only those at the top can barely surpass him.","Can Young Miss Li have such strength? It’s unbelievable!","But it’s this time, and it’s impossible for An Mingyan to just tell lies to fool everyone...","For a moment, everyone had expressions of surprise and uncertainty.","Seeing that the crowd didn’t believe it, An Mingyan turned his head to look at Huang Yueli, and asked, “Young Miss Li, I arranged for you to appear on the fifth stage. You should be fine, right? No problem?”","He asked this question to reassure everyone.","Satisfied, Huang Yueli would definitely nod her head immediately, expressing her agreement, and giving everyone reassurance.","But to everyone’s expectation, Huang Yueli shook her head when she heard this!","“Young...Young Miss Li??”","This time, An Mingyan was stunned, unable to react, what did she mean by this?","He had seen Huang Yueli make a move with his own eyes. Judging from her explosive strength at that time, surpassing Meng Qixing was definitely a sure thing. Moreover, she definitely didn’t use her full strength. If she really made a move with all her strength, she would definitely be stronger.","With such fighting strength, why didn’t she dare to be the fifth?","Meng Yue’er sneered even more: “You still have a little self-knowledge! You are not stupid enough to continue to drag down our team! Well, you should be the first to take the shot, don’t be wordy...”","Before she could finish speaking, Huang Yueli suddenly said, “I’ll be the last one to appear.”","As soon as these words came out, everyone’s eyes widened and they stared at her, unable to recover for a long time.","“You... what did you say? The last one to appear?!” An Mingyan thought he heard it wrong!"]},{"number":4099,"title":"Chapter 4099 Order Of Appearance (3)","paragraphs":["4099 Order Of Appearance (3)","Huang Yueli nodded calmly, “That’s right, I’m the last one, and you are the fifth one. This arrangement is a little better.”","In fact, she was not so obsessed with the number of appearances.","Such a trivial matter was completely out of her scope of consideration.","In fact, she appearing first or last had exactly the same ending.","With her crushing strength, for someone like Jing Shaojue, she can beat ten of them at once. In her opinion, the team on the opposite side was really vulnerable!","However, she still doesn’t know if Huang Sanbai will think of another trick to deal with her, and she doesn’t want to expose the strength of a god-level genius too early.","So, she did not plan to be so exaggerated as to fight against a team alone.","It doesn’t matter if she was the last one, if An Mingyan was strong enough to kill Jing Shaojue by himself, it would save her a lot of effort.","If there was really no other way, if she insists on making a move, the one she has to deal with should be Jing Shaojue, who has suffered both losses after the duel with An Mingyan.","In this way, even if she defeated Jing Shaojue in a few strokes, she could still explain it and not stand out too much.","Her considerations were naturally inhumane.","So, as soon as her request came out, all her teammates were stunned.","What An Mingyan said just now, in fact, everyone somewhat guessed, knowing that Huang Yueli should still have some strength.","Maybe, she can really be a bit stronger than Meng Qixing!","Such strength is already considered outstanding among human cultivators.","But who knew, Huang Yueli didn’t know how to write words like modesty and shame. After An Mingyan complimented her a few words, she actually drifted away, and dared to say that she would be placed behind An Mingyan!","Did she make a mistake? Who does she think she was?","What kind of strength An Mingyan had, she who was a human cultivator, had no idea at all.","The frog in the well dares to speak such wild words before she has seen a real genius!","“You... What are you talking nonsense about? Are you out of your mind?” Meng Yue’er couldn’t believe that there is such a woman in the world!","The other cultivators also wanted to persuade them again.","But at this moment, Jing Shaojue and the others on the opposite side couldn’t wait any longer, and urged loudly, “Hey, it’s been a quarter of an hour, have you guys come up with any results after discussing it? Could it be that you deliberately wanted to delay the time?” Right? Think we’re idiots? That doesn’t work!”","An Mingyan gritted his teeth, and took one last look at Huang Yueli, “Young Miss Li, are you sure you want to be the last one to appear?”","Among all his teammates, he certainly believed in Huang Yueli the most.","Although he didn’t quite dare to believe that the strength of a human cultivator could surpass him.","However, he was very clear that if their team wanted to escape this catastrophe, their only hope was... what Huang Yueli said was true!","If she is really better than himself, Jing Shao is probably the one who will be unlucky today!","Huang Yueli nodded solemnly.","“Hey, the tortoise on the opposite side! Have you decided whether to stick out your head? If you don’t stick out, we’ll just kick ass!”","“These cowards must have been cowardly! Hahahahaha! I said a long time ago that the strength of the White Fen Clan and Ice Snake Clans should have long since ceased to exist. They are the waste of our Ancient God Clan!”","An Mingyan’s face turned livid.","After being scolded like this, who can bear it?"]},{"number":4100,"title":"Chapter 4100 Order Of Appearance (4)","paragraphs":["4100 Order Of Appearance (4)","He simply turned around and strode towards Jing Shaojue.","“Alright, stop talking nonsense there! It’s not proper for a cultivator of the Ancient God Clan to scold the street like a shrew on the street? We’ve already discussed it, let’s compete now!”","“Oh? Do you really want to compete?” Jing Shaojue showed an arrogant smile, “You really don’t regret it?”","The cultivator beside him laughed loudly and said, “Young Master Jue, you’re asking for nothing! Can they not compete? It’s not up to them to choose!”","“That’s true!” Jing Shaojue laughed loudly, “Whether or not there is a competition, they’ll also be out. Although the White Fen Clan and Ice Snake clans are trash, but they still have to be given some face, right? Don’t you think so too, Young Master Mingyan?”","An Mingyan was terribly angry, but the White Fen Clan was of the wood attribute, and most of them have a relatively peaceful personality. How could it be possible to scold people better than the White Tiger Clan, which has always been known for their arrogance and rudeness?","After holding back for a long time, he couldn’t hold back a few curse words, so he could only say: “Hurry up and start! Then the winner will be judged by the result of the competition! If we lose, we will take the initiative to enter the poisonous mist and withdraw. If you lose it’s...”","“Of course we will take the initiative to withdraw from the competition! Don’t worry, our White Tiger Clan values credibility the most, and if we lose, we will still resign. I, Jing Shaojue, can never afford to lose credibility!” Jing Shaojue said loudly.","An Mingyan nodded, “Alright, let’s start!”","Although there was no third party here as a witness, An Mingyan does not doubt the authenticity of Jing Shaojue’s words.","The White Tiger Clan’s arrogance was definite and was especially hated by others, but they really mean what they say.","This was the case with those with the metal attribute, they were very direct, most of them don’t even know how to turn a corner.","This was especially evident in Jing Shaojue. His Elder brother Jing Shaoyuan was not as straight-hearted as he is.","The teams on both sides moved back a little, and gave way to the open clearing before them as the venue for the competition.","The first competitors from both sides soon came to the centre of the arena.","On Jing Shaojue’s side, a cultivator from the Empyrean Fox clan appeared on the stage, facing Meng Yue’er.","The ending has no suspense at all.","Meng Yue’er herself did not cultivate very hard. This opportunity to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet was obtained through her brother’s face.","When she met an opponent who was stronger than her, she was defeated within two rounds.","Finally, for the sake of seeing that she was a girl, the other side didn’t hit her hard, but just forced her out of the competition field.","“In the first round, it looks like we won!” Jing Shaojue said casually.","An Mingyan didn’t speak, and continued to signal the second person on his side to come on stage.","The second match lasted a little longer, but in the end, An Mingyan lost again.","“Hehe, sorry, we won again!”","Hearing the smug voice from the opposite side, An Mingyan still tried his best to maintain his composure.","“An Qiming, you’re next!”","An Qiming glanced at An Qisheng who had just appeared on stage, feeling a little apprehensive.","He and An Qisheng’s strengths were not the same!","An Qisheng has lost, so what suspense can he have?","Because there was a little fear in his heart beforehand, when he made a move, he was timid. Instead, he couldn’t even display his true strength, and he was quickly defeated.","This time, Jing Shaojue laughed so hard that he couldn’t straighten up.","“No way? Our side only has made one appearance and defeated the three of you?”"]}]);
